anlom = (t:n) (w:sheaf/bundle) (d:an, grain, with lom, bundle: a bundle of cut grain stalks, such as the sheaf waved before the Lord) (e:siampipa in tua ~ veii ding hi/Topa mai-ah ~ veii ding hi | he shall wave the sheaf before the Lord/lo lai ah ~ na mangngilh uh ciangin | when you forget a sheaf in the field) (s:buhlom) (r:3.23.11/8.2.16/5.24.19) (q:draft)
anlomte = (t:n) (w:sheaves) (d:bundles of cut grain, anlom with the plural te) (e:~ lakah a kiate hong khawm sak in) (s:buhlomte/anphalte) (b:anlom) (r:8.2.7/8.2.15) (q:draft)
