bilngong = (t:adj) (w:deaf) (d:unable to hear, from bil, ear, and ngong, deaf) (e:kei pen ~ ka bang a/A pau thei lo, a ~ dawi aw | you deaf and mute spirit/gul ~ tawh kibang uh hi | they are like a deaf snake/Pasian’ thu-ah ~ na bang uh hi | you are like the deaf toward the word of God) (s:bengngong/ngong) (r:19.38.13/41.9.25/19.58.4/44.7.51) (q:draft)
