cite = (t:n) (w:those who say) (d:ci, say, with plural -te: the people who say something, placed after the words spoken, usually as a cite) (e:a ~ kua ahi hiam/a ~ in gimna ngah ta hen | woe to those who say so/hong ~ zahhuaina tawh maikhing sak in | may those who say it to me be put to shame) (b:ci) (r:9.11.12/19.70.3/23.29.15/19.40.15) (q:draft)
