ditkikna = (t:n) (w:restitution/repayment/compensation) (d:payment made to the owner for something lost, stolen or damaged; ditkikna bawl is make restitution) (e:amah in ~ bawl ding hi/a cing takin ~ bawl ding hi | he must make full restitution/amah in ~ bawl lo ding hi | he need not make restitution/a kibalzan ganhing ~ amah in bawl lo | he need not pay for the torn animal) (s:lohkikna/thukkikna) (r:2.22.12/2.22.14/2.22.6/2.22.15/2.22.13) (q:draft)
