dongsak = (t:v) (w:ask/inquire/have someone ask) (d:dong, ask, with sak: put a question to someone, or send someone to ask on one's behalf) (e:ci-in a ~ uh hi/nangma kiangah kote hong ~ hi | he sent us to you to ask/Kei’ tungah thu a hong ~ Judah kumpipa kiangah | to the king of Judah who sent you to inquire of me/ci-in a ~ hi | he sent them to ask) (b:dong) (r:40.22.17/42.7.20/24.37.7/42.7.19) (q:draft)
dongsim = (t:v) (w:ask privately/ask in secret) (d:dong, ask, with sim, secretly) (e:ci-in a ~ uh hi/ci-in a hong ~ hi | he asked me privately) (r:41.9.28/24.37.17) (q:draft)
dongtak = (t:prep) (w:up to/as far as) (d:dong, until, with tak, exactly: right up to an amount or point) (e:Sagihvei ~ maisak ding ka hi hiam) (b:dong) (r:40.18.21) (q:draft)
dongtakin = (t:prep) (w:right down to/even to) (d:dong, until, with takin: all the way to, of searching to the very depth) (e:a thutawng ~ a kankhia hi) (b:dong) (r:46.2.10) (q:draft, low confidence)
dongtangsak = (t:v) (w:hinder/obstruct/hold back) (d:put something in the way so that a person or a work is stopped; with the causative sak) (e:Kha Siangtho nasepna ~ kei unla/eite a hong ~ thei nate khempeuh | everything that can hinder us/Lungdamna Thu a ~ ka suahkhak loh nadingun | so that we may not become a hindrance to the gospel) (s:khaktan/nawngkaisak) (a:huh) (r:52.5.19/58.12.1/46.9.12) (q:draft)
