donkha = (t:v) (w:pay attention to/heed) (d:don, heed, with kha; donkha kei is neglect or fail to attend to) (e:Pasian it ding na ~ kei uh hi) (r:42.11.42) (q:draft)
donkik = (t:v) (w:care for again/attend to again) (d:don, care for, with kik, again; the verse says he will never care for them again) (e:a ~ nawnkei ding hi) (b:don) (r:19.28.5) (q:draft, low confidence)
