dotsakin = (t:v) (w:inquiring for/asking on behalf of) (d:dotsak, ask for someone else, with the linking suffix in) (e:ama a dingin Topa’ tungah thu ~) (b:dotsak) (r:9.22.10) (q:draft)
dotte = (t:n) (w:those consulted/advisers) (d:dot, ask, with the plural te; mipil thu dotte are the wise men whose counsel is asked) (e:Babilon mipil thu ~ ukpipa dingin) (s:thudotte) (b:dot) (r:27.2.48) (q:draft, low confidence)
dottel = (t:v) (w:examine/investigate/question closely) (d:dot, ask, with tel, clearly: question until the matter is clear) (e:note in na ~ khit uh ciangin) (s:kantel) (r:44.25.26) (q:draft)
dozawh = (t:v) (w:be able to fight) (d:do, fight, with zawh, form of zo, be able; used before nading) (e:Hoihtakin gal na ~ nadingin) (r:54.1.18) (q:draft)
