duhduhin = (t:adv) (w:as one pleases/to one's heart's content) (d:duhduh, whatever one craves, with the suffix in: eating and drinking as much as one likes) (e:~ a ne note in gimna/i ~ an ne zu ne-in nuamtakin om ni | let us eat and drink as we please and be merry) (s:duhduha/ututin) (b:duhduh) (r:30.6.4/46.15.32) (q:draft)
duhgawh = (t:v) (w:crave/covet/long for) (d:want something too strongly, said of food and of what belongs to other people) (e:mite’ neihsa na ~ kei ding uh hi/Amau anlimte hong ~ sak kei ta in | do not let me crave their delicacies/a an limte uh ~ kha kei in | do not crave his delicacies/Vokte’ begap nekte nangawn a ~ ciang dongin | until he craved even the pods the pigs ate) (s:deihgawh/iplah/duhluat) (r:52.4.12/19.141.4/20.23.6/42.15.16) (q:draft)
duhgawhin = (t:adv) (w:greedily/longingly/with craving) (d:duhgawh, crave, with the suffix in: with strong craving) (e:begapte nangawn ~ a nekpih nuam hi/a neih a lam ~ a deihgawh hi | they greedily long for his wealth) (s:huaihamin) (b:duhgawh) (r:42.15.16/18.5.5) (q:draft)
duhgawhkha = (t:v) (w:crave/covet) (d:duhgawh, crave, with kha, happen to: come to crave something, said of food in the warning duhgawhkha kei un, do not crave) (e:a anlimte uh ~ kei un) (s:duhgawh) (r:20.23.6) (q:draft, low confidence)
