Elzafan = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Elzaphan) (d:Levite, son of Uzziel and cousin of Moses and Aaron) (r:2.6.22)
em = (t:v) (w:bake/roast) (d:cook bread or other food by dry heat, in an oven or over coals; ki-em is baked) (e:an ~ dingin la ding hi/moh sawm-le-nih bawlin ~ in | make twelve loaves and bake them/a aam tungah moh zong ka ~ a | I also baked bread on its coals/silngo sawhloh moh ~ uh hi | they baked unleavened bread) (r:9.8.13/3.7.9/3.24.5/23.44.19/2.12.39) (q:draft)
emek = (t:see) <Beth-emek>
