emerald = (t:n) (c:stone) (w:emerald) (d:green precious stone, a loanword from English; in Exodus the NIV has turquoise for this stone) (e:~ suang, sapfeiros suang leh diamond suang/a lina in ~ suangmanpha | the fourth emerald/~ suangmanpha meel tawh kibang sakhituihup | a rainbow that looked like an emerald) (r:2.39.11/66.4.3/66.21.19) (q:draft)
Emerald = (t:n) (c:stone) (w:emerald) (d:emerald written with a capital as the name of a precious stone) (e:~ suangmanpha bangin suum pempam hi/Karbankel, leh ~ suangmanphate | carbuncle and emerald stones) (b:emerald) (r:66.4.3/26.28.13) (q:draft)
