etcik = (t:v) (w:watch closely/test/observe) (d:et, form of en, look, with cik: watch carefully over a time to see the result, and so put to the test) (e:nisawm sung ~ dingin a thukim hi) (r:27.1.14) (q:draft)
etet = (t:v) (w:keep looking/look again and again/gaze) (d:et, look, doubled for looking that goes on; etet nop is love to keep looking at) (e:na ~ uh hangin na mu kei ding/paipai-in na ~ nop uh ka biakinn | my sanctuary that you love to gaze at/paipai-in a ~ nop uh biakinnpi | the temple they love to gaze at) (s:khuadakdak) (r:40.13.14/26.24.21/26.24.25) (q:draft)
etetna = (t:see) <etetna-in>
