Garm = (t:name) (c:people) (w:Garmite) (d:in Garm mite, the Garmites, a people named in the genealogy of Judah; the NIV has Keilah the Garmite) (e:Keilah khua-ah a teeng ~ mite) (r:13.4.19) (q:draft)
gat = (t:n) (w:weaving/woven work) (d:form of gan, weave, used as a noun after a possessor: the work of weavers) (e:siamgat siamte’ ~ ahi) (s:siamgat) (r:24.10.9/2.35.35) (q:draft, low confidence)
Gatam = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Gatam) (d:son of Eliphaz and grandson of Esau, a chief of Edom) (r:1.36.11/13.1.36)
gath = (t:see) <Moreseth-gath>
