gei = (t:n) (w:side/edge/shore) (d:the place beside something; gei-ah, beside, near, by) (e:khuapi lutna lampi ~-ah/tuipi ~ a, khawl gunkuang nih | two boats lying at the edge of the lake/kulh kongpi ~ a tutna mun panin | from his seat beside the gate/a vekpi in tuipi ~-ah pai uh hi | they all go to the seashore) (s:pang/nawl/mong) (r:20.8.3/26.27.28/42.5.2/9.4.18/26.27.29) (q:draft)
geiah = (t:prep) (w:beside/by/at the edge of/on the shore of) (d:gei side or edge with the place marker ah; follows the noun, as in tui geiah, lam geiah) (e:Zeisu tui ~ a ding hi/mittaw khat in khutdawh ngenin lam ~ a tu hi | a blind man sat begging by the roadside/Eufrates gun ~ ka seel hi | I hid it by the river Euphrates/kimkhatte in lampi ~ kia a | some fell along the path) (s:panga/nawlah/kianga) (b:gei) (r:43.21.4/42.18.35/24.13.5/41.4.4) (q:draft)
geihuai = (t:n) (w:molding/border) (d:a raised edging made round the rim of the table) (e:a ~ na bawl ding hi) (s:geihual) (r:2.25.25) (q:draft, low confidence)
geihual = (t:n) (w:molding/rim/edging/border) (d:a raised band made around the edge of an object) (e:a kimkotah kham ~ khat bawl hi/a kimkotah kham tawh a ~ na bawl ding hi | you shall make a gold molding around it/a ~ nuai tak-ah kham kual nih bawl hi | he made two gold rings just below the molding) (s:geivial/geihuai) (r:2.37.2/2.25.24/2.37.27) (q:draft)
geihualte = (t:n) (w:rims/ledges/borders) (d:plural of geihual: the raised edges that run round the altar) (e:a ~ na nuh ding a) (b:geihual) (r:26.43.20) (q:draft)
geinai = (t:n) (w:near/close by) (d:gei, side, with nai, near: the place close beside someone) (e:A ~ hong tun ciangin Jesuh in) (r:42.18.40) (q:draft)
geite = (t:n) (w:banks/sides/edges) (d:gei side with the plural te; lui geite is the banks of the streams) (e:a zai lui ~-ah i teeng ding hi/Israel mual tungte, lui ~, leh mite’ ten’na mun | the mountains of Israel, the banks of the streams and the places where people live) (s:pangte) (b:gei) (r:23.33.21/26.34.13) (q:draft)
geiteng = (t:n) (w:shorelands/shores/coasts) (d:gei, shore, with teng, all: all the shore) (e:tuipi ~ a thawn hi) (b:gei) (r:26.27.28) (q:draft)
geivial = (t:n) (w:rim/brim/edge) (d:the edge running round the top of a cup, a basin or an altar) (e:hai ~ bangin kibawl hi/A ~ nuai tong sawmthum sung | below its rim, for thirty cubits/khap khat a sangin ~ nei ding hi | it shall have a rim one span high) (s:geihual) (r:11.7.26/26.43.13/11.7.24) (q:draft)
gel = (t:det) (w:both/the two) (d:placed after a noun or pronoun for two together: both of them, the two) (e:Lot’ tanute ~ in a pa uh tawh/amaute ~ lo sungah pai uh hi | the two of them went out into the field/amaute ~ a ni kikhatin si ding uh hi | they will both die on the same day/tua unaute ~ tungah a heh uh hi | they were indignant with the two brothers) (r:1.19.36/9.20.11/9.2.34/40.20.24) (q:draft)
gel = (t:v) (w:write) (d:write down; a rare shorter form of gelh, found in one verse) (e:note’ adingin ka ~ a) (s:gelh/at) (r:20.22.20) (q:draft, low confidence)
gelgel = (t:v) (w:plot/devise/scheme) (d:doubled form of geel, plan, in a shorter spelling: keep thinking out, in the verses always of evil) (e:a sia thei pen ~ uh hi/Siatna bekbek na ~ uh a | you keep plotting nothing but evil) (s:geelgeel) (r:19.41.7/23.59.7) (q:draft)
gelh = (t:v) (w:write) (d:put words down in letters, on a scroll, on a tablet or on the ground; with lai, writing, it means write a letter or a document) (e:khutme tawh leiah a ~ hi/ka khut tawh kong ~ hi | I write to you with my own hand/na lungtang tungah ~ in | write them on your heart/hih thute ka hong ~ uh hi | we write these things to you/Hih lai a ~ keimah Tertias in | I, Tertius, who wrote this letter) (s:at/laigelh) (a:phiat) (r:43.8.8/46.16.21/20.7.3/62.1.4/45.16.22) (q:draft)
gelhbehsak = (t:v) (w:have added in writing/add in writing) (d:gelh, write, with beh, in addition, and the causative sak) (e:tampi zong ka ~ hi) (r:24.36.32) (q:draft)
gelhin = (t:v) (w:writing/writing down) (d:form of gelh with the linking ending in, used before a following verb) (e:Moses in hih thukham ~/laibu khat sungah ~ tuisia sungah sil khia ding | write them on a scroll and wash them off into the bitter water/makna lai ~ numei khut sungah koih a | writing a certificate of divorce and putting it in her hand/Pawlpi kiangah vaikhakna lai ~ ka pia zo hi | I have written a letter to the church) (b:gelh) (r:5.31.9/4.5.23/5.24.3/64.1.9) (q:draft)
gelhinah = (t:v) (w:write) (d:gelhin with ah, introducing the words that were written: wrote as follows) (e:hih bangin lai a ~) (b:gelhin) (r:44.23.25) (q:draft)
gelhkhiat = (t:v) (w:write out/write down) (d:gelh, write, with khiat, out; the form used before ding) (e:lai-in ~ ding kong sawm kei) (b:gelh) (r:64.1.13) (q:draft)
gelhkholhsa = (t:v) (w:written beforehand/written about in advance) (d:gelh, write, with kholh, beforehand, and sa, already done) (e:lai sungah a ~ Nazareth mi) (r:43.1.45) (q:draft)
gelhkik = (t:v) (w:write again/rewrite) (d:gelh, write, with kik, again) (e:thu om teng khempeuh ~ in/Hih bangin ka hong ~ hangin ka gim kei hi | it is no trouble for me to write this to you again) (s:atkik) (b:gelh) (r:24.36.28/50.3.1) (q:draft)
gelhna = (t:n) (w:writing/what is written) (d:gelh, write, with the noun suffix na: something written, a writing; gelhna lai is the writings of someone) (e:Ama ~ lai na up kei uh leh/Isaiah ~ in | as Isaiah wrote) (s:laigelhna/kigelhna) (b:gelh) (r:43.5.47/42.3.4) (q:draft)
gelhna = (t:n) (w:seal/signet/engraving) (d:in min gelhna, a thing with a name cut into it: seal, signet) (e:min ~ zungbuhte leh nakbuhte/Na min ~ leh na khauhual | your seal and its cord/min ~ a kibawl bangin kibawl hi | it was made like the engraving of a seal) (s:minthuhna/ciamtehna) (b:gelh) (r:23.3.21/2.39.6/1.38.18) (q:draft)
gelhnate = (t:n) (w:writings/letters) (d:gelhna with plural te: the things someone has written) (e:lai a hong ~ sungah a gen) (s:laigelhnate) (b:gelhna) (r:61.3.15) (q:draft)
gelhnate = (t:n) (w:engravings/seals) (d:gelhna with plural te; min gelhnate are engraved names, as on a seal) (e:tuate in min ~ tawh kibang a) (b:gelhna) (r:2.39.14) (q:draft)
