gelna = (t:n) (w:plan/plot/purpose) (d:shorter spelling of geelna, what someone has planned; paired with ngimna, aim) (e:~ leh ngimna a nei khin zo hi/~ leh ngimnate ngai dih un | hear the plans and the purposes) (s:geelna/ngimna) (r:24.49.30/24.49.20) (q:draft)
gelsim = (t:v) (w:steal away/sneak/slink) (d:move stealthily so as not to be seen, with sim, secretly) (e:a maizum mite a ~ bangin) (r:10.19.3) (q:draft, low confidence)
geltawm = (t:v) (w:make up/invent/imagine) (d:think something up by oneself, of things devised in one's own mind) (e:a ~ uh hong gen uh ahi a) (s:phuahtawm/geeltawm) (r:24.23.16) (q:draft)
