Geresa = (t:name) (c:land) (w:Gerasenes) (d:spelling of Gerasa in Luke 8, the region of the Gerasenes across the lake from Galilee) (r:42.8.26/42.8.37)
Gerizim = (t:name) (c:mountain) (w:Gerizim) (d:mountain beside Shechem, opposite Mount Ebal, from which the blessings were proclaimed) (r:5.11.29/5.27.12)
Gershom = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Gershom) (d:elder son of Moses, ancestor of a Levite family to which Shubael belonged) (r:13.23.15)
