gialhek = (t:n) (c:plant) (w:poplar/willow) (d:a tree that grows beside water, usually with kung, tree; also written gialheek) (e:Tua lai-a ~ kungte tungah/lui gei-a ~ kungte in | the poplars by the stream/luitui luang gei-ah a om, ~ kungte bangin | like poplar trees beside flowing streams) (s:gialheek) (r:19.137.2/18.40.22/23.44.4) (q:draft)
Gialhek = (t:n) (c:plant) (w:poplar/willow) (d:gialhek written with a capital in the name Gialhek Lui, the Ravine of the Poplars) (e:pua-in ~ Lui-ah a paipih uh hi) (b:gialhek) (r:23.15.7) (q:draft)
