gialphual = (t:n) (w:camp) (d:in the verse where the NIV has outside the camp; elsewhere the word for camp is giahphual, so this spelling may be a misprint) (e:~ pua lam a siangtho mun) (s:giahphual) (r:3.6.11) (q:draft, low confidence)
