gik = (t:adj) (w:heavy/weighing) (d:heavy; after an amount it gives the weight: shekel sawm a gik is weighing ten shekels) (e:shekel sawm a ~ kham pakan khat/tawisuang nam nih, a ~ leh a zang | two kinds of weights, a heavy and a light/Suangtum leh sehnel ~ mahmah a | stone and sand are very heavy/Nangma hehna keima tungah ~ mahmah a | your wrath lies very heavy on me) (r:4.7.14/14.4.18/5.25.13/20.27.3/19.88.7) (q:draft)
