giklua = (t:adj) (w:too heavy/very heavy) (d:gik, heavy, with lua, too much) (e:keima puak dingin a ~ vangik tawh kibang/kote tungah a ~ thuhaksate zangsak in | lighten the hardships that are too heavy on us) (b:gik) (r:19.38.4/11.12.4) (q:draft)
