gilkialpi = (t:adj) (w:very hungry/hungry) (d:gilkial, hungry, with pi; in the verse of working while still hungry) (e:~ mahin anlak na a sem uh hi) (b:gilkial) (r:18.24.10) (q:draft, low confidence)
