gilkialte = (t:n) (w:the hungry/hungry people/the starving) (d:gilkial, hungry, with the plural te: people who are hungry) (e:a ~ an na pia nuam kei hi/a ~ nahoih tawh vah sak hi | he fills the hungry with good things/~ an a vaak hi | he gives food to the hungry/na innkuan a ~’ adingin an pua un | carry grain for the hungry of your households) (a:gilvahte) (b:gilkial) (r:18.22.7/19.107.9/19.146.7/1.42.19) (q:draft)
