gimhun = (t:n) (w:time of trouble/time of suffering) (d:gim, suffering, with hun, time) (e:~ hi ding a/Jakob suante’ ~ hi ding a | it will be a time of trouble for the descendants of Jacob) (r:24.30.7) (q:draft)
