gimpih = (t:v) (w:toil for/labour for/take trouble over) (d:gim be weary with pih: weary oneself over something or someone) (e:themkhat zong a ~ het lo mi/nakpi tak-a sem-a ka ~ nate | the things I toiled hard for/Nang in na ~ lohpi | which you did not labour over/ta a suah ding a ~ bangin | as she labours to give birth to a child) (b:gim) (r:21.2.21/32.4.10/21.2.18/48.4.19) (q:draft)
gimsak = (t:v) (w:afflict/trouble/torment/weary) (d:cause to suffer or be weary) (e:Kote nong ~ ni zah/kei hong ~ ding na hi hiam | will you torment me/kha gilo in amah ~ hi | an evil spirit tormented him/tha khuahsak zaw loin ~ zaw hi | he troubled him rather than strengthening him) (s:gawt/thuaksak/bawlsia) (a:tawldamsak) (b:gim) (r:19.90.15/9.5.6/18.19.2/9.16.14/14.28.20) (q:draft)
gimsakgawp = (t:v) (w:harass/afflict severely/vex) (d:gimsak afflict with gawp, severely; the NIV has treat as enemies) (e:Midian mite ~ inla, amaute vatgawp in/a khelpilna uh tawh note hong ~ uh a | they harassed you with their trickery) (b:gimsak) (r:4.25.17/4.25.18) (q:draft)
gimsakin = (t:v) (w:afflicting/troubling/oppressing) (d:gimsak, cause to suffer, with the linking ending in; another verb follows) (e:thuman mite ~, sumgolh na la uh a/Tua bangin lungsim thaneemte ~ | wounding weak consciences in this way/Topa in kei hong ~ | the Lord has afflicted me/mi tampi ~ a siatsak bangin | as it troubles and defiles many) (b:gimsak) (r:30.5.12/46.8.12/8.1.21/58.12.15) (q:draft)
gimsakkha = (t:v) (w:burden/trouble/hurt) (d:gimsak afflict with kha, come to do: come to trouble or harm someone, in the verses always negated) (e:nihvei sihna in ~ nawn lo ding hi/mailam hunah zong ka hong ~ het kei ding hi | in the future too I will not burden you at all) (r:66.2.11/47.11.9) (q:draft)
gimsakkhak = (t:v) (w:burden/trouble/harm) (d:form of gimsakkha used before loh, not) (e:kei hong ~ loh nading/A beisa hunah note ka hong ~ loh mah bangin | just as I did not burden you in the past) (b:gimsakkha) (r:45.15.31/47.11.9) (q:draft)
gimsakkik = (t:v) (w:afflict again) (d:gimsak, afflict, with kik, again) (e:tu-in note kong ~ nawn kei ding hi) (b:gimsak) (r:34.1.12) (q:draft)
gimsakna = (t:n) (w:affliction/torment/troubling) (d:gimsak afflict with the noun suffix na) (e:Nong ~ uh kicing ta hoh) (s:gawtna) (b:gimsak) (r:18.19.22) (q:draft)
gimsakte = (t:n) (w:oppressors/tormentors) (d:gimsak afflict with plural te: those who make someone suffer) (e:eite hong ~ kiang panin Pasian in) (s:bawlsiate/nengniamte) (b:gimsak) (r:23.59.9) (q:draft)
