gote = (t:n) (w:slaughterers/butchers) (d:go slaughter with te, those who do it; sa gote and gan gote, those who slaughter animals) (e:sa ~ kiangah a kipaipih tuuno/gan ~ tuu gawh ding bangin hong kikoih hi | we are counted as sheep for the butchers to slaughter) (b:go) (r:23.53.7/19.44.22) (q:draft)
