hektohna = (t:n) (w:rising up/getting up) (d:a person's rising or getting up, paired with heksuk or heksukna, the sitting down, to mean everything someone does; na heksuk na hektohna khempeuhah is in all that you do and wherever you go) (e:na heksuk na ~ khempeuhah/ka heksukna, ka ~ khempeuh na thei hi | you know all my sitting down and my rising up) (s:thawhtohna) (a:heksukna/heksuk) (r:11.2.3/19.139.2) (q:draft, low confidence)
