hibek = (t:v) (w:be only/be merely) (d:hi, be, with bek, only: is only, is nothing more than) (e:a ihmu ~ hi/a si hi lo hi; a ihmu ~ hi | she is not dead; she is only asleep) (s:hilel) (r:41.5.39) (q:draft)
hibuang = (t:v) (w:be after all) (d:hi be with the emphatic particle buang: whatever else may be said, she is a daughter of a king) (e:amah kumpipa’ tanu ~ hi) (r:12.9.34) (q:draft, low confidence)
