Hiel = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Hiel) (d:man of Bethel who rebuilt Jericho in the time of King Ahab, at the cost of his sons Abiram and Segub) (e:Beth-el mi ~ in Jerikho lam hi) (r:11.16.34) (q:draft)
