hih = (t:pron) (w:this) (d:points to a person or thing near the speaker or just mentioned; before a noun it means this or these, and hih bangin is in this way) (e:~ mun ah ding in/~ nih veina lai kong gelh hi | I am writing you this second letter/Pasian in ~ thute khempeuh gen a | God spoke all these words/~ bangin kong gelh hi | I am writing to you in this way) (a:tua) (r:43.8.4/61.3.1/2.20.1/62.2.26)
