hihkim = (t:v) (w:do completely/do all) (d:hih, do, with kim, complete: do all of it and leave nothing out) (e:Hihte khempeuh na ~ ding uh hi) (r:42.11.42) (q:draft)
hihlai = (t:see) <hihlai-ah>
hihlai-ah = (t:adv) (w:here/in this place) (d:hih this with lai place and the place marker ah; also written hih lai-ah) (e:~ amah hong tun’ mateng) (s:hiah) (a:tuasan) (r:9.16.11) (q:draft)
hihlam = (t:n) (d:the fact of being, from hih be with lam; with ka, na or a before it and thei know, phawk notice or um believe after it, where English says that I am, that you are) (e:Khrih ka ~ na hong um kei/a kuankhawm ding na ~ thei in | know that you are to go out with me/numei gina na ~ hong thei uh hi | they know that you are a worthy woman/a piapa ka ~ hong phawkkha lo hi | she did not realize that I was the one who gave them/Jesuh a zong na ~ uh ka thei hi | I know that you are looking for Jesus) (s:hihna) (r:43.10.26/28.2.8/9.28.1/8.3.11/40.28.5) (q:draft)
