hoh = (t:part) (d:placed after a verb in wishes, requests and regrets, with a sense like just, rather or if only) (e:ka suah phetin si ~ lo/teen’ ding a lungkim hi ~ ta le ung | if only we had been content to stay/Kuama hong muh ma-in a si hizaw ~ leng | if only I had died before anyone saw me/a nuntakna haksa mah zomsak ~ in | just let him go on with his hard life/hong kihilhna mang ~ lo ka hi hiam | why did I not just obey the teaching given me) (r:18.3.11/18.14.6/6.7.7/18.10.18/20.5.12) (q:draft, low confidence)
