hoihnono = (t:adj) (w:fine/good/excellent) (d:hoih, good, with nono, said of several things each of which is fine: puan hoihnono, fine clothes) (e:puan ~ a silhte pen kumpi inn sungah/letsong ~ a namkim la hi | he took all kinds of fine gifts/mite a dingin na ~ a hong pia hi | he has given people good things) (s:hoihpipi) (r:40.11.8/44.14.17/1.24.10) (q:draft)
hoihoi = (t:v) (w:stagger/reel) (d:hoi, stagger, doubled: sway about like a drunk person) (e:zukham bangin amaute ~ uh hi) (s:hoi) (r:18.12.25) (q:draft)
