hoihpen = (t:adj) (w:best/finest/choicest) (d:hoih, good, with the superlative pen: best, finest) (e:kham ~ sangin thutheihna deihzaw un/Izipt gam a ~ mun note kong pia ding | I will give you the best place in the land of Egypt/Mangbuh ~ tawh note kong vaak dinga | I would feed you with the finest wheat/a ~ leh a kilawmpen teelin | choose the best and most worthy) (s:limcipen/phabel) (b:hoih) (r:20.8.10/12.10.3/1.45.18/19.81.16) (q:draft)
