hong = (t:part) (d:particle prefixed to form verb) (e:~ tung/Topa in kei ~ hopih a | the Lord spoke to me/keimah ~ huh in | help me/A beina ~ tung ta hi | the end has come/Na khut in ~ puksak leh | if your hand makes you stumble/nangmah ka ~ muang hi | I trust in you) (r:1.1.5/24.2.1/19.35.2/26.7.6/41.9.43/19.56.3)
