hongletin = (t:v) (w:open through/break through) (d:hong open with let through and in: making an opening right through, said of a roof) (e:inn tungkhum ~, a lupna pheek tawh) (r:41.2.4) (q:draft)
hongpa = (t:n) (w:keeper/guard/watchman) (d:hong guard, watch over, with pa marking a man: the one who guards) (e:tua lo ~ ka hi a) (s:cingpa/kempa) (r:23.27.3) (q:draft)
