Iri = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Iri) (d:son of Bela and grandson of Benjamin, head of a family) (e:Uzziel, Jerimoth, leh ~, nga pha uh a) (r:13.7.7) (q:draft)
Irijah = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Irijah) (d:captain of the guard, son of Shelemiah, who arrested the prophet Jeremiah at the Benjamin Gate) (r:24.37.13/24.37.14)
Irnahash = (t:name) (c:city) (w:Ir Nahash) (d:town in Judah founded by Tehinnah, a descendant of Judah) (r:13.4.12)
iron = (t:n) (w:iron)
Iron = (t:name) (c:city) (w:Iron) (d:fortified town in the territory of Naphtali; not the English word for the metal) (e:~, Migdalel, Horem) (r:6.19.38) (q:draft)
