Isaakhar = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Issachar) (d:spelling of Issakhar in one verse: son of Jacob and Leah, ancestor of the tribe of Issachar) (r:1.46.13)
Isahmael = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ishmael) (d:spelling of Ishmael in one verse: son of Abraham and Hagar, father of Mahalath the wife of Esau) (r:1.28.9)
Isaiah = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Isaiah) (d:prophet in Judah, son of Amoz, in the days of King Hezekiah; also the book of his prophecies) (r:23.13.1/23.38.4)
Isarel = (t:name) (c:land) (w:Israel) (d:spelling of Israel found in a few verses: the nation and people of Israel) (r:11.22.1/2.17.6)
Ishamael = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ishmael) (d:spelling of Ishmael in one verse: Ishmael son of Nethaniah, who killed Gedaliah the governor of Judah) (r:24.41.9)
