Ishbak = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ishbak) (d:son of Abraham and his wife Keturah) (r:1.25.2)
Ishbibenob = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ishbi-Benob) (d:Philistine giant, a descendant of Rapha, who set out to kill David) (r:10.21.16)
Ishbosheth = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ish-Bosheth) (d:son of Saul, made king over Israel by Abner after the death of Saul) (r:10.2.12/10.3.15)
Ishhod = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ishhod) (d:son of Hammoleketh, of the tribe of Manasseh) (r:13.7.18)
Ishi = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ishi) (d:name of several men, among them a son of Appaim of the tribe of Judah and a family head of the half-tribe of Manasseh) (r:13.2.31/13.5.24) (q:draft)
Ishma = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ishma) (d:a descendant of Judah, son of Etam) (e:Jezre-el, ~, leh Idbash ahi hi) (r:13.4.3) (q:draft)
Ishmael = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ishmael) (d:son of Abraham and Hagar, ancestor of the Ishmaelites; also the name of other men, among them Ishmael son of Nethaniah who killed Gedaliah) (r:1.16.16/13.1.28)
Ishmaelte = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ishmael) (d:Ishmael with the plural te, which groups him with the person named before: Abraham and his son Ishmael) (b:Ishmael) (r:1.17.26)
Ishmaiah = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ishmaiah) (d:name of two men in the time of David: a warrior from Gibeon who led the Thirty, and the son of Obadiah, officer over the tribe of Zebulun) (r:13.27.19/13.12.4)
Ishmeal = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ishmael) (d:spelling of Ishmael in one verse: a son of Azel, of the tribe of Benjamin and the family of Saul) (r:13.8.38)
Ishmerai = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ishmerai) (d:a man of the tribe of Benjamin, son of Elpaal) (r:13.8.18)
Ishpah = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ishpah) (d:a man of the tribe of Benjamin, son of Beriah) (r:13.8.16)
