Jabbok = (t:name) (c:land/river) (w:Jabbok) (d:river east of the Jordan and flowing into it, where Jacob crossed the ford; a border of the land of the Ammonites) (r:7.11.22/1.32.22)
Jabesh = (t:name) (c:city) (w:Jabesh) (d:town in Gilead east of the Jordan, also called Jabesh Gilead, where the bones of Saul were buried) (e:~ khua sunga makeng kung nuai-ah) (r:9.31.13/9.11.9) (q:draft)
Jabesh = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jabesh) (d:father of Shallum king of Israel) (e:~’ tapa Shallum in amah sawmsim a) (r:12.15.10) (q:draft)
Jabeshgilead = (t:name) (c:place/city) (w:Jabesh Gilead) (d:town in Gilead east of the Jordan, rescued by Saul, whose people later buried him) (r:9.31.11/9.11.1)
Jabez = (t:name) (c:male/place) (w:Jabez) (d:man of Judah more honorable than his brothers, whose prayer God granted; also a town where clans of scribes lived) (r:13.4.9/13.2.55)
