Jabne = (t:see) <Jabne-el>
Jabne-el = (t:name) (c:place) (w:Jabneel) (d:name of a town on the border of Judah and of one on the border of Naphtali) (e:leh ~ panin Lakkum ciang dong pai hi) (r:6.19.33/6.15.11) (q:draft)
Jabneel = (t:name) (c:place) (w:Jabneel) (d:name of a town on the border of Judah and of one on the border of Naphtali) (r:6.15.11/6.19.33)
