Jadon = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jadon) (d:man of Meronoth who helped repair the wall of Jerusalem in the time of Nehemiah) (r:16.3.7)
Jael = (t:name) (c:female) (w:Jael) (d:wife of Heber the Kenite, who killed Sisera, the army commander of King Jabin, in her tent) (r:7.4.17/7.5.24) (q:draft)
Jafeth = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Japheth) (d:one of the three sons of Noah, brother of Shem and Ham) (r:1.6.10)
