Jafia = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Japhia) (d:name of a king of Lachish defeated by Joshua, and of a son of David born in Jerusalem) (r:6.10.3/13.3.7)
Jaflet = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Japhlet) (d:son of Heber in the tribe of Asher; Jaflet mite are the Japhletites, whose land lay on the border of the descendants of Joseph) (r:13.7.32)
Jagur = (t:name) (c:land) (w:Jagur) (d:town in the far south of Judah, toward the border of Edom) (r:6.15.21)
Jahath = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jahath) (d:name of several men, most of them Levites, among them a son of Libni, descendant of Gershon) (r:13.4.2/13.6.43)
Jahaz = (t:name) (c:place) (w:Jahaz) (d:town east of the Jordan where Israel defeated Sihon king of the Amorites, later a Levite town in Reuben) (r:5.2.32/6.13.18)
Jahaziel = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jahaziel) (d:name of several men, among them a priest who blew the trumpet before the ark and a Levite, third son of Hebron) (r:13.24.23/13.16.6)
Jahdai = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jahdai) (d:man in the family line of Caleb in Judah, father of six sons) (r:13.2.47)
Jahdiel = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jahdiel) (d:head of a family in the half-tribe of Manasseh, a brave warrior) (r:13.5.24)
Jahdo = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jahdo) (d:son of Buz, an ancestor in the tribe of Gad) (r:13.5.14)
Jahle = (t:see) <Jahle-el>
