jasper = (t:n) (c:stone) (w:jasper) (d:A precious stone, jasper; the English word is kept unchanged and is usually followed by suang or suangmanpha.) (e:khuapi kulh pen ~ suangmanpha tawh kibawl hi/onik suang leh ~ suang hi ding hi | it shall be onyx stone and jasper stone/kristal bangin ~ suangmanpha bangin a om hi | it was like crystal, like a jasper gem/masa bel nuaiphah in ~ suangmanpha | the first foundation was jasper) (r:66.21.18/2.28.20/66.21.11/66.21.19) (q:draft)
