kaihnelh = (t:v) (w:hedge in/block/surround) (d:with ling thorn, fence in or block the way with thorns) (e:ling ka ~ ding a/Amaute in nang ling hong ~ ding a | they will hedge you in with thorns) (r:28.2.6/26.2.6) (q:draft)
kaihsak = (t:v) (w:pull/seize/grab) (d:kaih pull, with sak: take hold of and pull, as a dog by its ears) (e:a bil-a ~ tawh kibang hi) (b:kaih) (r:20.26.17) (q:draft)
