kaito = (t:v) (w:pull up/draw up/lift up) (d:kai, pull, with to, upward: pull or lift up, as a person by the hand or a net out of the water) (e:tua khempeuh vantungah a ~ kik hi/na itna kip in kei hong ~ hi | your unfailing love held me up/a taklam khutin lenin ~ a | taking him by the right hand he raised him up/a dim ngen lei ah a ~ hi | he drew the full net ashore) (s:kaikhiato) (a:khaisuk) (b:kai) (r:44.11.10/19.30.1/19.94.18/44.3.7/43.21.11) (q:draft)
