kalin = (t:conj) (w:while/during) (d:during the time that: follows a verb or verbal noun, as ihmut kalin, while asleep, and a theih loh kalin, at a time one does not know) (e:ihmut ~ a nakguhte khat la-in/manlahin a om ~ amah na mang hi | while he was busy, the man disappeared/a theih loh ~ a topa hong tung ding a | his master will come at a time he does not know/zan-in na ihmut ~ nang hong cing ding a | at night while you sleep they will watch over you/mitphiat ~ bei mang thei a | they can vanish in the blink of an eye) (s:laitakin/kawmin) (r:1.2.21/20.23.5/11.20.40/40.24.50/20.6.22)
