kangte = (t:adj) (w:white/gray) (d:kang, white, with the plural te, after a noun: sakol kangte is white horses, and sam kangte is gray hair and so the aged) (e:sakol ~ nitumna lam/sakol ~ tungah tuangin amah a zui uh hi | they followed him riding on white horses/dahna tawh ka sam ~ Leinuai-ah na paipih suk | you will bring my gray head down to the grave in sorrow/sam ~ mai-ah na kun ding uh a | you shall bow before the gray-haired) (a:vomte) (b:kang) (r:38.6.6/1.44.29/66.19.14/3.19.32) (q:draft)
