kauphete = (t:n) (c:animal) (w:locusts) (d:plural of kauphe: locusts, a swarm of locusts) (e:a gahte khempeuh ~ in tang ding/~ leh tangngolte, sim zawh lohin hong pai uh a | locusts and grasshoppers came without number/na gam sungah ~ kong paipih ding a | I will bring locusts into your country/leitungah ~ hong piangkhia a | locusts came out upon the earth) (b:kauphe) (r:5.28.42/19.105.34/2.10.4/66.9.3) (q:draft)
