kawbiate = (t:n) (w:shovels) (d:plural of kawbia: the shovels among the bronze utensils of the altar) (e:beelte, ~, leh kuangte zong bawl hi/beelte, ~, kuangte, sikkate leh vut luahna peekte bawl | he made the pots, shovels, bowls, forks and firepans/vut koihna ding beelte leh ~, kuangte | pots for the ashes, and shovels and bowls/beelte, ~, taitehte leh paknamtui adingin pakante | the pots, shovels, wick trimmers and incense dishes) (b:kawbia) (r:14.4.11/2.38.3/2.27.3/12.25.14) (q:draft)
