kawivak = (t:v) (w:wander about/walk around/roam/prowl) (d:go about from place to place, walk around; said of people who travel or have no home and of animals that prowl) (e:mun khempeuh ah a ~ lai takin/biakna innpi tual ah a ~ lai takin | while he was walking in the temple courts/se-alte a ~ uh hi | jackals prowl there/tuuvun keelvun silhin a ~ uh hi | they went about in sheepskins and goatskins) (s:vakthap) (r:44.9.32/25.5.18/41.11.27/58.11.37) (q:draft)
