keimahmah = (t:pron) (w:I myself/myself) (d:emphatic form of keimah, I and no other) (e:~ in ka tuute ka zong ding/tua supna ~ in ka thuak hi | I bore that loss myself/ama kiangah ~ ka kilak taktak ding hi | I will surely present myself to him/~ in ka thuk ding hi | I myself will call him to account) (b:keimah) (r:26.34.11/5.18.19/1.31.39/11.18.15) (q:draft)
