khadet = (t:n) (w:new moon) (d:the new moon and its festival; khadet ni is the day of the new moon, the first day of the month) (e:~ nite leh na pawite uh ka mudah hi/sabbath nite, ~ nite, leh pawi nite-in | on the Sabbaths, the new moons and the festivals/~ sim-a biakna | the offerings of every new moon) (r:23.1.14/2.19.1/13.23.31/15.3.5) (q:draft)
