khialhpih = (t:v) (w:lead astray/mislead) (d:cause others to go wrong along with oneself; used with lam, way, and after makaih, lead) (e:Izipt mite lam ~ khin hi/ka mite a makaih ~ mite | those who lead my people astray/Mi khemin a lam ~ ding pa ahih manin | because he deceives people and leads them astray) (s:khialsak/khialhsak) (b:khialh) (r:23.19.13/43.7.12/24.23.32) (q:draft)
