khuaphelepte = (t:n) (w:flashes of lightning/lightnings) (d:plural of a variant spelling of khuaphialep, lightning; named with thunder and earthquakes) (e:~ leh zinliingte a piang hi/~, kam aw gingte, vangingte | flashes of lightning, rumblings, peals of thunder) (s:khuaphialepte) (r:66.8.5/66.11.19) (q:draft)
khuaphia = (t:n) (w:lightning/flash of lightning) (d:a flash of lightning; mostly in khuaphia bangin, like lightning, of something quick or bright) (e:Satan in ~ bangin vantung pan hong kiasuk/~ bangin a tee zialzial dingin | to flash like lightning/~ mah bangin kin zalzal kawikawi uh hi | they sped back and forth like lightning/a thaltang lot ~ bang ding hi | his arrow will fly like lightning) (s:khuaphialep/keek) (r:42.10.18/26.1.14/26.21.10/38.9.14) (q:draft)
