khuapi = (t:n) (w:city/town) (d:a large town, khua, town, with pi, great) (e:ama phuhsa ~ om hi/a naih ciangin ~ mu-in kap a | as he came near he saw the city and wept/sumbuk bawlte ~ sungah koih hi | he set it in a city of traders/khamtungah Judah ~ khatah manlangin pai a | she hurried to a town of Judah in the hill country) (a:khuaneu) (r:19.87.1/1.4.17/42.19.41/26.17.4/42.1.39)
khuapi = (t:n) (w:land/country) (e:US ~ tung nuam mahmah hi)
