khuapihuam = (t:n) (w:city land/city property) (d:khuapi city with huam area: the land set apart for a city) (e:leitang siangtho le ~ sung kigawm/le ~ leitangte om ding a | and the land of the city property will be there) (r:26.48.20/26.48.21) (q:draft)
