khuate = (t:n) (w:towns/cities/villages) (d:plural of khua, town or village) (e:no ~ sunga om Levi mite/vangliatna tampi a lahna ~ in | the towns where he had shown many miracles/a ~ uh na zunglot hi | you have uprooted their cities/kumpi ~ khat mah bangin | like one of the royal cities) (b:khua) (r:5.14.27/19.9.6/40.11.20/6.10.2) (q:draft)
