khuavak = (t:n) (w:light) (d:light, especially daylight, khua with vak, bright; set against khuamial, darkness) (e:~ ka hi hi/~ leh khuamial khen hi | he separates light and darkness/tua ciangin ~ om pah hi | and at once there was light/vantungah lah ~ om lo hi | and in the heavens there was no light) (s:khuavakna) (a:khuamial) (r:1.1.3/43.9.5/18.26.10/24.4.23)
