kicinga = (t:adj) (w:perfect/complete) (d:kicing complete with the linking a; a kicinga a kingaihsun, considered to be perfect) (e:A ~ a kingaihsun nate khempeuh) (b:kicing) (r:19.119.96) (q:draft)
