kigawmkik = (t:v) (w:be reunited/join again/come together again) (d:kigawm, be joined, with kik, again: come together again after being apart) (e:Israel mite ~ ding uh a/a mipihte uh tawh hong ~ ding hi | they will be joined again with their own people) (s:kizomkik) (b:kigawm) (r:28.1.11/33.5.3) (q:draft)
kigawmna = (t:n) (w:sum/total/amount) (d:kigawm, be added together, with the noun suffix na: what things add up to when they are counted) (e:a kisim ciangin a ~ nate) (b:kigawm) (r:2.38.21) (q:draft, low confidence)
