kigimsak = (t:v) (w:trouble oneself/harm oneself/torment oneself) (d:gimsak, make suffer, with ki, oneself: put oneself to trouble or bring harm on oneself) (e:Topa aw, na ~ kei in/gilo lecin nangmahmah a ~ na hi bek hi | if you are cruel you only harm yourself/nangmah a ~ bek na hi hi | you are only tormenting yourself) (s:kilunggimsak) (b:gimsak) (r:42.7.6/20.11.17/18.18.4) (q:draft)
kigimtawm = (t:v) (w:afflict oneself/humble oneself) (d:kigim with tawm, by oneself; followed by sak, make oneself suffer, as by fasting) (e:an tangin kei ka ~ sak hi) (s:kigawt/kigim) (r:19.35.13) (q:draft, low confidence)
kigin = (t:v) (w:prepare/get ready/be ready) (d:make oneself ready; kigin kholh is prepare beforehand, and kigin ni is the day of Preparation) (e:Judah mite ~ kholh ni nai ahih ciangin/Paisan pawi ~ ni sun lai tak | the day of Preparation of the Passover, about noon/Tua ni in ~ ni ahih ciangin | because that day was the day of Preparation) (s:kiging/kithawi) (r:43.19.42/40.27.62/43.19.14/43.19.31) (q:draft)
Kigin = (t:n) (w:preparation) (d:kigin, get ready, written with a capital in Kigin ni, the day of Preparation before the Sabbath) (e:Tua ni in ~ ni hi a/Tua ni in ~ ni, nino ni ahih ciangin | since that day was Preparation Day, the day before the Sabbath) (s:kiginkholhna) (b:kigin) (r:42.23.54/41.15.42) (q:draft)
kigina = (t:v) (w:be esteemed/be counted worthy) (d:ki with gina proper or worthy; a kigina sim lote is those not counted as of any worth, the despised) (e:a ~ sim lote akipan) (b:gina) (r:46.1.28) (q:draft, low confidence)
kiging = (t:v) (w:get ready/prepare/be ready) (d:make oneself ready for something to come) (e:a vekpi-in ~ uh hi/Na lam-an ding uh ~ khol un | get your provisions ready/Pasian’ thukhenna thuak dingin ~ un | prepare to face the judgment of God/pau loin a si dingin ka ~ hi | I am ready to be silent and die) (s:kigin/kithawi/kigingkhol) (r:26.7.14/42.12.47/6.1.11/30.4.12/18.13.19) (q:draft)
