kigingkhol = (t:v) (w:get ready/be prepared/prepare in advance) (d:kiging, get ready, with khol, beforehand: make oneself or something ready ahead of time) (e:note in zong ~ un/Na lam-an ding uh ~ un | get your provisions ready/tua biakinn dingin keimah ka ~ ding hi | I will make preparations for that temple/a ~ mi a suah nadingin | so that he may become a person fully prepared) (s:kiginkholh/kiging/kigin) (r:40.24.44/6.1.11/13.22.5/55.3.16) (q:draft)
