kigingkholsa-in = (t:adv) (w:ready beforehand/already prepared) (d:kigingkhol, prepare in advance, with sa, already, and in: in a state of having been made ready) (e:a ~ na om nading uh) (s:mansa-in) (r:47.9.3) (q:draft)
kigingsa = (t:adj) (w:ready/prepared/alert/steadfast) (d:kiging, get ready, with sa, already: made ready; mostly in a kigingsa-in om, be ready or be on the alert) (e:a ~-in om tawntung un/a ~-in na om ding uh hi | you are to be on the alert/ka lungsim a ~-in om hi | my heart is steadfast/na mei uh vakin a ~-in om unla | keep your lamps burning and be ready) (s:kithawisa) (b:kiging) (r:60.3.15/6.8.4/19.108.1/42.12.35) (q:draft)
kiginkholh = (t:v) (w:be ready beforehand/get ready in advance/prepare) (d:kiging, get ready, with kholh, beforehand: be ready ahead of time) (e:Jew mite a ~ ding uh ahi/ka hong cih mah bangin na ~ theih nadingun | so that you may be ready, as I said you would be/tua sumpi na ~ nadingun | so that you get that gift ready beforehand) (s:kigingkhol) (r:17.8.13/47.9.3/47.9.5) (q:draft)
kiginkholhna = (t:n) (w:preparation) (d:kiginkholh, get ready beforehand, with the noun suffix na: preparation made in advance) (e:~ hun cing a) (s:Kigin) (b:kiginkholh) (r:17.2.13)
Kiginkholhna = (t:n) (w:preparation) (d:kiginkholhna written with a capital at the start of a sentence) (e:~ hun cing a) (b:kiginkholhna) (r:17.2.13) (q:draft)
