kihaibawl = (t:v) (w:be deceived/fool oneself) (d:kihai, be foolish, with bawl, make: make a fool of oneself; negated, do not be deceived) (e:Note ~ kei un) (s:kikheem) (b:kihai) (r:46.6.9) (q:draft)
kihaih = (t:v) (w:be sifted/be winnowed) (d:passive of haih, sift, with ki: be shaken in a sieve) (e:an a ~ mah bangin keimah) (b:haih) (r:30.9.9) (q:draft)
kihaimuanna = (t:n) (w:conceit/presumption/pride) (d:kihai muan, trust in oneself foolishly, with the noun suffix na) (e:Na ~ le na lungsim gitlohna) (s:kiphatsakna/kisaktheihna) (a:kiniamkhiatna) (r:9.17.28) (q:draft)
