kik = (t:adv) (w:again/back) (d:placed after a verb to show that the action is done again or turned back: gen kik is say again, pia kik is give back) (e:Jordan gun a nung ~ hi/Leah gai ~ a | Leah conceived again/nakpi-in a kiko ~ khit ciangin | when he had cried out loudly again/amaute kiangah thu a gen ~ hi | he spoke to them again/na dopa uh’ lamah kihei ~ un | turn back to the one you rebelled against) (s:leuleu) (r:19.114.3/1.30.19/40.27.50/42.23.20/23.31.6) (q:draft)
