kikeek = (t:v) (w:be torn/tear/rip) (d:keek, tear, with ki: of cloth or a net, tear or be torn) (e:ngen a ~ hi/dalna puan a lai zang pan a ~ hi | the curtain was torn down the middle/ngen a ~ kei hi | the net was not torn/a puan ~ leh a lu tungah lei khu-in | with his clothes torn and dust on his head/a ~ loh nadingin | so that it would not tear) (b:keek) (r:42.5.6/42.23.45/43.21.11/9.4.12/2.39.23) (q:draft)
