kikeeksa = (t:adj) (w:strung/bent/drawn) (d:of a bow, bent ready for shooting, from keek bend a bow) (e:a thal khempeuh uh a ~ ahi) (r:23.5.28) (q:draft)
kikeeksa = (t:adj) (w:torn) (d:kikeek be torn with sa, already; of clothes) (e:a puan ~ le a lu tungah) (b:kikeek) (r:9.4.12) (q:draft)
kikeem = (t:v) (w:be on guard/watch out/take heed/keep oneself) (d:keem, keep, with the reflexive ki: guard oneself, be on the watch against something) (e:kheem zawh loh nadingin na ~ un/Farisaite leh Herod’ silnngo ~ un la, tang un | watch out for the yeast of the Pharisees and of Herod/Laitheite na ~ un | watch out for the teachers of the law/bangci na zak uh hiam, na ~ un | take care how you listen/na khempeuh sungah na lungsim na ~ in | keep your head in all things) (s:kikem/kidop) (b:keem) (r:41.13.5/41.8.15/41.12.38/42.8.18/55.4.5) (q:draft)
