kikekgawp = (t:v) (w:be torn to pieces/be torn up) (d:of tent curtains, be badly torn; gawp adds the sense of violently or thoroughly) (e:ka puankhaite ~ hi) (r:24.4.20) (q:draft)
kikekin = (t:v) (w:being torn/torn/splitting) (d:kikek, be torn, with the linking ending in, joining it to the next verb; kikekin phelnih a suak, was torn in two) (e:a taw dongin ~ phelnih a kisuah hi/biakinn sung dalna puan ~ phelnih a suak hi | the curtain of the temple was torn in two/a puan ~ a lu tungah lei omin | with his clothes torn and dust on his head) (r:41.15.38/40.27.51/42.23.45/10.1.2) (q:draft)
