kikemsak = (t:v) (w:be entrusted) (d:passive ki with kemsak entrust; amah a kikemsak na is the thing that was given him to keep) (e:amah a ~ na hita leh) (b:kemsak) (r:3.6.4) (q:draft)
kikemte = (t:n) (w:those who keep themselves/those who guard themselves) (d:kikem keep oneself with te, those who; with panin, those who keep away from something) (e:panin a ~ in thupha ngah mi) (b:kikem) (r:23.56.2) (q:draft)
