kikhahkhia = (t:v) (w:be released/be set free/be let go) (d:khahkhia, set free, with the passive ki: be let out or released) (e:vantungmi lite a ~ hi/a om a tate’ ~ ding hi | the children who are with him will be released/kisiatna hen gawpna panin ~-in | being set free from the bondage of decay) (s:kikhah) (a:kikhum) (b:khahkhia) (r:66.9.15/3.25.54/45.8.21) (q:draft)
