kikhuk = (t:adj) (w:twisted/twined) (d:of thread, twisted together; a kop-a kikhuk puan hoih is fine twined linen) (e:a kop-a ~ puan hoihte, keelmul/a kop-a ~ a kigan puan hoih ahi hi | they were of finely twisted woven linen/a kop-a ~ khau tawh kigan puan hoih | fine linen woven of twisted thread) (r:2.35.6/2.38.16/2.25.4) (q:draft)
