kisawlpa = (t:n) (w:messenger/the one sent) (d:kisawl, be sent, with pa marking a man: the man who is sent) (e:a ~ zong a sawl pa sangin/ama mai-ah a hong ~ ka hi lel hi | I am only the one sent ahead of him) (s:kamtaipa/kamtai) (b:kisawl) (r:43.13.16/43.3.28) (q:draft)
kisawlsawn = (t:v) (w:be sent on/be sent in turn) (d:kisawl, be sent, with sawn, onward: be sent as the one who passes something on) (e:vantungmi hong ~ a) (b:sawlsawn) (r:48.3.19) (q:draft, low confidence)
