kiseel = (t:v) (w:argue/dispute/quarrel) (d:argue with one another, often with khat leh khat, one another) (e:nungzuite khat leh khat a ~ uh hi/ci-in khat leh khat a ~ uh hi | they argued with one another, saying) (s:kisel/kinial/kitot) (r:42.22.24/43.6.52) (q:draft)
