kisimkhawm = (t:v) (w:be counted together/be numbered among) (d:kisim be counted with khawm, together; with tawh or lakah for the group) (e:sawltak sawm-le-khatte tawh a ~ hi/Israel mite lakah Levi mite ~ lo hi | the Levites were not counted among the Israelites/Amah mawhneite tawh a ~ ding hi | he will be numbered with the sinners/adangte tawh ~ lo hi | they were not counted with the others) (b:kisim) (r:44.1.26/4.2.33/42.22.37/4.1.47) (q:draft)
