kisin = (t:v) (w:be beaten/be harvested) (d:of an olive tree, be beaten so that its fruit falls at harvest) (e:Oliv kung a ~’ ciangin | when an olive tree is beaten/Oliv kung a ~’ khit ciang | after an olive tree has been beaten) (r:23.17.6/23.24.13) (q:draft, low confidence)
