kisitin = (t:v) (w:be tried/be judged/be examined) (d:kisit with the linking ending in; thu kisitin, when the case is tried, and) (e:thu ~ mawhsakna a thuak uh ciangin) (b:kisit) (r:19.141.6) (q:draft)
kisitna = (t:n) (w:veil/covering) (d:the thing that covers, here the veil over the heart) (e:tua a ~ a kipaaikhia hi) (s:khuhna/dalna) (r:47.3.16) (q:draft)
kisitsak = (t:v) (w:be kept for/be set aside for) (d:be kept back for someone; written kisiitsak in the other text) (e:nang a dingin hong ~ ahi hi) (s:kikoihcingsak) (r:9.9.24) (q:draft)
kisittel = (t:v) (w:examine oneself/be tested) (d:test or examine oneself, a kisittel zo lo is one who fails the test) (e:nomau pumpi uh na ~ ciat un/A ~ zo lote na hih kei uh leh | unless you are those who fail the test/Kote in a ~ zo lote ka hi kei uh | we are not those who fail the test/a ~ zo lo mi bang ka hi uh zongin | though we may seem to have failed the test) (s:kize-et/kisit) (b:sittel) (r:47.13.5/47.13.6/47.13.7) (q:draft)
kisosuah = (t:v) (w:flare up/be stirred up/rouse oneself) (d:of anger, flare up, of a person, rouse oneself to act) (e:amau hehna a ~ ciangin/kei’ adingin nangmah hong ~ tawm in | rouse yourself for my sake/Jerusalem aw, nangmah ~ tawm in | Jerusalem, rouse yourself) (s:kihanthawn) (b:sosuah) (r:19.124.3/19.35.23/23.51.17) (q:draft)
kisu = (t:v) (w:be struck/be touched) (d:passive of su, touch or strike; with kha: be struck or touched by something, as by the heat of the sun) (e:tawh a ~ kha nawn kei ding uh hi) (s:kisukkhak/kilawng) (b:su) (r:66.7.16) (q:draft)
kisu = (t:v) (w:wrong each other/harm each other/fight each other) (d:su, strike or harm, with the prefix ki, each other; with khatlekhat, one another: do wrong to one another or meet one another in battle) (e:Note khatlekhat ~-in/khatlekhat mai kituahin ~ ni | let us face each other and fight) (b:su) (r:46.6.8/12.14.8) (q:draft, low confidence)
