kisuahin = (t:v) (w:being divided into/being made into/forming) (d:kisuah, be made into, with the linking ending in; after a number of parts: forming that many groups) (e:Gam khat peuhpeuh phelnih ~ kido le-uh/pawl li ~ Shekhem sim dingin pangsim uh hi | forming four companies they lay in wait to attack Shechem/Innkuan khat peuhpeuh phelnih ~ kido le-uh | if a household is divided in two and fights itself) (b:kisuah) (r:41.3.24/7.9.34/41.3.25) (q:draft)
