kisuaktasak = (t:v) (w:be delivered/be set free/be spared) (d:passive of suaktasak with the prefix ki) (e:Nang hong ~ tuan ding ahi hiam) (s:kihon) (b:suaktasak) (r:23.37.11) (q:draft)
