kisuhna = (t:n) (w:plunder/pillage/seizure) (d:kisuh with the noun ending na; neihsa kisuhna is the seizing of what one owns) (e:neihsa ~, leh maizumna thuak uh a) (s:suhna) (b:kisuh) (r:15.9.7) (q:draft)
