kisukha = (t:v) (w:have to do with/associate with/come into contact with) (d:touch or affect one another; with tawh, to have dealings with someone, and of a dead body, to come into contact with it) (e:a gamta mite tawh ~ vet kei un/tuate tawh ka ~ kei ding hi | I will have nothing to do with them/na hilh khit ciangin ~ nawn vet kei in | after warning him, have nothing more to do with him/mi si tawh ~ a | having come into contact with a dead body) (s:kikholh/kipawlpih/kisawhkha) (b:sukha) (r:49.5.7/4.5.2/19.101.3/56.3.10) (q:draft)
