kitawiteh = (t:v) (w:be weighed/be put on the scales) (d:tawi lift or weigh and teh measure, with the passive prefix ki) (e:ka haksatna khempeuh ~ leh) (s:kitawikhai) (r:18.6.2) (q:draft)
kitawito = (t:v) (w:be raised up/be elevated/be held high) (d:be built up or lifted higher than what is around, said of a base, a terrace or the head) (e:Biakinn kimkot teng a lei ~ a/Karmel Mual bangin ~ a | it is held high like Mount Carmel) (b:kitawi) (r:26.41.8/22.7.5) (q:draft, low confidence)
kitawldamsak = (t:v) (w:refresh oneself/rest) (d:tawldamsak refresh, with the reflexive prefix ki) (e:tua lai-ah amah ~ hi) (s:tawlnga) (b:tawldamsak) (r:10.16.14) (q:draft)
kitawlnga = (t:v) (w:stop/come to a halt/be rested) (d:tawlnga rest, with the prefix ki; of work, be left to stop) (e:nasep ~ ding hi) (b:tawlnga) (r:16.6.3) (q:draft)
kitawng = (t:v) (w:quarrel/strive/fight) (d:dispute or fight with one another, in words or with blows) (e:Lampi-ah ~ kei un/leh Lot’ gancingte ~ zel hi | and the herders of Lot kept quarrelling/lo sungah amaute khat leh khat ~ uh hi | in the field they fought each other/Pasian’ sila in a ~ thei kei hi | the servant of God must not quarrel) (s:kitot/kido) (a:kilem) (r:1.45.24/1.13.7/10.14.6/55.2.24) (q:draft)
kitawngin = (t:v) (w:fighting/quarrelling) (d:kitawng quarrel, fight, with the linking ending in) (e:~ na kilailawh uh hi/Mite ~ numei naupaii khat liamsak a | people who are fighting injure a pregnant woman) (b:kitawng) (r:59.4.2/2.21.22) (q:draft)
kitawngpah = (t:v) (w:begin to quarrel at once/fall into dispute) (d:kitawng quarrel, with pah, at once) (e:Farisi mite ~ uh a) (r:44.23.7) (q:draft)
kitawngsak = (t:v) (w:set against each other/cause to quarrel/stir up strife) (d:kitawng, quarrel, with sak, cause) (e:khat leh khat ~ dinga hong pai/Izipt mite amau leh amau ka ~ ding hi | I will set the Egyptians against one another/khamtheih zu in ~ a | strong drink makes people quarrel) (s:kidosak) (b:kitawng) (r:40.10.35/23.19.2/20.20.1) (q:draft)
Kitawngtawng = (t:v) (w:keep quarrelling/quarrel) (d:kitawng quarrel with the last syllable repeated, go on quarrelling with one another; kitawngtawng kawm is in the midst of quarrelling, where the NIV has with hatred) (e:~ kawm-a sa meh limpen nekna sangin) (r:20.15.17) (q:draft)
kitawphah = (t:adj) (w:rocky) (d:used with suang stone, suang kitawphah leilak is rocky ground, where rock lies under a thin layer of soil) (e:Suang ~ leilak a tu khaicite/suang a ~ tung tu a | it fell on rocky ground/khaici pawlkhat a tukna suang ~ leilak | the rocky ground where some seed fell) (b:tawphah) (r:40.13.20/41.4.16/41.4.5) (q:draft)
kitawphahna = (t:n) (w:rocky ground/rocky place) (d:kitawphah with the noun ending na; suang kitawphahna is a place where rock lies under a thin layer of soil) (e:suang a ~ leidaina mun a tu hi/suang ~ leilak tu a | it fell on rocky ground) (b:kitawphah) (r:40.13.5/42.8.6) (q:draft)
kitawpsak = (t:v) (w:be stopped/be brought to an end/be stilled) (d:passive of tawpsak with the prefix ki) (e:thukhual lo mite’ la sakna ~ hi) (s:kikhawlsak) (b:tawpsak) (r:23.25.5) (q:draft)
kite = (t:n) (w:horns) (d:plural of ki; in these verses the horns of the altar) (e:biakna tau ~ len hi/meihal biakna tau ~ nuh ding a | he shall put it on the horns of the altar of burnt offering/~ in a biakna tau tawh sakhat hi ding a | the horns shall be of one piece with the altar/a kiu lite-ah ~ bawl hi | he made horns at its four corners) (b:ki) (r:11.1.50/2.27.2/3.4.30/2.38.2) (q:draft)
kiteel = (t:v) (w:be chosen/be elected) (d:teel, choose, with the passive prefix ki; a kiteel mite are the chosen, the elect) (e:a ~ mite a tawm ding uh hi/a ~ vantungmite mai-ah | before the elect angels/mihon sung panin a ~ | chosen from among the community/A ~ a manpha inn kiu khuam bul suangpi | a chosen and precious cornerstone) (s:kiteelkhia) (b:teel) (r:40.22.14/55.2.10/54.5.21/4.16.2/60.2.6) (q:draft)
kiteelin = (t:v) (w:being chosen/being selected) (d:kiteel be chosen, with the linking ending in) (e:ama mipihte lak panin ~/Eleazar’ suante’ adingin khat ~ | one being chosen for the descendants of Eleazar) (b:kiteel) (r:58.5.1/13.24.6) (q:draft)
kiteelkhia = (t:v) (w:be chosen/be selected) (d:be picked out from among others, also placed before a noun, chosen) (e:Mi lakah a ~ siampi ukpa/Israelte a ~ mi khempeuh | all the chosen men of Israel/eite tawh na a semkhawm dingin a ~ | chosen to share the work with us) (s:kiteel) (b:kiteel) (r:58.5.1/66.17.14/10.6.1/44.1.17) (q:draft)
kiteelsa = (t:adj) (w:chosen/elect) (d:kiteel, be chosen, with sa, already: one that has been chosen; a kiteelsa kimkhat is a chosen remnant) (e:hehpihna hangah a ~ kimkhat a om/a ~ kimkhat a om lai uh hi | there is still a chosen remnant) (s:teelsa) (b:kiteel) (r:45.11.5) (q:draft)
kiteelte = (t:n) (w:those chosen/the chosen ones) (d:kiteel, be chosen, with the plural te: the people who were chosen) (e:Tua banga a ~ in Judah mi vive/a ~ in Judah mi vive ahi | those who were chosen were all men of Judah) (b:kiteel) (r:27.1.6) (q:draft)
