kithahlam = (t:n) (d:the fact or manner of someone being killed; kithah be killed, with lam way or fact) (e:a ~ zong ka thei kei uh/a ~ zong ka thei kei uh hi | nor do we know how he was killed) (r:5.21.7) (q:draft)
