kithakhauhsakin = (t:v) (w:strengthen oneself/be strong) (d:kithakhauhsak with the linking ending in: making oneself strong, and) (e:tu-in note ~ hang un/Tua ahih ciangin tu-in note ~ hang un | now then, be strong and brave) (b:kithakhauhsak) (r:10.2.7) (q:draft)
kithakhia = (t:v) (w:be passed out/be expelled/go out) (d:of food that was eaten, pass out of the body from the stomach; ends in khia, out) (e:gilpi sung pan a ~/gil sung pan a ~ hi | it passes out of the stomach/gil sungah tumsuk a, gilpi sung pan a ~ | it goes down into the stomach and passes out of the bowels) (r:40.15.17/41.7.19) (q:draft)
kithallot = (t:v) (w:be overthrown/be brought down/stumble) (d:said of the wicked who meet disaster and do not rise again, set against the good who fall and get up) (e:tuahsiatna tuakin ~ hi/migilote ahih leh tuahsiatna tuakin ~ hi | but the wicked are brought down when calamity strikes) (r:20.24.16) (q:draft, low confidence)
