kithangsak = (t:v) (w:be exalted/be made famous/be glorified) (d:of God or his name, be made great and known everywhere) (e:leitungah ka min hong ~ hi/amah sangpi-in ~ hi | he is greatly exalted) (s:kisangsak/kiminthangsak/kipahtawi) (b:thangsak) (r:19.46.10/19.47.9) (q:draft)
kithat = (t:v) (w:be killed/be put to death/be slain) (d:passive of that, kill) (e:Mi a thatpa ~ ding hi/Ganhing tawh a mawh peuhmah ~ ding hi | anyone who lies with an animal shall be put to death/Tua zan mahmah in Babilon kumpipa Belshazzar ~ a | that very night Belshazzar king of Babylon was killed/a sat peuhmah ~ ding hi | whoever strikes them shall be put to death) (s:kithatlum/kisatlum) (b:that) (r:3.24.17/27.5.30/2.22.19/2.21.15) (q:draft)
kithatin = (t:v) (w:be killed/be slain) (d:kithat with the linking ending in: being killed, followed by a further verb such as puk or tuk fall) (e:mi tampi tak ~ puk hi/leitangah mi khat ~, gamlakah lum a | a person is killed in the land and lies in the field/khua sungah ~ a tuk ding uh hi | they will fall slain in the city/mi khempeuh ~, a milimte uh mai-ah kipaithang gawp ding | all the people will be killed and strewn before their idols) (b:kithat) (r:13.5.22/5.21.1/24.51.47/26.6.4) (q:draft)
kithatlum = (t:v) (w:be slain/be killed/be slaughtered) (d:passive of thatlum, kill outright) (e:Mun citeng-ah mi ~ ding a/~ dinga kipaipih mawhna nei lo tuuno bang ka hi | I was like an innocent lamb led to be slaughtered/tuutal teelte bangin hong ~ ding hi | you will be slain like choice rams/Tawlno khat khit ciangin tua kumpipa ~ ding a | after a short time that king will be killed) (s:kithat/kithahlup/kisatlum) (b:thatlum) (r:26.6.7/24.11.19/24.25.34/27.11.20) (q:draft)
