kithuaksak = (t:v) (w:be made to suffer/be afflicted) (d:thuaksak make suffer with the passive prefix ki: be made to suffer; gimna hong kithuaksak is suffering is laid on me) (e:amah gimna a ~ hangin/sun leh zan tawntung gimna hong ~ hi | day and night suffering is laid on me/gimna hong ~ ahi hi | suffering has been laid on you/kihehpih hetloin sihna ~ hi | was made to suffer death without mercy) (b:thuaksak) (r:23.53.7/23.38.13/18.36.21/58.10.28) (q:draft)
