kithuhilhna = (t:n) (w:correction/instruction/discipline) (d:advice or rebuke given to put a person right) (e:~ a mang nuam lote/A kihisak mite in ~ ngai nuam lo | the proud do not want to listen to correction/~ zuih theihna in | being able to follow correction) (s:kihilhna/taiina/thuhilhna) (b:kithuhilh) (r:20.15.10/20.15.12/20.15.31) (q:draft)
