kithukkikna = (t:n) (w:punishment/recompense/retribution) (d:kithukkik with the noun suffix na: the being paid back for what one has done) (e:migilote a ~ na mu ding hi) (s:thukkikna/gimpiakna) (b:kithukkik) (r:19.91.8) (q:draft)
