kituahin = (t:adv) (w:face to face) (d:in maitang kituahin or mai kituahin, with faces meeting; kituah meet with the suffix in) (e:maitang ~ Topa in Moses hopih zel hi/vantungmi mai ~ ka mu khin kha hi | I have seen the angel face to face/maitang ~ Pasian ka mu khin a | I have seen God face to face/khat leh khat mai ~ kisi ni | let us meet each other face to face/maitang ~ note tungah thu kong khen ding hi | face to face I will judge you) (b:kituah) (r:2.33.11/7.6.22/1.32.30/12.14.8/26.20.35) (q:draft)
