kituahpih = (t:v) (w:meet/come upon) (d:kituah meet with the ending pih: meet with someone or something on the way) (e:Ka ~ hih a honte khempeuh) (s:kimu) (b:kituah) (r:1.33.8) (q:draft)
kituahpihte = (t:n) (w:those met with) (d:the people one happens to meet; kituahpih with the plural te) (e:sumbuk lamah a ~ tawh thu) (b:kituahpih) (r:44.17.17) (q:draft)
