kolsak = (t:v) (w:relent/let go) (d:of God, turn from punishing; likely kol come loose with the causative sak, loosen) (e:itna kip tawh kizui-in a ~ hi) (b:kol) (r:19.106.45) (q:draft, low confidence)
koltan = (t:see) <koltan'na>
koltan'na = (t:n) (w:slavery/bondage) (d:koltan, be in bonds, with the noun suffix na; koltan’na Izipt gam is Egypt the land of slavery) (e:~ Izipt gam pan ka lakkhiat laitakin) (s:koltanna/salsuahna) (a:suahtakna) (r:24.34.13) (q:draft)
