konate = (t:n) (w:insults/reproaches) (d:kona reproach with the plural te) (e:~ keima tung hong tu hi) (s:simmawhnate) (b:kona) (r:19.69.9) (q:draft)
kong = (t:pron) (w:of which/I to you) (d:placed before a verb when I or we do something to you: nang kong it hi, I love you; note kong pia hi, I give to you) (e:note ~ pia hi/nang ~ it hi | I love you/nangmah ~ ento hi | I look up to you/tua thu ~ genkhol zo hi | I have told you this beforehand) (r:1.1.29/19.18.1/19.123.1/40.24.25) particle prefixed to form verb
kong = (t:n) (w:door/entrance/doorway) (d:the door or entrance of a house, tent or room) (e:puanbuk ~-ah na ngai hi/Lot pai-in ~ lehkhak a | Lot went and shut the door behind him/ama ~ gei-ah | beside her door/~ pualamah a khawl hi | he waited outside the door) (s:kongkhak) (r:1.18.10/2.33.8/1.19.6/20.9.14/43.18.16)
konga = (t:n) (w:at the entrance/at the door) (d:kong door, entrance, with the suffix a, at or of) (e:kikhopna buk ~ siampipa kiangah) (s:kongkhakah) (b:kong) (r:3.12.6) (q:draft)
kongah = (t:adv) (w:at the door/at the entrance) (d:kong, door or entrance, with the place marker ah) (e:kikhopna buk ~ Israel mihonte khempeuh khawm/Na-aman hong pai-in Elisha’ ~ khawl hi | Naaman came and stopped at Elisha’s door/inn ~ siampipa paikhia ding a | the priest shall go out to the door of the house/kikhopna buk ~ mihonte kikhawm hi | the people gathered at the entrance to the tent of meeting) (b:kong) (r:3.8.3/3.14.38/12.5.9/3.8.4) (q:draft)
kongbiang = (t:n) (w:gate/door/doorway) (d:the gate or doorway by which a house is entered; kongbiang dongin hong nai is near, right at the door) (e:sumhaupa’ ~ kiangah/a ~ hong tungta uh hi | they arrived at his gate/~ dongin a hong nai zo hi | it is near, right at the door) (s:kongkhak/kongvang) (r:42.16.20/41.13.29/44.10.17) (q:draft)
kongbiangah = (t:n) (w:at the gate/at the door) (d:kongbiang gate with ah, at) (e:mihau pa’ ~ hong kikoih a) (s:kongkhakah) (b:kongbiang) (r:42.16.20) (q:draft)
kongcin = (t:n) (w:gatekeeping/charge of the gates) (d:apparently the work of a kongcing gatekeeper, guarding the gates of a building) (e:Amaute in biakinn ~) (r:26.44.11) (q:draft, low confidence)
kongcing = (t:n) (w:gatekeeper/doorkeeper) (d:person who guards a door or gate, of a house, a palace or the temple) (e:Sangkil-ah ~-in a kitel hih mite/~ pa in limtakin a cin ding | the doorkeeper to keep careful watch/~ numei a hopih khit ciangin | after he spoke to the girl who kept the door/~ ahi kumpipa’ innsung mangte | the king’s officers who guarded the door) (s:kongcingpa) (r:13.9.22/17.2.21/41.13.34/43.18.16)
