kongcingnu = (t:n) (w:gatekeeper/doorkeeper) (d:woman who keeps the door of a house: kongcing gatekeeper with nu, female) (e:inn ~ mangbuh a su khin hi) (b:kongcing) (r:10.4.6)
kongcingpa = (t:n) (w:gatekeeper/doorkeeper) (d:man who keeps a door or gate: kongcing gatekeeper with pa, male) (e:kikhopna puanbuk lutna ah ~ ahi hi/ka Pasian’ inn ~ ka hi nuamzaw hi | I would rather be a doorkeeper in the house of my God/~ in ama ading hon’ thei a | the gatekeeper opens for him) (s:kongcing) (b:kongcing) (r:13.9.21/19.84.10/43.10.3)
kongcingte = (t:n) (w:gatekeepers/doorkeepers) (d:kongcing gatekeeper with the plural te: those who guard the gates of the temple or the city) (e:Levi mite omna ~ ahi ngei uh hi/~, lasate, leh Levi mite a kiseh | the gatekeepers, singers and Levites were appointed/Kongpite a vil ~ in Akkub, Talmon | the gatekeepers who watched the gates were Akkub, Talmon/vankoihna kongpite a cing ~ ahi uh hi | they were the gatekeepers who guarded the storerooms at the gates) (b:kongcing) (r:13.9.18/16.7.1/16.11.19/16.12.25)
konghon = (t:see) <konghon'na>
