kongkawtsak = (t:v) (w:convulse/throw into convulsions) (d:form of kongkaw convulse with the causative sak: make someone convulse) (e:naupang a ~ khit ciangin) (s:kongkawsak) (r:41.9.26) (q:draft)
kongkhak = (t:n) (w:door/entrance/doorway) (d:the door of a house, tent or room, and the entrance it closes) (e:khua zangpi-in ~ kiangah a kikhawm uh hi/a pang-ah teembaw ~ bulh in | put a door in the side of the ark/~ na kiu un | knock on the door/~ in kawmheek tungah a kiheihei | a door turns on its hinges) (s:kong) (r:41.1.33/1.6.16/40.7.7/20.26.14)
