kongpi = (t:n) (w:gate/gateway/doorway) (d:main gate of a city, court or building, kong door with pi, great; sihna kongpi is the gates of death) (e:~ pan a lut mi in tuucing/sihna ~ nai ta uh hi | they drew near the gates of death/thuman mi bek hih ~-ah lut ding hi | only the righteous shall enter this gate/Mite in kulh ~ ah ama tung sikin | the people trampled over him in the city gate) (s:kulhkongpi/kongkhakpi) (b:kong) (r:43.10.2/19.107.18/19.118.20/12.7.20) (q:draft)
