kuankha = (t:v) (w:happen to go/chance to come) (d:kuan go out with kha, showing the thing happened by chance) (e:Boaz’ lo-ah va ~ hi) (s:paikha) (r:8.2.3) (q:draft)
kuankhawm = (t:v) (w:go out together/march together/go with) (d:set out together, to war or to work) (e:tawh nang na ~ kei hi/nang tawh a ~ dingin kote hong zawn lo | you did not call us to go with you/amah tawh a ~ galkapmangte kiangah | to the army commanders who had gone with him/a sim dingin hong ~ uh hi | they advanced together to attack) (s:kuankhop) (b:kuan) (r:19.44.9/14.25.7/7.12.1/6.10.24/19.48.4) (q:draft)
