Kulhkongpi = (t:n) (w:gate) (d:kulhkongpi, city gate, written with a capital at the start of a sentence and in the names of gates: Kumpipa’ Kulhkongpi is the Gate of the King, Khuabul Kulhkongpi the Foundation Gate) (e:Tu dongin Kumpipa’ ~ nisuahna lam/~ gei-a Bethlehem tuikhuk panin | from the well of Bethlehem by the gate/~ lutna ciang dong | as far as the entrance of the gate) (b:kulhkongpi) (r:13.9.18/14.23.5/13.11.17/7.9.40) (q:draft)
