lawhcing = (t:v) (w:succeed/be successful) (d:have success, achieve what was aimed at; the form lawhcin is used before nading) (e:a ~ zo kei veve ding) (s:mavang/tangtung) (a:lelh) (r:27.11.17) (q:draft)
lawhin = (t:v) (w:catching/spreading to) (d:of fire, catch hold of and spread to something, with the linking ending in) (e:kumpi innte ~ a kangtum ding a) (r:24.17.27) (q:draft, low confidence)
lawhin = (t:adv) (d:in a lawhin, in its basket, basket and all; lawh basket with the ending in) (e:tuate a ~ paipihin) (r:2.29.3) (q:draft, low confidence)
lawhkha = (t:v) (w:spread to/affect by contact/pass on to) (d:lawh, spread to, with kha, come into contact: of something holy, pass its holiness to the people who touch it) (e:midangte ~ ding hi) (r:26.44.19) (q:draft, low confidence)
lawhkhak = (t:v) (w:mention/utter) (d:lawh call, with khak, happen to: call or speak a name when one should not) (e:Topa’ min na ~ ding kidawm in) (r:30.6.10) (q:draft, low confidence)
lawhlawh = (t:v) (w:toss/roll/surge) (d:of waves, heave up again and again) (e:Tuihualte in a ~ hangin zozo lo uh a) (r:24.5.22) (q:draft)
lawhna = (t:n) (w:picking/gathering/harvest) (d:the picking of fruit from a tree or vine) (e:singgah ~ hun hong tung lo ding hi/leenggah bawk a ~ hangin | because of the cluster of grapes they picked) (r:23.32.10/4.13.24) (q:draft)
lawhna = (t:n) (w:reciting) (d:the saying aloud of words, here of the commandments) (e:Ka thukhamte ~ ding) (b:lawh) (r:19.50.16) (q:draft, low confidence)
lawhpi = (t:n) (w:winnowing fork/winnowing fan) (d:the tool held in the hand to winnow grain on the threshing floor) (e:A khut in ~ tawi a/a khutin ~ a tawi hi | he holds the winnowing fork in his hand) (s:anzapna) (r:40.3.12/42.3.17) (q:draft)
