lawhsakkhak = (t:v) (w:pass on to/affect by contact) (d:lawhsak cause to spread by contact, with khak, happen to: make people holy by bringing holy things among them) (e:mite a ~ loh nading uh) (r:26.46.20) (q:draft, low confidence)
