lawhtak = (t:n) (w:gain/profit/portion) (d:what one really gets out of work or effort) (e:bang ~ ka hi hiam/na ~ tua bek mah hi ding hi | that alone will be your portion) (r:46.15.32/21.9.9) (q:draft)
lawhte = (t:n) (w:tenants/hired workers) (d:in lo khawh lawhte, those who work the field of another) (e:Tua lo khawh ~ in a nasemte/lo khawh ~ kiangah a sawl hi | he sent them to the tenants/lo khawh ~ tungah bangci a bawl ding hiam | what will he do to those tenants/tua lokhawh ~ sugawpin | destroying those tenants) (s:khawhlawhte) (r:40.21.35/40.21.40/40.21.34/42.20.16) (q:draft, low confidence)
