leenglate = (t:n) (w:guests) (d:leengla guest with the plural te) (e:Adonijah’ ~ khempeuh liing uh a/~ tawh na nek theih nadingin | so that you may eat with the guests/a ~ a en dingin a hong lut ciangin | when he came in to see his guests/amah tawh a om ~ khempeuh | all the guests who were with him) (s:zinte) (b:leengla) (r:11.1.49/41.6.26/9.9.24/40.22.11/11.1.41) (q:draft)
