leiite = (t:n) (w:tongues) (d:leii, tongue, with the plural te) (e:meikuang tawh kibang ~ kikhenin/a kam sung uhah a ~ uh muat ding | their tongues will rot in their mouths/na ~ un gitlohna thu a gen hi | your tongues speak wickedness) (s:leite) (b:leii) (r:44.2.3/38.14.12/23.59.3) (q:draft)
