leina = (t:n) (w:buying/purchase/trade) (d:lei, buy, with the noun suffix na: the act of buying; leina-in is in payment for, in exchange for goods) (e:na van ~-in singnamtui hoihpente/Amaute in antang a ~ hangin | because of the grain they were buying/sing ~ ding le suang tawhna ding | for buying timber and for cutting stone/na van hong ~-in sakol dapphahte hong pia uh | they gave saddle blankets in exchange for your goods) (s:sumleina) (a:zuakna) (b:lei) (r:26.27.22/26.27.12/1.47.14/12.22.6/26.27.20) (q:draft)
