lelun = (t:adv) (w:just/merely) (d:lel, only, merely, with the ending un used for a plural subject; a gen bang lelun, just in the way they spoke of) (e:pasian-te a gen bang ~) (b:lel) (r:14.32.19) (q:draft, low confidence)
