lemkhia = (t:v) (w:take away/remove/roll away) (d:in the verses, move the stone away from the mouth of a tomb) (e:amau in suang a ~ uh hi/Suang ~ un | take away the stone) (r:43.11.41/43.11.39) (q:draft)
