lencipin = (t:v) (w:holding fast/holding back) (d:lencip, hold tightly, with the linking ending in) (e:leitung huih lite ~ a om uh/a paipih mite in ~ a ciahsakkik nawn kei uh | those who took them away hold them fast and will not let them return) (s:lenkipin) (b:lencip) (r:66.7.1/24.50.33) (q:draft)
