lenggahzu = (t:n) (w:wine) (d:strong drink made from grapes) (e:a dawn dingin ~ pia in/kumpi’ an leh ~ pia loin | not giving them the food and wine of the king/tei kawikawi ~ tawh kibang lo hi | she is not like wine poured from jar to jar) (s:leenggahzu) (r:24.35.2/27.1.16/24.48.11) (q:draft)
