liangko = (t:n) (w:slope/side) (d:of land, the shoulder of a hill or ridge) (e:Beth-arabah gam ~ leilu lamah paisuakin/Jerikho leilu lam ~-ah paito-in | going up the northern slope of Jericho/Khinnereth tuipi ~ dong ban ding hi | it will reach as far as the slope of the Sea of Kinnereth) (r:6.18.18/6.18.12/4.34.11) (q:draft, low confidence)
