luitui = (t:n) (w:stream/brook/stream water) (d:lui stream with tui water) (e:lampi gei-a ~ dawnin thahat ding/Sakhi in ~ luang sialsial a lunggulh bangin | as the deer longs for flowing streams/tuipi bangin thukin, ~ bangin siang hi | deep like the sea, clear like a stream/Amah in ~ luang gei-a kisuan | he is planted beside a flowing stream) (s:lui) (r:19.110.7/19.78.16/19.42.1/20.18.4/19.1.3) (q:draft)
