lunggulhin = (t:v) (w:desire/long for/set the mind on) (d:lunggulh, long for, with the linking ending in: longing for something, with the mind set on it) (e:atung lam nate bek ~ om un/Sila nasemte in niliim ~ | slaves longing for the shade/Leitungah a om nate ~ om kei un | do not set your minds on earthly things/mawkna minthan’nate ~ om kei ni | let us not long for empty glory) (b:lunggulh) (r:51.3.2/18.7.2/48.5.26) (q:draft)
lunggulhna = (t:n) (w:longing/desire/lust) (d:strong desire, good or bad, from lunggulh, long for, with the noun suffix na) (e:Ama ~ in kai a/~ in gai-in mawhna a suak hi | desire conceives and gives birth to sin/amaute zumhuai ~ khut sungah a pia hi | he gave them over to shameful lusts/na ~ uh, na thuumna uh | your longing, your mourning) (s:deihna/utna) (b:lunggulh) (r:59.1.14/10.23.15/59.1.15/45.1.26/47.7.7) (q:draft)
lunggulhnate = (t:n) (w:desires/longings/passions) (d:plural of lunggulhna: desires, longings) (e:si-le-sa’ deihna leh ~) (s:deihnate) (b:lunggulhna) (r:48.5.24) (q:draft)
lunggulhte = (t:n) (w:lovers) (d:lunggulh, desire, with te: those whom one desires; na lunggulhte means your lovers) (e:nang in na ~ tungah letsong) (s:ngaihte) (b:lunggulh) (r:26.16.33) (q:draft)
lunggulhte = (t:n) (w:those who desire) (d:lunggulh, desire, with te: the people who long for something) (e:Siah a ~ tuancil in la) (b:lunggulh) (r:19.68.30) (q:draft, low confidence)
