lunghamna = (t:n) (w:fierce anger/wrath/fury) (d:fierce anger, from lungham, be furious, with the noun suffix na) (e:a ~ kua in thuak zo ding) (s:hehna/sinsona/thangpaihna) (b:lungham) (r:34.1.6) (q:draft)
lunghiang = (t:adj) (w:stumbling/faltering/hesitant) (d:wavering or holding back in heart; lunghiang loin means without hesitating) (e:~ mite na hanthotna/~ loin amaute zuipah in | go with them without hesitating/Naupangte sat ding ~ kei in | do not hold back from disciplining children) (r:18.4.3/44.10.20/20.23.13)
lunghianna = (t:n) (w:grudging/reluctance) (d:an unwilling, grudging heart in giving; in the verse it is negated: you shall not give grudgingly) (e:~ na nei kei ding hi) (r:5.15.10) (q:draft, low confidence)
lunghih = (t:v) (d:found only in lunghih mawh, be afraid or worried, the same word as lunghihmawh written apart) (e:tuate a ~ mawhpih uh hi/vantunga lim lamdangte ~ mawhna-in ngaihsun kei un | do not look on the strange signs in the sky with fear) (r:24.10.2) (q:draft, low confidence)
lunghihmawh = (t:v) (w:worry/be anxious/be afraid) (d:be troubled in mind about what may happen, worry or fear that something will go wrong; also written lunghimawh) (e:nang na ~ nading om lo ding hi/a mangthang ding hi ci-in ka ~ hi | I am afraid that it will be lost/Lampi ah a gim ding uh, ka ~ manin | because I fear they will faint on the way/A ~ manin tong khat beek a khangkhan thei | able to grow even one cubit by worrying) (s:lunghimawh/lungkham) (a:lungmuan) (r:20.3.25/40.6.27/47.11.3/40.15.32) (q:draft)
lunghihmawhhuai = (t:adj) (w:worrying/to be feared) (d:lunghihmawh, worry, with huai, which marks what causes or deserves a feeling: there is reason to fear that something will happen) (e:mawhsakna i thuak khak ding ~ hi) (r:44.19.40) (q:draft)
lunghihmawhin = (t:v) (w:worry/be anxious) (d:lunghihmawh, worry, with the linking ending in; lunghihmawhin nei kei un means do not worry about it) (e:~ nei kei un) (b:lunghihmawh) (r:42.21.14) (q:draft)
lunghihmawhna = (t:n) (w:anxiety/worry/concern/care) (d:anxiety or concern, from lunghihmawh, worry, with the noun suffix na; also written lunghimawhna) (e:~ in lungkhamna piangsak a/na ~ khempeuh uh ama tungah na koih un | cast all your anxiety on him/mite in ~ tawh a annek | the people eat their food in anxiety/kei’ ~ a kiam nadingin | so that my anxiety may be less) (s:lunghimawhna) (a:lungmuanna) (b:lunghihmawh) (r:20.12.25/60.5.7/26.4.16/50.2.28) (q:draft)
lunghihmawhpih = (t:v) (w:be concerned about/worry about/be afraid of) (d:lunghihmawh, worry, with pih, which adds the person or thing one is troubled about: be concerned for someone, be afraid of something) (e:amah bek mah in note hong ~ hi/gamdang mite in tuate a ~ uh hi | the nations are terrified by them) (b:lunghihmawh) (r:50.2.20/24.10.2) (q:draft)
lunghihmawhsak = (t:v) (w:be anxious about/fear for) (d:lunghihmawh, worry, with sak; in the verse Paul fears for the Galatians that his work for them may prove wasted) (e:ka hong ~ mahmah hi) (b:lunghihmawh) (r:48.4.11) (q:draft, low confidence)
lunghimawh = (t:v) (w:fear/be afraid) (d:be afraid that something bad may happen; also written lunghihmawh) (e:phalbi tun’ ding ~ lo hi/Amah lau lo, ~ loin om hithiat a | he is unafraid and without fear, steady/~ kei in | do not be afraid/a mawkna suak kha in teh, ci-in ~ lo hi | she has no fear that it may come to nothing) (s:lau/kihta) (r:20.31.21/19.112.8/1.35.17/18.39.16)
