lunghimawhin = (t:v) (w:be anxious/worry/fear) (d:lunghimawh, worry or fear, with the linking ending in: being anxious, anxiously) (e:note thu hangin ~ ka om hi/vantungmi a muh ciangin ~ a lau hi | when he saw the angel he was startled and afraid/ci-in ~ om tawntung kei un | do not keep worrying/~ ka thuak zawh nawn loh ciangin | when I could bear the anxiety no longer) (b:lunghimawh) (r:48.4.11/42.1.12/42.12.29/52.3.5) (q:draft)
lunghimawhna = (t:n) (w:worry/anxiety/vexation) (d:worry or anxiety, from lunghimawh, worry, with the noun suffix na; also written lunghihmawhna) (e:dahna, ~, natna satna leh hehna) (s:lunghihmawhna) (a:lungmuanna) (b:lunghimawh) (r:21.5.17/21.2.22) (q:draft)
lunghimawhsak = (t:v) (w:make afraid/make anxious/worry) (d:lunghimawh, fear or worry, with the causative sak: make someone afraid or anxious) (e:Midangte kihtakna in hong ~ a) (a:lungmuangsak) (b:lunghimawh) (r:20.29.25) (q:draft)
lungka = (t:v) (w:hesitate/waver/falter) (d:be of two minds, be unsteady in heart, hesitate; lungka loin means without wavering) (e:~ loin Topa muang ka hih manin/upkhialhna tawh Pasian’ thuciamna ~ loin | not wavering through unbelief at God’s promise/amah ~-in om lai veve hi | he still hesitated/Bang tan vei ~ ding na hi hiam | how long will you waver) (a:lungkip) (r:19.26.1/1.19.16/45.4.20/24.31.22) (q:draft)
