lungkhamsakpa = (t:n) (w:troubler) (d:lungkhamsak, trouble, with pa, which marks a man: the man who brings trouble) (e:Israel mite a ~ na hi hiam) (b:lungkhamsak) (r:11.18.17) (q:draft)
