lungkhuah = (t:todo) (r:56.3.2) (q:draft, one verse only, lungkhuah nei loin is something of the heart that one should be without, between not quarrelling and being gentle, but which fault it names cannot be told)
lungkia = (t:v) (w:be discouraged/lose heart/be dismayed) (d:lung heart with kia fall: lose courage or hope, be dismayed or discouraged) (e:Gamdang mite ~ uh a/Israelte khempeuh ~ hi | all Israel lost heart/Tu-in Edom ukpite ~ uh a | now the chiefs of Edom are dismayed/Amaute maizumin ~ densak in | let them be ashamed and dismayed forever) (s:lungsi/lungniam) (a:lungkip) (r:10.22.46/49.3.13/10.4.1/2.15.15/19.83.17) (q:draft)
