Lungpil = (t:n) (w:understanding/intelligence/good sense) (d:lung heart with pil wise; Lungpil a neite are the intelligent) (e:~ a neite a lungpilna ka sugawp ding hi) (s:lungpilna) (b:lungpil) (r:46.1.19) (q:draft)
