lungsimtawng = (t:n) (w:inmost heart/inner thoughts) (d:what is at the bottom of the heart: a person's real thoughts and motives) (e:amau ~ thei ahih manin/Pasian in na ~ uh a hong thei hi | God knows your hearts/mite’ ~ a kilatna | the revealing of people’s inner thoughts) (s:sinsung) (r:41.12.15/42.16.15/42.2.35) (q:draft)
lungsimte = (t:n) (w:hearts/minds/thoughts/attitudes) (d:plural of lungsim: hearts, minds or attitudes; after a list of qualities it marks them as attitudes of the heart) (e:heh baih lohna ~ na silh un/~ kua in a theithei ding hiam | who can know the thoughts/Kihisak-a gamtatna leh kiphatsakna ~ | haughty conduct and a proud heart) (b:lungsim) (r:51.3.12/46.2.11/20.21.4) (q:draft)
