mangbuhmante = (t:n) (c:plant) (w:spelt) (d:plural of mangbuhman, a grain named beside mangbuh wheat and mangbuhham barley) (e:mangbuh leh ~ sia lo hi/~ a nawl hui-ah tuh hilo ahi hiam | does he not plant spelt along its edge) (b:mangbuhman) (r:2.9.32/23.28.25) (q:draft)
