mangza-ah = (t:phrase) (w:under authority/in a rank of authority) (d:mangza, rank or position of authority, with the place marker ah) (e:keimah in zong ~ hong kikoih hi) (r:42.7.8) (q:draft, low confidence)
mangzaw = (t:v) (w:obey rather/obey more) (d:mang obey with zaw, more, rather) (e:thu ka ~ ding uh hi) (s:manzawk) (b:mang) (r:44.5.29) (q:draft)
mangzo = (t:v) (w:be able to obey/obey) (d:mang obey with zo, be able, manage to) (e:ka thugente na hong ~ uh hiam) (b:mang) (r:47.2.9) (q:draft)
mangzote = (t:n) (w:those who obey) (d:mangzo, manage to obey, with the plural te: those who have obeyed the teaching, NIV those trained by it) (e:tua thuhilhna a ~ in thuman nuntakna) (s:zuite) (b:mangzo) (r:58.12.11) (q:draft)
manin = (t:conj) (w:for/because/since) (d:placed at the end of a clause to give the reason for what follows; after a verb often ahih manin) (e:Kicing takin nong hehpih ~/Ka thuumna aw hong za ahih ~ | for he has heard my cry for mercy/Kain in amah that ahih ~ | for Cain killed him/leitang a kho ding mi om lo ahih ~ | for there was no one to work the ground) (r:19.13.6/19.28.6/1.4.25/1.2.5)
manin = (t:conj) (w:as of)
manin = (t:conj) (w:reason being/because of) (d:gives the cause of what follows; tua ahih manin, that being so, is therefore) (e:Ka mite a kisiat ~/Gilkial luat ~ cisa-in ka nattun uh a | because of great hunger we burn with fever/tua gamah kialpi nasia ahih ~ | because the famine was severe in that land/Tua ahih ~ lau kei un | so do not be afraid) (r:25.3.48/25.5.10/1.12.10/40.10.31)
maninah = (t:conj) (w:because/because of) (d:manin, because, with ah: placed at the end of the clause that gives the reason, often as ahih maninah) (e:eite hong it masak ~/tuni hunte in a gilo ahih ~ | because the days are evil/Tapa in Mihing Tapa ahih ~ | because he is the Son of Man/a topa thupiak bangin a hih ~ | because he did as his master ordered/a mat khit uh ciangin nitak ahih ~ | after seizing them, because it was evening) (b:manin) (r:62.4.19/49.5.16/43.5.27/42.17.9/44.4.3) (q:draft)
