mansuah = (t:v) (w:lose) (d:have something go missing, lose it; mansuah hun is a time to give up as lost) (e:tua sung panin khat ~ leh/a neih sung panin khat ~ leh | if she loses one of those she has/bangmah ka ~ kei uh hi | we did not lose anything/amaute in bangmah ~ lo uh hi | they lost nothing/Zon’ hun om a, ~ hun om hi | a time to search and a time to give up as lost) (s:suplawh/taan) (r:42.15.4/9.25.15/42.15.8/9.25.7/21.3.6) (q:draft)
