mantakin = (t:adv) (w:truly/truthfully/honestly) (d:mantak, true, with the adverb ending in: a mantakin kong genin-ah and a mantakin ci lehang open a solemn statement, very truly I tell you) (e:A ~ kong genin-ah/A ~ ci lehang mawhna a bawl mi peuhmah | very truly, everyone who commits sin/A ~ ci lehang, keima thuhilhna a zui peuhpeuh | very truly, whoever keeps my teaching/A ~, note in ka thugen na ngaih kei uh leh | truly, if you do not listen to what I say) (s:takpi/taktak) (b:mantak) (r:43.6.47/20.24.26/43.8.34/43.8.51/23.28.11) (q:draft)
