mantaktak = (t:adj) (w:really true/true) (d:mantak, true, with tak repeated for emphasis: really true; a mantaktak a gen is tell the real truth) (e:ama thugente a ~ hi/a gen pa in a ~ a gen ahihna | that the one who tells it is telling the truth) (s:mantak) (b:mantak) (r:43.21.24/43.19.35) (q:draft)
