mavan = (t:v) (w:prosper/succeed/go well) (d:short form of mavang, written mavan’ with an apostrophe before a following word or suffix; mavan’na is success) (e:gal dona bangci ~’ hiam cih/na ~’ theih loh nadingun | so that you cannot prosper/Amaute’ phattuam nading leh ~’ nading hanciam kei un | do not seek their welfare or their prosperity/kei tungah ~’na hong pia in | give me success) (r:10.11.7/14.24.20/15.9.10/16.1.11) (q:draft)
