mawhphelna = (t:n) (w:atonement) (d:mawh sin with phel undo and the noun suffix na: the undoing of sin; mawhphelna tokhom is the atonement cover, the mercy seat) (e:~ tokhom khuhin a om uh hi) (r:58.9.5) (q:draft)
