mawhsakin = (t:v) (w:accusing/condemning/blaming) (d:mawhsak with the linking suffix in: accusing, bringing a charge against) (e:Kuamah in mite ~, mite taai kei hen/Elijah in Israel mite ~ Pasian kiangah | Elijah, accusing the Israelites before God/migilopa ~ a langpang ding kuamah om lo hi | no one accuses the wicked man and opposes him/pawlpi khempeuh in tua pa ~ | the whole church convicting that man) (s:ngawhin) (b:mawhsak) (r:28.4.4/45.11.2/18.21.31/46.14.24) (q:draft)
mawhsakinah = (t:v) (w:denounce/rebuke) (d:mawhsak accuse with the endings in and ah, leading into the words spoken: in rebuking them he said) (e:Zeisu in a ~) (b:mawhsakin) (r:40.11.20) (q:draft)
