meikuangte = (t:n) (w:flames) (d:meikuang, flame, with the plural te) (e:a ~ in nang hong kangtum lo ding/mei leh ~ nangma nasemte na hisak hi | you make fire and flames your servants) (b:meikuang) (r:23.43.2/19.104.4) (q:draft)
