mengmeng = (t:adv) (w:quickly/in a hurry/at once) (d:placed after a verb to show that the action is done with speed or at once; a doubled form of meng) (e:Zakkhias kum ~ a/Sarah’ kiangah Abraham pai ~ a | Abraham hurried to Sarah/kei hong dawng ~ in | answer me quickly/hih lai panin paisuk ~ in | go down from here at once) (s:meng/pak) (a:damdamin) (r:42.19.6/1.18.6/19.143.7/5.9.12) (q:draft)
