mizuaute = (t:n) (w:liars) (d:mi person with zuau lie and plural te, people who tell lies) (e:~ leh mikhemte kiang panin/~ in siattat ding bek ut uh hi | liars want only to do violence) (s:zuaugente/zuautheite) (r:19.120.2/20.13.2) (q:draft)
