Mose = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Moses) (d:Moses, who led Israel out of Egypt, written without its final s before the possessive apostrophe, as in Mose’ kiangah, to Moses) (e:Tua ciangin Topa in ~' kiangah) (r:2.16.4/2.10.12) (q:draft)
