muhte = (t:n) (w:things seen/what one has seen) (d:muh, see, with the plural te: the things or beings that someone sees or has seen; ka muhte is what I saw) (e:na ~ uh kuamah kiangah gen kei un/Ka ~ uh teci ka pang uh hi | we testify to what we have seen/Khebar Gun gei-a ka ~ mah hi | they were the ones I had seen by the Kebar River/Tua ka ~ in mihing lim pua napi-in | the ones I saw had human form) (b:muh) (r:41.9.9/43.3.11/26.10.20/26.1.5) (q:draft)
