muhteng = (t:n) (w:all that one sees) (d:muh see, with teng all) (e:a Pa in a sep a ~ bek a sem ahi hi) (b:muh) (r:43.5.19) (q:draft)
muhthadah = (t:adj) (w:loathsome/detestable/repulsive) (d:hateful to look at; muhthadah sa is to find loathsome, muhthadah huai is repulsive, detestable) (e:a ~ huai khat ka mu hi/siluang hawm pen Pasian in ~ sa hi | God finds a hanged body loathsome/a puante nangawn uh ~ huaisa-in | finding even their clothes loathsome) (r:24.23.13/5.21.23/65.1.23) (q:draft)
muhthadahhuai = (t:adj) (w:detestable/repulsive/contemptible/odious) (d:so bad that it is hateful to look at, from muhthadah, loathsome, with huai, worthy of) (e:a ~ numei khat in pasal a neih ciang/hih a ~ nate khempeuh | all these detestable things/a ~ mahmah na khat ka mu hi | I saw a most repulsive thing/Amaute a ~, a thumang lo | they are detestable and disobedient) (s:muhdahhuai/kihhuai) (r:20.30.23/56.1.16/24.7.10/24.23.13) (q:draft)
muhtheih = (t:v) (w:be able to see/can see) (d:muh see with theih can, the form used before nading or a noun: muhtheih nadingin is so that one may see, i muhtheih nate is the things we can see, visible things) (e:a nai takin a ~ nadingin/khua na ~ nadingun mit zatui hong lei un | buy eye salve so that you can see/tu-a i ~ nate | the things we can now see/Mi khempeuh in na khantohna hong ~ nadingin | so that everyone may see your progress) (b:muh) (r:44.7.31/58.11.3/66.3.18/54.4.15) (q:draft)
muhtheihin = (t:adv) (w:visibly/observably) (d:muhtheih can be seen, with the adverb marker in) (e:mit tawh ~ hong tung lo ding hi) (s:kilangin) (b:muhtheih) (r:42.17.20) (q:draft)
