muzo = (t:v) (w:find/see/manage to find) (d:mu, see, with zo, succeed: manage to see or find; maipha muzo is find favour) (e:Tui ka ~ uh hi/na nasempa in maipha ~ a | your servant has found favour/Topa in ka thuakna hong ~ hi | the Lord has seen my misery/Ka nasempa David ka ~ hi | I have found my servant David/nong ~ kei ding uh hi | you will not find me) (b:mu) (r:1.26.32/1.19.19/1.29.32/19.89.20/43.7.36) (q:draft)
