namdang = (t:n) (w:another kind/different kind/another tribe) (d:nam kind or tribe with dang other) (e:minam khat pan ~ khatah paikhia lo ding hi/a ~ tawh ta na neisak kei ding uh | you shall not let them breed with a different kind/siampi ~ a pian ding kisam nawn lo | no longer any need for another kind of priest to arise) (r:4.36.7/3.19.19/58.7.11) (q:draft)
namdang = (t:adj) (w:foreign/alien) (d:of another people; namdang mite are foreigners) (e:~ mite, pa nei lote le meigongte) (s:gamdang/namdangpi) (r:24.7.6) (q:draft)
