namkim = (t:adv) (w:fully/wholly)
namkimin = (t:adv) (w:of every kind/of all kinds) (d:namkim all kinds with in; a namkimin after a noun is all sorts of) (e:Na a manpha a ~ i sut ding a) (b:namkim) (r:20.1.13) (q:draft)
