namun = (t:adv) (w:by tribe/tribe by tribe) (d:seen once after minam, tribe, where the people are brought forward by tribes; the form is unclear, perhaps nam with un or a misprint of namnamin) (e:na minam ~ note hong kipaipih ding hi) (s:namnamin) (b:nam) (r:6.7.14) (q:draft, low confidence)
