Nebai = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Nebai) (d:one of the leaders of the people who sealed the covenant in the time of Nehemiah) (r:16.10.19) (q:draft)
Nebaioth = (t:name) (c:female) (w:Nebaioth) (d:firstborn son of Ishmael, brother of Mahalath and Basemath) (r:13.1.29)
