Ner = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ner) (d:man of Benjamin, son of Abiel and father of Abner, the commander of the army of Saul) (e:~’ tapa Abner leh Saul’ tapa) (r:10.2.12/9.14.51) (q:draft)
