ngaih = (t:adj) (w:lovely/charming/beloved) (d:ngaih baang means lovely or attractive, and lawm ngaih is a beloved) (e:na mit zong ~ baang hi/na ~ baang mahmah a | you are altogether beautiful/It luat, ka lawm ~ aw | my dearly loved one, my beloved/a ~ bang mahmah khat hi a | she was a very lovely one) (s:ngaihhuai/etlawm) (a:melsia) (r:22.1.15/22.7.6/22.4.7/22.4.9/17.2.7) (q:draft, low confidence)
