ngaihban'na = (t:n) (w:charm/attractiveness/loveliness) (d:ngaihbaang, lovely, with the noun suffix na) (e:~ in zuaupi hi thei a/numei dangte’ ~ iplah ding na hi hiam | why would you covet the charms of other women) (s:ngaihbaanna/ngaihbaan'na/melhoihna) (r:20.31.30/20.5.20) (q:draft)
