ngaihhuai = (t:adj) (w:worth listening to/worth heeding) (d:ngaih, listen, with huai, deserving of: worth listening to; with zaw it means more worth heeding) (e:damtakin a gen hiathiat ~ zaw hi) (r:21.9.17) (q:draft, low confidence)
