ngaihna = (t:n) (w:longing/affection) (d:ngaih, long for, with the noun suffix na: the missing of a person who is dear, longing) (e:kumpipa in Absalom a ~ thu phawk hi/bang zah takin kong ~ thu | how greatly I long for you/nang kong ~ hangin ka liingliing hi | I tremble because of my longing for you) (s:lunggulhna) (b:ngaih) (r:10.14.1/50.1.8/22.6.12) (q:draft)
