ngavei = (t:num) (w:five times) (d:nga, five, with vei, times) (e:~ ahi a, gukvei ahi zongin) (b:nga) (r:12.13.19)
Ngavei = (t:num) (w:five times) (d:ngavei, five times, written with a capital at the start of a sentence) (e:~ ahi a, gukvei ahi zongin) (b:ngavei) (r:12.13.19) (q:draft)
