ngeizah = (t:n) (w:the usual amount/as much as before) (d:ngei with zah, amount, after a verb: the amount one used to do or have) (e:nidanga a neih ~ nihin/na nasep ~ uh themkhat zong hong kikhiam lo | your usual amount of work will not be reduced at all) (r:18.42.10/2.5.11) (q:draft)
