ngek = (t:adj) (w:tender/delicate/tiny) (d:small and soft like a newborn; a no ngek is a tender young one, and a ngek pen is the least or smallest) (e:A mel hoih, a ~ dikdek/tuuhonte leh bawnghonte a no ~ neite | the flocks and herds that have tender young/A ~ pen mipa in minam khat suak ding | the least one will become a nation) (s:ngeek) (r:24.6.2/1.33.13/23.60.22) (q:draft)
