ngen = (t:n) (w:net/fishing net) (d:a net for catching fish, birds or animals; ngen paai is cast a net) (e:Thangsiahna ~ sungah bungbu tuk a/ka ~ tawh amaute ka na siah ding a | I will catch them with my net/a ~ uh nusia-in Zeisu nung a zui uh | they left their nets and followed Jesus/gunkuang ziat lamah ~ na paai un | cast your net on the right side of the boat) (s:ngeen/ngenthang) (r:18.18.8/28.7.12/40.4.20/43.21.6) (q:draft)
