ninkikholna = (t:n) (w:heap of ruins/rubbish heap) (d:nin dirt, with kikhol be piled up and the noun suffix na: place where rubbish is heaped) (e:khuapi pen ~ hi tawntung ding a) (s:ninkholna/ninbulomtang) (r:5.13.16) (q:draft)
