nosuaksakkik = (t:v) (w:refresh/revive/restore) (d:nosuak, become fresh, with sak, cause, and kik, again) (e:na lungsim uh ~ un/guah tampi zusakin na ~ hi | sending abundant rain you refreshed it) (r:19.69.32/19.68.9) (q:draft)
