nuainung = (t:adj) (w:lower/lowest) (d:the lower or lowest of two or more things, set against tungnung, upper; Bethhoron nuainung is Lower Beth Horon) (e:bual ~ tuite na khawm a/A dawl ~ pen tong nga zai-in | the lowest floor was five cubits wide/a tau zawl ~ ciang tong nih | two cubits up to the lower ledge of the altar/Bethhoron ~ leh a tungnung | Lower and Upper Beth Horon) (a:tungnung) (r:23.22.9/1.6.16/11.6.6/26.43.14/13.7.24)
