Paradis = (t:name) (c:place) (w:Paradise) (d:spelling of Paradise in the older translation: the place of blessedness with God, where the tree of life stands) (r:42.23.43/66.2.7/47.12.3)
Parah = (t:name) (c:city) (w:Parah) (d:town in the territory of the tribe of Benjamin) (r:6.18.23)
paran = (t:see) <El-paran>
