Parmashta = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Parmashta) (d:one of the ten sons of Haman killed by the Jews in Susa) (r:17.9.7)
Parmenas = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Parmenas) (d:one of the seven men chosen in Jerusalem to oversee the daily distribution of food) (r:44.6.5)
