Parosh = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Parosh) (d:ancestor of a large family that returned from exile with Zerubbabel and with Ezra; the name is also among the leaders who sealed the covenant with Nehemiah) (r:15.8.3/16.10.14/15.10.25)
