Peruda = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Peruda) (d:head of a family of the servants of Solomon whose descendants returned from the exile; called Perida in Nehemiah) (r:15.2.55)
pet = (t:v) (w:bite/gnaw/sting) (d:bite, said of animals and insects; also of gnawing pain) (e:amaute a ~ thei cippi honte/hong leeng cippi in amah a ~ hi | a gadfly that comes flying bites her/kihei-in hong ~ kha ding uh hi | they may turn and bite you/na a sak manun a leii ~ uh a | they bit their tongues because of the pain/hong ~ tawntung natna | the pain that keeps gnawing at me) (s:tuk) (r:19.78.45/5.32.24/24.46.20/40.7.6/66.16.10/18.30.17) (q:draft)
Peter = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Peter) (d:Simon Peter, a fisherman from Bethsaida and brother of Andrew, one of the twelve apostles of Jesus and a leader of the first church) (r:40.10.2/43.18.27)
