peu = (t:todo) (q:draft, single verse about a faulty bow, thal peu tel; the part this word plays is not clear)
peuh = (t:det) (w:any/whatever/every) (d:placed after a noun or a verb clause, any at all, whatever, wherever) (e:a thu zak ~ um pahpah a/A kihhuai na khatpeuh ~ na ne kei ding | you shall not eat any detestable thing/nangma kiangah kong nget ~ uh nong piak nading | that you give us whatever we ask of you/sing them ~ thu dotin nei uh a | they consult any piece of wood/phak natna khatpeuh ~ tawh kisai-in | concerning any skin disease) (s:peuhpeuh) (r:20.14.15/5.14.3/41.10.35/28.4.12/3.14.54) (q:draft)
