peuhin = (t:det) (w:any/whatever) (d:peuh, any or whatever, with the marker in; cikmah peuhin, at any time, and a ut bang peuhin, in whatever way he wants) (e:A ut bang ~ gamta ding a/Cikmah ~ amaute tungah thupha hehpihna na bawl nop | want to do them good at any time/ciangkang ~ gen tazen hi) (b:peuh) (r:27.11.28/41.14.7/28.4.12) (q:draft)
