peuhmahah = (t:adv) (w:wherever/in whatever place) (d:peuhmah, whoever or whatever, with ah, at) (e:ka bawlna ~ note kiangah keimah) (s:peuhah/peuhpeuhah) (b:peuhmah) (r:2.20.24) (q:draft)
