peuhpeuh = (t:det) (w:any/whatever) (d:placed after a noun or a verb clause: any at all, whatever, whoever; the doubled form of peuh) (e:a sisak mi ~ kithat ding hi/ama ut ~ a hih hi | he does whatever he pleases/Na hong nget ~ kong pia ding hi | I will give you whatever you ask/ama tutna ~ a nin hi ding hi | anything he sits on will be unclean) (s:peuh) (r:2.21.12/1.19.12/19.115.3/40.14.7/3.15.4)
