pho = (t:v) (w:spread out/spread to dry) (d:lay something out in the open, as nets or meat to dry) (e:a ngen uh ~ ding uh hi/giahphual kimkotah tuate ~ uh hi | they spread them out all around the camp/a ngen uh zalin ~ keu ding uh hi | they will spread their nets out to dry/a ngen uh a ~ theih nading suangtumte | bare rocks where they can spread their nets) (r:26.26.5/4.11.32/26.47.10/26.26.14) (q:draft)
