pholak = (t:v) (w:expose/reveal/uncover) (d:bring something hidden, such as sin, into the open) (e:na gamtatnate ka ~ ding a/Vantungte in hih mipa’ mawhna ~ a | the heavens will expose the guilt of this man/tua bang gamtatnate a hoih lohna ~ zaw un | rather expose the wrong of such deeds/Ka khialhna a ~ ding | to expose my sin) (s:langsak) (a:seel/im) (r:23.57.12/18.20.27/49.5.11/11.17.18) (q:draft)
