phong = (t:v) (w:wake/awaken/rouse) (d:wake someone from sleep) (e:A nungzuite in Zeisu a ~ uh a/A ~ dingin ka pai ding hi | I am going to wake him/zingsang simin hong ~ hi | he wakens me morning by morning/Zingsang khuavak hong ~ ning | I will awaken the dawn/kua in amah ~ ngam ding ahi hiam | who dares to rouse him) (s:khanglosak/phawng) (r:40.8.25/19.108.2/43.11.11/23.50.4/1.49.9) (q:draft)
