phongto = (t:v) (w:lift up/raise up/help up) (d:phong raise with to upward: raise a person or the head) (e:Piter in amah ~ a/a ~ ding kuamah om lo hi | there is no one to lift her up/khuadakin na lutang uh ~ ta un | look up and lift up your heads/a khutin lenin a ~ hi | he took her by the hand and helped her up/ka lam lianpite ka ~ ding hi | I will raise up my highways) (s:domto/laamto) (b:phong) (r:44.10.26/30.5.2/42.21.28/41.1.31/23.49.11) (q:draft)
