phot = (t:adv) (w:first/for the time being) (d:placed after a verb, do this first before anything else, or for now) (e:pawi hun sung beisak ~ hi/biakna tau mai-ah na biakna koih ~ inla | first leave your gift before the altar/tukum hici koih ~ dih in | leave it as it is for this year first/Hong khawl ~ lecin | if you would first stop/nipi khat sung pawi beisak ~ in la | first finish the week of the feast) (s:masak) (r:1.29.28/18.18.2/40.5.24/42.13.8/1.29.27) (q:draft)
phot = (t:v) (w:lift up/raise up) (d:help someone or something up) (e:a ~ leh, a nattun’ dam) (r:41.1.31) (q:draft, low confidence)
