phualte = (t:n) (w:places/sites/camps) (d:biakna phualte are places of worship, galpanna phualte are siege camps) (e:biakna ~-ah numei-pasal paktat pawlte/galpan’na ~ leh kulh sukkhap nading molhtumte | siege camps and battering rams/Meribah tui ~-ah note kong ze-et hi | I tested you at the waters of Meribah) (s:munte) (b:phual) (r:11.14.24/26.4.2/19.81.7) (q:draft)
