pialte = (t:n) (w:strays/those who stray) (d:pial stray with the plural te; a lam pialte, those that have left the way) (e:a lam ~ kaikhawmin/a lam ~ na khiang kei uh a | you have not brought back the strays) (s:lampialte/pialkhiate) (b:pial) (r:26.34.16/26.34.4) (q:draft)
pian = (t:v) (w:be born/come into being/come about) (d:often written pian’; form of piang used before endings and in compounds: pian’na, birth or origin; pian’sak, create or cause) (e:na ~’na na nu lungdamsak in/na khempeuh a ~’ ma-in | before all things came to be/na pate uh leitungah a ~ uh a | your fathers came to be on the earth/a tanhzo dingin a ~’ leh | if he becomes able to redeem it) (s:suah) (a:sih) (r:20.23.25/59.1.18/51.1.17/2.10.6/3.25.26) (q:draft)
