piangsate = (t:n) (w:produce/things produced) (d:piangsa already come into being, with plural te; lo pan-a piangsate is what has grown from the field) (e:lo pan-a ~ na ne ding uh hi) (s:piangte) (b:piangsa) (r:3.25.12) (q:draft)
