pianngei = (t:n) (w:nature/natural state) (d:pian be born with ngei, the usual or original way: what a person or thing is by birth, by nature) (e:note’ ~ ahi lo a kiciing oliv kung/na ~ uh gamlak oliv kung panin | from the olive tree that is wild by nature) (s:pianzia) (r:45.11.24) (q:draft)
