Puannel = (t:n) (w:fine clothes/soft clothing) (d:puannel, fine or soft clothing, written with a capital at the start of a sentence; another spelling of puanneel) (e:~ silhte en dingin paikhia na hi/~ silhte in kumpipa’ inn sungah a om | those who wear fine clothes are in the palaces of kings) (s:puanneel/puanhoih) (r:40.11.8) (q:draft)
