ruby = (t:n) (c:stone) (w:ruby) (d:a red precious stone; the English word kept in its English spelling, used with suangmanpha, precious stone) (e:le ~ suangmanphate hong pia uh hi) (s:rubi) (r:26.27.16) (q:draft)
