saffron = (t:n) (c:plant) (w:saffron) (d:a plant whose flower gives a fragrant spice; loan word, here saffron sing, the saffron plant) (e:Nard sing leh ~ sing) (r:22.4.14) (q:draft)
sagawh = (t:n) (w:sacrifice/animal sacrifice) (d:sa, animal, with gawh, slaughter: the killing of an animal as an offering; used in sagawh biakna, sacrifice) (e:~ biakna sangin hehpihna ka deih zaw/~ biakna sangin a pha zaw hi | it is better than sacrifices/Daniel tungah ~ biakna leh namtui biakna | an offering and incense to Daniel) (s:gangawh/kithoihna) (r:40.9.13/41.12.33/27.2.46) (q:draft)
sagih = (t:num) (w:seven) (d:the number seven; it stands after the noun it counts, and a ni sagih ni is the seventh day) (e:ni ~/Amah in tapa ~ leh tanu thum nei hi | he had seven sons and three daughters/a ni ~ ni-in mite tawlnga hi | the people rested on the seventh day) (r:18.1.2/2.16.30)
sagihin = (t:v) (w:sevenfold) (d:sagih, seven, with the ending in; a zah sagihin is seven times as much) (e:a zah ~ kilohsak a/a zah ~ thuk in | pay them back sevenfold) (b:sagih) (r:20.6.31/19.79.12)
sagihin = (t:v) (w:seven times) (d:sagih, seven, with the ending in; a zah sagihin kithuk is be avenged seven times over) (e:a zah ~ kithuk ding hi/a zah ~ kithukkik ahihleh | if he is avenged seven times) (b:sagih) (r:1.4.15/1.4.24)
sagihna = (t:num) (w:seventh) (d:sagih, seven, with the ordinal ending na: the seventh in a series; kha sagihna is the seventh month) (e:a ~ David’ pa ahi hi/a gukna Attai, a ~ Eliel | Attai the sixth, Eliel the seventh/a ~ Hakkoz tung | the seventh fell to Hakkoz/kha ~, tua kha ni sawm-le-sagih ni-in | in the seventh month, on the seventeenth day of the month) (b:sagih) (r:13.2.15/1.8.4/13.12.11/13.24.10) (q:draft)
sagihte = (t:num) (w:seven/the seven) (d:sagih, seven, with the plural marker te: the seven of a group already mentioned) (e:tuuno ~ khat ciangin sehsawm suah sehkhat/tapa ~ in tua bangin ahih uh hi | the seven sons were doing this/a thau bawngpi ~ netum hi | they ate up the seven fat cows) (b:sagih) (r:4.29.4/66.1.20/44.19.14/1.41.20) (q:draft)
Sagihte = (t:num) (w:the Seven) (d:sagih, seven, with the plural te, written with a capital: the seven men chosen in Jerusalem to serve at tables) (e:~ laka khat ahi thuhilhsia Filip) (b:sagihte) (r:44.21.8) (q:draft)
sagihvei = (t:adv) (w:seven times) (d:sagih, seven, with vei, times: seven times) (e:nisimin ~ nang kong phat hi/khuapi kimkotah ~ na pai ding uh a | you shall march around the city seven times/a si ~ theh ding hi | he shall sprinkle the blood seven times/Sawm sagih mun ~ maisak in kong ci hi | I tell you, forgive seventy times seven) (r:19.119.164/6.6.4/4.19.4/40.18.22) (q:draft)
sagihveina = (t:num) (w:seventh time) (d:sagihvei, seven times, with na, making the ordinal: the seventh time) (e:A ~ ciangin amah in/A ~-ah, siampite in peengkul a tum ciangin | the seventh time, when the priests blew the trumpets) (b:sagihvei) (r:11.18.44/6.6.16) (q:draft)
saguh = (t:n) (w:bone/animal bone) (d:sa, animal or meat, with guh, bone: a bone of a carcass, as gnawed by beasts) (e:a ~ nek a nusia nuam lo) (s:guh) (r:36.3.3) (q:draft)
saguhte = (t:n) (w:bones) (d:saguh with the plural te: the bones in a pot of meat) (e:A ~ kangtum sak un) (s:guhte) (b:saguh) (r:26.24.10) (q:draft)
sah = (t:adj) (w:thick/dense) (d:thick, of a wall or of cloud and darkness; after a measure it says how thick a thing is, as tong nga sah, five cubits thick) (e:meiipi zahin ~ lua ahih manin/kawm pen tong nih ~ hi | the wall was two cubits thick/a kimkota a kawm tong nga ~ hi | the wall all around was five cubits thick/tong guk tak ~ hi | it was a full six cubits thick) (r:25.3.44/26.40.9/26.41.12/26.41.5) (q:draft)
sahang = (t:n) (c:animal) (w:beast/wild beast) (d:a fierce wild animal; in Revelation, the beast that rises from the Abyss) (e:kuam thukpi sung pan hong kahto ~/amaute vangliatna leh aana ~ kiangah a pia uh hi | they give their power and authority to the beast/~ san tungah tu-a a om numei khat | a woman sitting on a scarlet beast) (s:gamsa/sapi) (r:66.11.7/66.17.13/66.17.3) (q:draft)
sahangte = (t:n) (c:animal) (w:wild beasts/beasts) (d:sahang, wild beast, with the plural te) (e:Efesa khua ah ~ tawh ka kitot hangin/leitung gam ~ tawh thah theihna thu | power to kill by the wild beasts of the earth) (s:gamsate) (b:sahang) (r:46.15.32/66.6.8) (q:draft)
