Sakol = (t:n) (w:horse) (d:sakol written with a capital, at the start of a sentence and in the name Sakol Kongpi, the Horse Gate) (e:~ Kongpi kiu ciang dong/~ Kongpi tung san teng | the part above the Horse Gate/~ tungah silate tuang a | slaves ride on horses) (b:sakol) (r:24.31.40/14.23.15/16.3.28/21.10.7) (q:draft)
