sakzawk = (t:v) (w:regard more/feel more) (d:form of sa, feel or regard as, with zaw, more, used before ding and bangin, lamdang sakzawk ding is to be held in greater awe and na a sakzawk is feels more pain) (e:pasian khempeuh sangin lamdang ~ ding ahi hi) (r:13.16.25/44.26.14) (q:draft, low confidence)
