sawltak = (t:n) (w:apostle/messenger) (d:one who is sent: an apostle of Christ, or any messenger sent by another) (e:Gentailte’ ~ ka hi ahih ciangin/Khazih Zeisu ~ keimah Paul in | I, Paul, an apostle of Christ Jesus/Tuuno’ ~ sawm leh nihte’ minte | the names of the twelve apostles of the Lamb/~ sawm-le-khatte tawh a kisimkhawm hi | he was counted with the eleven apostles) (b:sawl) (r:45.11.13/44.1.26/54.1.1/66.21.14) (q:draft)
