sawltakin = (t:n) (w:as an apostle/as one sent) (d:sawltak, one who is sent, with the marker in, as: sawltakin ngaihsun, regard as an apostle; sawltakin nei, have as an attendant) (e:Midangte in ~ hong ngaihsun ta kei le-uh/note in ~ na hong ngaihsut uh | you regard me as an apostle/ama ~ a neih galkapte khat | one of the soldiers he had as attendants) (b:sawltak) (r:46.9.2/44.10.7) (q:draft)
sawltakpa = (t:n) (w:messenger/apostle) (d:sawltak one who is sent, with pa, a man) (e:Na mai-ah ka ~ ka paisak ding hi) (s:kamtaipa/sawlpa) (b:sawltak) (r:41.1.2/46.9.1) (q:draft)
