sawltakte = (t:n) (w:apostles/those sent) (d:sawltak with the plural te: the apostles of Jesus, or any people sent on an errand) (e:Zeisu in a ~ tawh a tukhawm hi/~ a mat khit uh ciangin | after they had arrested the apostles/~ in nalamdang tampi leh lim tampi a bawl | the apostles did many wonders and many signs/A ~ in inn a tun’ uh ciangin | when the men who had been sent reached the house) (b:sawltak) (r:42.22.14/44.5.18/44.2.43/42.7.10) (q:draft)
