sawlte = (t:n) (w:commands/orders) (d:the things someone commands, as Topa hong sawlte, what the Lord requires) (e:hong ~ na hih ding uh hi) (s:thupiakte/sawlnate) (b:sawl) (r:3.8.35) (q:draft, low confidence)
sawlte = (t:n) (w:messengers/men sent) (d:the people who were sent, as a mi sawlte, the men he sent) (e:A mi ~ hong tun’ ciangin) (s:kamtaite) (b:sawl) (r:9.19.16) (q:draft, low confidence)
