sawm = (t:num) (w:ten) (e:ni ~/shekel ~ a gik kham pakan khat | one gold dish weighing ten shekels/khuampeek khat a tun’ tong ~ hi ding a | each frame shall be ten cubits long/numei shekel ~ hi ding hi | for a female it shall be ten shekels) (r:4.7.14/2.26.16/3.27.5)
