sawmgukte = (t:num) (w:sixty) (d:sawmguk sixty, with the plural te, placed after the thing counted) (e:Argob gambup, khuapi ~ ahi hi) (b:sawmguk) (r:5.3.4/6.13.30) (q:draft)
