sawmli = (t:num) (w:forty) (e:ni ~/kum ~/inn sung in tong ~ sau hi | the room was forty cubits long/Kum ~ tawntung gampa lakah | for forty years in the wilderness/a kisim ciangin ~ val pha hi | when counted they were more than forty) (r:1.7.12/40.4.2/11.6.17/44.13.18/44.23.13)
sawmlina = (t:num) (w:fortieth) (d:sawmli, forty, with the ordinal suffix na) (e:a kum ~, a kha ngana/David’ uk a kum ~ kumin | in the fortieth year of David’s reign) (b:sawmli) (r:4.33.38/13.26.31) (q:draft)
