sawmlinih = (t:num) (w:forty-two) (d:sawmli forty and nih two written as one word; in Ezekiel the cubits of the English text are given in pi, so the numbers differ) (e:mi zanih ~ pha uh hi/pi sawmgiat le li sau a, pi ~ zai hi) (r:16.11.13/26.40.25/26.40.36) (q:draft)
