sawmna = (t:num) (w:tenth) (e:kha ~/a ~ Shekaiah tung | the tenth to Shecaniah/a ~ Jeremiah, a sawm-le-khatna Makbannai | Jeremiah the tenth, Makbannai the eleventh/Zedekiah in a uk kum ~ | in the tenth year of Zedekiah’s rule) (b:sawm) (r:13.24.11/1.8.5/13.12.13/26.29.1)
sawmna = (t:v) (w:aim/objective/intention/plan/plot) (d:what someone intends or plans to do, often a plan to harm someone) (e:kha ~/Ka galte in kei hong ~ uh | what my enemies plotted against me/Jerusalem sim ding a ~ thu | that he intended to attack Jerusalem/ama tungah a sia a ~ David in thei hi | David learned that he was plotting evil against him) (b:sawm) (r:1.31.20/14.32.2/24.11.18/9.23.9)
sawmnate = (t:n) (w:plots/schemes/intentions) (d:sawmna with plural te: what people intend or plan to do, here against someone) (e:kei hong ~ uh amau’ lu tung mah) (s:ngimnate/vaihawmnate) (b:sawmna) (r:19.140.9) (q:draft, low confidence)
sawmnga = (t:num) (w:fifty) (e:ni ~/Ni za leh ni ~ sung leitungah tui om hi | water covered the earth for a hundred and fifty days/nisuahna lam adingin tong ~ ahi hi | for the east side it was fifty cubits/pawlkhat za, pawlkhat ~, a pawlpawlin | in groups, some of a hundred, some of fifty) (r:1.7.24/2.38.13/41.6.40)
sawmngana = (t:num) (w:fiftieth) (d:sawmnga, fifty, with the ordinal suffix na) (e:a kum ~ in note adingin jubili/Azariah’ kum ~ kumin | in the fiftieth year of Azariah/a kum ~ siangtho sakin | consecrating the fiftieth year) (b:sawmnga) (r:3.25.11/12.15.23/3.25.10) (q:draft)
