se = (t:part) (d:emphatic particle placed after a verb, mostly before a negative such as lo or kei, in a question with bang hangin, why, or with leh as in hita se leh, even so) (e:gentheihna thuak ~ loin si hiat uh hi/a nawi hong kiteepsak ~ ahi hiam | why was I given the breast to suck/thuum-in kuamah va kah ~ kei un | do not go to mourn for anyone/Tua hita ~ leh | even so/lampi tom pen hita ~ leh | even though it was the shortest road) (r:18.21.13/24.16.5/18.3.12/18.22.18/2.13.17) (q:draft, low confidence)
