seelsakin = (t:v) (w:cover/hide) (d:seel, hide, with sak, for someone, and the linking suffix in: covering what should not be seen) (e:na zumhuaina teng hong ~) (b:seel) (r:26.16.8) (q:draft)
seelsim = (t:v) (w:hide/conceal/keep hidden) (d:seel, hide, with sim, secretly: hide a person or a thing away where it will not be found) (e:Topa in ko tegel a hong ~ hi/sathau leh khuaizu ka ~ uh lo lai-ah | oil and honey that we have hidden in the field) (s:seel/seelcip) (a:pholak) (r:24.36.26/24.41.8) (q:draft)
seelsim = (t:n) (w:private parts/nakedness) (d:what is kept hidden, a polite word for the private parts of the body) (e:Na ~ teng kilang ding a/na ~ uh a kidawk khak loh nadingin | so that your private parts are not exposed) (r:23.47.3/2.20.26) (q:draft)
seelte = (t:n) (w:rebels/those who opposed) (d:seel, speak against or resist, with te, those who; thu seel is to oppose or rebel against someone) (e:Moses leh Aaron’ thu a ~ ahi uh hi) (s:lehdote) (r:4.26.9) (q:draft)
seem = (t:v) (w:blow/blow on/fan) (d:of wind, blow over or upon something; of a fire, blow or fan it so that it burns) (e:huih in amah ~-in beimang a/A mei ~ un | blow up the fire/husan’na in amaute ~ khia ding hi | a breath will blow them away/tuipi tung a ~ gawp hi | it churned up the great sea/a tawhsa mut loh ~ lohin a koih phot mei | a fire that he leaves without blowing or fanning it) (s:mut) (r:19.103.16/26.24.10/23.57.13/27.7.2/28.7.4) (q:draft)
