seeng = (t:n) (w:basket) (d:a basket for carrying food or produce; also a basketful as a measure) (e:~ sunga kikoih singgah min ka mu hi/~ khat sungah kulh tung pan amah a khiasuk | they lowered him from the wall in a basket/~ sawm leh ~ nih dim a ngah uh hi | they got twelve baskets full/a lutang uh ~ sungah guangin | putting their heads in baskets) (s:bawm/paipel) (r:30.8.1/43.6.13/44.9.25/12.10.7) (q:draft)
seengin = (t:n) (w:by the measure/with the measure) (d:seeng, basket used as a measure, with in, by or with) (e:midangte na piakna uh ~, note zong/no zong ~ hong kipia kik ding hi | it will be given back to you by that measure) (b:seeng) (r:42.6.38/40.7.2) (q:draft)
