seh = (t:n) (w:part/portion/share) (d:one of the equal parts of a whole, used in fractions: seh thum suah seh khat is one third) (e:Amaute in ~ sagihin khenin/leitang ~ thumin khenin | dividing the land into three parts/Topa tanh dingin ~ khat kituam koih ding hi | one portion is to be set apart for the Lord/~ li suahin ~ khat ciatin a hawm uh a | they divided them into four parts, one part for each) (s:tanh) (r:6.18.5/38.13.8/5.19.3/26.45.1/43.19.23) (q:draft)
