sehkhat = (t:n) (w:one part/one share) (d:one part of a whole divided into equal parts; sehsawm suah sehkhat is one tenth, a tithe) (e:sehsawm suah ~ hi ding hi/sehsawm suah ~ na pia ding uh hi | you shall give one tenth/an piang sehsawm suah ~ khempeuh | all the tithes of the produce/sathau sung pan sehsawm suah ~ hong paipihin | bringing the tithe of the oil) (r:4.29.10/5.14.28/4.28.29/16.13.12) (q:draft)
sehkhatte = (t:n) (w:one part/portions/tithes) (d:sehkhat, one part, with the plural te: the people or things that make up one part; seh thum ah sehkhatte is a third of them, and sehsawm suah sehkhatte are tithes) (e:Tua a suakta ~ pen/adang seh thum ah ~ Sur kulhkongpi-ah omin | another third being at the Sur Gate/anpalte, leh sehsawm suah ~ | the firstfruits and the tithes) (b:sehkhat) (r:38.13.9/16.12.44/12.11.6) (q:draft)
