sehkhia = (t:v) (w:measure off/parcel out/apportion) (d:seh, portion or assign, with khia, out: mark out land in portions) (e:Sukkot gamkuam ka ~ ding hi) (b:seh) (r:19.60.6/19.108.7) (q:draft)
sehkhin = (t:v) (w:have appointed/have set apart) (d:seh, appoint, with khin, already done; the NIV has anointed) (e:Topa in kei hong ~ ahih manin) (b:seh) (r:42.4.18) (q:draft)
