sehkholhin = (t:v) (w:appointing beforehand) (d:seh, appoint, with kholh, beforehand, and the linking suffix in) (e:~ a kikoihsa sihna-ah) (r:18.30.23) (q:draft)
sehkholhpa = (t:n) (w:the appointed man) (d:seh, appoint, with kholh, beforehand, and pa marking a man: the man appointed beforehand) (e:amah in a ~ tawh leitung mite) (r:44.17.31) (q:draft)
