Sheatiel = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Shealtiel) (d:spelling of Shealtiel, the father of Zerubbabel) (r:37.1.12)
Sheba = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Sheba) (d:name of several men, among them a son of Joktan and a son of Raamah; also the land whose queen visited Solomon) (r:1.10.28/1.10.7)
