Shebarim = (t:name) (c:place) (w:Shebarim) (d:place near Ai as far as which the men of Ai chased the Israelites; the NIV translates it as the stone quarries) (r:6.7.5)
Shebat = (t:name) (w:Shebat) (d:the eleventh month of the Hebrew calendar, about January to February) (r:38.1.7)
Sheber = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Sheber) (d:son of Caleb by his concubine Maakah) (r:13.2.48)
Shebna = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Shebna) (d:high official of King Hezekiah, palace administrator and later secretary, rebuked by the prophet Isaiah) (e:neihsa kempa ~ kiangah pai in la) (r:23.22.15/12.19.2) (q:draft)
Shebnah = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Shebna) (d:spelling of Shebna, the secretary of King Hezekiah) (r:12.18.18)
Shebuel = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Shubael) (d:name of two Levites: a descendant of Gershom son of Moses in charge of the treasuries, and a son of Heman the musician) (r:13.23.16/13.26.24)
Shedeur = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Shedeur) (d:father of Elizur, the leader of the tribe of Reuben in the wilderness) (r:4.1.5/4.7.30)
Sheerah = (t:name) (c:female) (w:Sheerah) (d:woman of the tribe of Ephraim who built Lower and Upper Beth Horon and Uzzen Sheerah) (r:13.7.24)
