Shelomi = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Shelomi) (d:father of Ahihud, the leader of the tribe of Asher who helped divide the land of Canaan) (e:~’ tapa Ahihud ahi hi) (r:4.34.19) (q:draft)
Shelomith = (t:name) (w:Shelomith) (d:name of several people, among them the mother of a man who blasphemed in the wilderness, a daughter of Zerubbabel, and a child of King Rehoboam) (r:3.24.11/15.8.10)
Shelomoth = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Shelomoth) (d:name of several Levites, among them a son of Shimei and the chief of the descendants of Izhar) (r:13.23.9/13.24.22)
