silkhia = (t:v) (w:wash off/wash out) (d:sil, wash, with khia, out or off: wash something off, as written words washed off into water) (e:tuisia sungah ~ ding hi) (s:sawpkhia) (b:sil) (r:4.5.23) (q:draft)
silkhit = (t:v) (w:finish washing) (d:sil, wash, with khit, finish: used with ciangin for after washing) (e:Amah a ~ uh ciangin) (r:44.9.37) (q:draft)
silkik = (t:v) (w:wash again) (d:sil, wash, with kik, again) (e:a khe simloh ~ ding kisam) (b:sil) (r:43.13.10) (q:draft)
