sim = (t:v) (w:count/number) (d:count people or things to find their number; sim zo is be able to count) (e:a beh beh-in na ~ ding hi/Vantung lam enin aksite ~ in | look toward heaven and count the stars/mi phazah va ~ un | go and count the people/ama kum phazah zong i ~ zo kei hi | we cannot count the number of his years either) (s:tuat) (r:4.4.29/1.15.5/10.24.2/18.36.26) (q:draft)
