simmawhte = (t:n) (w:those who despise/scorners/revilers) (d:simmawh despise with te: the ones who despise or insult) (e:Mizawngte a ~ a khial hi a/Pasian ~ nuam takin nungta hi | those who despise God live at ease/kei hong ~ in ciamsiatna-in ka min zang uh | those who scorn me use my name as a curse) (b:simmawh) (r:20.14.21/19.102.8/18.12.6) (q:draft)
