sisakzaw = (t:v) (w:kill instead/rather kill) (d:sisak kill with zaw, rather) (e:pulnatna tawh ahi zongin ka ~ ding hi) (s:thatzaw) (b:sisak) (r:24.14.12) (q:draft)
