sit = (t:v) (w:examine/try/judge) (d:look closely into a person or a case in order to judge; thu sit is examine a case, try someone, call to account) (e:nang manin thu hong ~ leh/Kei hong ~ in la | examine me/Na nasempa, thu hong ~ kei in | do not bring your servant to judgment/Amah in mi khempeuh thu ~ ding a | he will bring judgment on all people/Kei thu hong ~ uh ciangin | when they examined my case) (s:sittel/entel/kantel/thusit) (r:18.11.10/19.143.2/19.139.23/24.25.31/44.28.18) (q:draft)
sit = (t:v) (w:hold back/spare/leave over) (d:keep something back or leave it over; mostly with lo: sit loin, without holding anything back, bangmah sit lo, leave nothing) (e:Na aw ~ loin nakpi takin kiko in/kivak nading nangawn ~ loin a khia zo hi | she put in everything, not keeping back even what she had to live on/a zingsang dong bangmah ~ lo ding hi | he shall leave none of it until morning) (s:siit/sitlai) (r:23.58.1/41.12.44/3.7.15) (q:draft)
sit = (t:v) (w:dictate) (d:say words aloud for another person to write down) (e:Jeremiah in hong ~ ahi hiam/Amah in hih thu khempeuh hong ~ a | he dictated all these words to me/kong ~ hih laizial sunga na gelh | written in this scroll as I dictated to you) (r:24.36.17/24.36.18/24.36.6) (q:draft)
sita = (t:v) (w:have died/be dead/perish) (d:si die, with ta showing that the state has now come about, has died, is dead; of a tree, has withered) (e:na theikung samsiat a ~ hi/Naboth kideng khinzo a, amah ~ hi | Naboth has been stoned and he is dead/Naboth nungta nawn lo hi; ~ hi | Naboth is no longer alive; he is dead/kote ~ le ung phamawh hong sa lo | do you not care if we perish) (a:nungta) (b:si) (r:41.11.21/11.21.14/11.21.15/41.4.38) (q:draft)
sitawm = (t:v) (w:die of itself/die naturally) (d:of an animal, die by itself and not by slaughter; si, die, with tawm, of its own accord) (e:Ama thu-a a ~ ganhing peuhmah/ama thu-in a ~ ganhing sa | the meat of an animal that died of itself/ama thu-in a ~ mawkte hitaleh | or those that simply died of themselves) (r:5.14.21/26.4.14/26.44.31) (q:draft)
sitbaang = (t:adj) (w:defective/blemished) (d:having a defect or fault; mostly negated, sitbaang lo, without defect, blameless) (e:a vekpi-in a ~ lo/Note in a ~ khat peuhpeuh na pia kei | you shall not offer anything that has a defect/a ~ ganhing hong pia mi khempa | the cheat who offers me a blemished animal/a ~ lo a nu khat hi ding a | it shall be a female without defect) (s:sitbang) (r:4.29.36/3.22.20/39.1.14/3.4.32) (q:draft)
