sitna = (t:n) (w:covering/overlay/veil) (d:something laid over a surface; biakna tau sitna an overlay for the altar, mai sitna a veil over the face) (e:tua mai ~ in a sin hi/biakna tau ~ kuangdai dingin seek un | hammer them into sheets to overlay the altar/mai ~ om loin limlang i et mah bangin | with unveiled faces, as when we look in a mirror) (s:khuhna) (r:47.3.14/4.16.39/4.16.38/47.3.18) (q:draft)
