sot = (t:v) (w:extend/prolong/lengthen) (d:make a time or a course go on longer; hun sot is to give more time) (e:a hun hong ~ in/ama thusia sawmna a maban ~ sak kei in | do not let his evil plan go further) (s:sotto/sausak) (a:tomsak/khiapsak) (r:9.11.3/19.140.8) (q:draft)
