sotsak = (t:v) (w:extend/enlarge/prolong) (d:sot, extend, with sak, cause: make a border wider or let a plan go further) (e:na gamgi uh hong ~ ciangin/ama thusia sawmna a maban ~ kei in | do not let his evil plan go further) (s:keeksak) (a:tomsak) (b:sot) (r:5.12.20/19.140.8) (q:draft)
sotto = (t:v) (w:lengthen/extend/prolong) (d:make longer in time, add to; hun sotto is to put off or delay; also go on further) (e:ci-in a hun ~ kei in/na khan uh kum bangzah ~ thei | able to add any years to your life/nai khat sung bek a ~ thei kua om | who can add even a single hour/amaute in ~ khangto thei lo ding uh hi | they will not be able to get any further) (s:sot/sausak) (a:tomsak) (b:sot) (r:20.3.28/40.6.27/42.12.25/55.3.9) (q:draft)
