suahkik = (t:v) (w:be born again) (d:suah, be born, with kik, again: be born a second time) (e:mi khatpeuh a ~ kei leh/Na ~ ding ahi hi | you must be born again/tui le Kha Siangtho tawh a ~ kei leh | unless one is born of water and the Holy Spirit/bangci ~ thei ding ahi hiam | how can he be born again) (b:suah) (r:43.3.3/43.3.7/43.3.5/43.3.4) (q:draft)
