suahzo = (t:v) (w:be able to make/can make into) (d:suah with zo, be able; mi cingtaak suahzo, able to make people perfect) (e:mi cingtaak ~ ngei lo hi) (s:suahthei/suaksakzo) (b:suah) (r:58.10.1) (q:draft)
