suanghawmpite = (t:n) (w:great caves/caverns) (d:suanghawm cave with pi, great, and plural te) (e:~ sung le keenhawmte sungah) (b:suanghawm) (r:23.2.20) (q:draft)
suanghawmte = (t:n) (w:clefts of the rocks/caves) (d:suanghawm, rock hollow, with plural te) (e:mual tung khempeuh leh ~ panin) (b:suanghawm) (r:24.16.16) (q:draft)
