suangheng = (t:n) (w:crag/rock cliff) (d:a steep rock face; suangheng kawm is a cleft in the crag) (e:~ kawmte phualpi-in nei uh hi/~ kawm-a vasa bangin nang na bubu niloh hi | you keep hiding like a bird in the clefts of the crag) (s:suangheeng/suangkeen) (r:18.39.28/22.2.14) (q:draft)
