suangkangtui = (t:n) (w:whitewash/lime wash) (d:suangkang, white stone, with tui, water: lime mixed with water for whitening walls and tombs) (e:~ a kizut, han tawh kibang) (s:leikang) (r:40.23.27) (q:draft)
