suangtangte = (t:n) (w:stones/slingstones) (d:suangtang, a small stone, with the plural te; lot ding suangtangte are stones for slinging) (e:thalte, lot ding ~ bawl hi) (s:suangte) (b:suangtang) (r:14.26.14) (q:draft)
