suanin = (t:v) (w:load/place on/put on) (d:putting a load on the shoulder, on the head or on a pack animal, and then doing the next action) (e:liangko tungah naupang tawh ~ amah sawl khia/a late uh antang ~ a paikhia uh hi | they loaded their donkeys with grain and left/a khawhsate uh khawmin laate tungah ~ | gathering their crops and loading them on donkeys/Amah in keel lu tungah tuate ~ | he shall put them on the head of the goat) (s:vawhin/guangin) (r:1.21.14/16.13.15/1.42.26/3.16.21) (q:draft)
