suat = (t:v) (w:load/lay on/put on) (d:place a load, a burden or a yoke on someone) (e:midangte’ liangko tungah a ~ uh hangin/a puak hak van midangte na ~ uh hangin | though you load others with burdens hard to carry/kote tungah hong ~ hakkol zang sak in | lighten the yoke he put on us/Ka pa in note’ tungah vangik hong ~ banah | besides the heavy load my father laid on you) (r:40.23.4/14.10.9/42.11.46/11.12.14) (q:draft)
