sumkhekte = (t:n) (w:money changers) (d:sumkhek, change money, with the plural te: the people who change money for others, as in the temple courts) (e:~ zong a sumkhekna sabuai-ah a tu/~’ sabuai zong sawnpaih sakin | he also overturned the tables of the money changers/~’ sabuaite lumlet sakin | overturning the tables of the money changers) (s:sumkheekte) (b:sumkhek) (r:43.2.14/41.11.15/43.2.15) (q:draft)
