sumzuak sumleina = (t:n) (w:marketplace) (d:sumzuak sumlei, trade, with the noun suffix na; sumzuak sumleina mun is the place of selling and buying) (e:~ mun panin kisukcipna leh khemna) (s:sumbuk) (b:sumzuak sumlei) (r:19.55.11)
