Sun = (t:n) (w:day/daytime) (d:sun, day, written with a capital at the start of a sentence or as a name: the light part of the day, the opposite of zan, night) (e:Pasian in khuavak pen ~ ci a/~ sawmli leh zan sawmli sung | for forty days and forty nights/~ tawntung-a ka lungngaih-ngaih ahi hi | I think about it all day long/~ lai takin kongkhak kikhak ngei lo hi | by day its gates are never shut) (a:Zan) (b:sun) (r:1.1.5/1.7.12/19.119.97/66.21.25) (q:draft)
