sutin = (t:v) (w:plundering/robbing/seizing) (d:sut, plunder, with the linking ending in: taking by force and then doing the next action) (e:midangte’ inn lamsate ~ a tang hi/mi’ na ~, mite tungah a sia gamta tawntung hi | he robbed others and always did wrong to people/hong hehsak mite’ neihsa ~ lak sakin | seizing the goods of the people who anger me/amau in ~, manin, Babilon khua-ah a paipih ding | they will plunder it, seize it and carry it to Babylon) (b:sut) (r:18.20.19/26.18.18/23.10.6/24.20.5) (q:draft)
