takte = (t:part) (d:the strengthening particle tak followed by the plural te, which makes the phrase before it mean those who or the things that, as in a taisuak dek takte, those who are just escaping) (e:a taisuak dek ~ tungah/na thuak ding lai ~ kihta kei in | do not be afraid of what you are about to suffer/suangmanpha nam khempeuh tampi ~ ban-ah | besides great quantities of every kind of precious stone) (b:tak) (r:61.2.18/66.2.10/13.29.2) (q:draft, low confidence)
