takun = (t:conj) (w:while/when) (d:tak with the plural ending un, in lai takun, at the very time when they) (e:a om lai ~ a suah hun tung a/Mite in an a thuk kholh lai ~ | while the people were preparing the meal/Mawhna’ sila-ah na om lai ~ | when you were slaves to sin/Farisaite a kikhop lai ~ Zeisu in | while the Pharisees were gathered, Jesus/Tua mite a paikhiat lai ~ | while those men were going out) (s:laitakun) (b:tak) (r:42.2.6/44.8.36/44.10.10/45.6.20/40.22.41/40.9.32) (q:draft)
