tanga = (t:part) (d:tang after guak, bare, or hing, alive, names the state someone is in, with the linking a, as in guak tanga naked and a hing tanga while alive) (e:a hing ~ mei sunga a em bangin/minamte in guak ~ na omna hong mu ding a | the nations will see your nakedness) (r:24.29.22/34.3.5) (q:draft, low confidence)
tangah = (t:adv) (w:on the head/on/upon) (d:tang with the place marker ah: on the top or surface of something; mostly in lu tangah, on the head, and also in lei keu tangah, on the dry ground) (e:lu ~ a nilhsak hi/ama lu ~ a khusak uh a | they put it on his head/kumpilukhu a lu ~ a khu hi | she wore a crown on her head/a lu ~ ama natna om ahi hi | his disease is on his head/lei keu ~ na sung ding hi | you shall pour it on the dry ground) (r:41.14.3/43.19.2/66.12.1/3.13.44/2.4.9) (q:draft, low confidence)
