tangding = (t:prep) (w:for/in exchange for/in place of) (d:placed between two nouns, the first given or counted in place of the second, as mit tangding mit eye for eye; also written tang ding) (e:satna ~ satna pia ding hi/mit ~ mit, ha ~ ha | eye for eye, tooth for tooth/tua ciangin nuntakna ~ nuntakna | then life for life/eite ~ mawhna a suaksak hi | he made him to be sin for us/amah in bawngtal ~ bawngtal pia ding a | he shall pay bull for bull) (s:tangdingin/tangin) (r:2.21.25/2.21.24/2.21.23/47.5.21/2.21.36) (q:draft)
tangdinga = (t:prep) (w:for/in place of) (d:tangding, in place of, with the linking a) (e:A dik mi ~ a si ding) (s:tangdingin) (b:tangding) (r:45.5.7) (q:draft)
tangdingin = (t:prep) (w:in place of/instead of/for/on behalf of) (d:placed after the person or thing that is replaced or represented) (e:tuute ~ ka nuntakna ka paai hi/tacil khempeuh ~ Levi mite ka la khin hi | I have taken the Levites in place of all the firstborn/Mite ~ mi khat a sih leh a pha hi | it is good that one man die for the people/amah in nangmah ~ kei hong kep nadingin | so that he might care for me in your place) (s:tangin/taangin/tangding) (b:tangding) (r:43.10.15/4.8.18/43.18.14/57.1.13) (q:draft)
