tangguakin = (t:adv) (w:naked/without clothes) (d:tangguak, naked, with the adverb ending in: in a naked state) (e:nei loin ~ i suah mah bangin/~ na om lai | when you were naked/~ a om mite puan silhsakin | clothing those who are naked/a nasemte’ numeite’ muhna-ah tuni-in a ~ omin | going naked today in the sight of his servants’ women) (s:pumguakin) (b:tangguak) (r:21.5.15/26.16.22/23.58.7/10.6.20) (q:draft)
