tangsak = (t:v) (w:make straight/make level/straighten) (d:make a road or path straight and level, as in lampi tangsak) (e:Ama lampi na ~ un/ka mai-ah na lampi ~ in | make your way straight before me/na paina lampi uh na ~ un | make the paths you walk on level/Topa paina lam na ~ in | make the way of the Lord straight) (s:mamsak/neelsak) (r:42.3.4/19.5.8/58.12.13/43.1.23) (q:draft)
tangsak = (t:v) (w:make shine/let shine/give light to) (d:cause light to shine on someone or something; taang, shine, here written tang, with the causative sak) (e:na khuavak uh mite mai-ah na ~ un/miphate leh migilote tungah ama ni a ~ kim | he makes his sun shine on the good and the evil alike/kote lungsim uhah khuavak a hong ~ hi | he made light shine in our hearts/Pasian’ vang in tua khuapi a ~ a | the glory of God gives the city light) (s:taangsak/vaaksak) (r:40.5.16/40.5.45/47.4.6/66.21.23) (q:draft)
tangsapna = (t:n) (w:need/lack/want) (d:what someone lacks or requires; bangmah tangsapna nei lo is lack nothing) (e:bangmah ~ nei lo uh hi/minam khempeuh ~ na cingsak hi | you met the needs of all nations) (s:kisapna/kitangsapna) (a:hauhna) (r:16.9.21/26.27.33) (q:draft)
tangtakin = (t:adv) (w:straight/directly/truthfully) (d:straight ahead without turning aside; of teaching, truly and without partiality) (e:A vekpi-in ~ mai hong nawt uh a/amau mai ciatah ~ khuapi sungah pai uh a | each went straight ahead into the city/a kung lam zuanin ~ ka tai hi | I run straight on toward the goal/Pasian thu a ~ na hilh | you teach the word of God truthfully) (r:29.2.7/41.12.14/6.6.20/50.3.14/40.22.16) (q:draft)
tangtakpi = (t:see) <tangtakpi-in>
tangtakpi-in = (t:adv) (w:plainly/clearly/openly) (d:of speaking: plainly, without holding anything back) (e:~ hong gen in) (s:teltakin) (r:43.10.24) (q:draft)
tangtang = (t:v) (d:tang said twice, apparently for an action that keeps going on; in gam tangtang, keep moving past, and in an tangtang, keep on fasting) (e:Amah gam ~ napi-in/an na ~ lai ding ka hi uh hiam | should we still go on fasting) (r:18.9.11/38.7.2) (q:draft, low confidence)
tangtanglai = (t:v) (w:keep fasting/go on fasting) (d:an tang, abstain from food, with tang repeated and lai, still) (e:an na ~ ding ka hi uh hiam) (r:38.7.2) (q:draft, low confidence)
tangtawng = (t:n) (w:ancient times/long ago/of old) (d:the far past; before a noun, ancient: tangtawng mualtung gamte, the ancient heights) (e:~ pek lai-in kei hong bawl a/Hih ~ mualtung gamte tu-in eima aa hita hi | these ancient heights have now become ours/Ama gui pen ~ pek tawh kizom hi | his line goes back to ancient times/~ pek panin a hong kihilh suksuk | handed down from long ago) (s:tanglai/taangtawng/hunlui) (r:20.8.23/26.36.2/33.5.2/40.15.2) (q:draft)
tangtawnga = (t:adv) (w:long ago/of old/in ancient times) (d:tangtawng, ancient times, with the linking ending a, used before a verb or noun) (e:~ ama sep lak pan/a tuaci mahin ~ kisehsa hi a | it was already decided long ago) (s:sawtpekin) (b:tangtawng) (r:20.8.22/21.6.10) (q:draft)
tangte = (t:n) (w:bones/joints) (d:in the pair guh le tangte or guh leh tangte, the bones and frame of the body) (e:guh leh ~ adingin cidamna ahi hi) (s:guhte) (r:20.16.24/49.4.16) (q:draft, low confidence)
