tangtungzo = (t:v) (w:be able to succeed/succeed) (d:tangtung, be fulfilled, with zo, be able) (e:a ~ kei veve ding hi) (b:tangtung) (r:27.11.17) (q:draft)
tangtunna = (t:n) (w:fulfilment/accomplishment) (d:tangtun, fulfil, with the noun suffix na) (e:deihna ~ pen lungdamna ahi hi) (b:tangtun) (r:20.13.12) (q:draft)
tangtunsak = (t:v) (w:fulfil/accomplish/carry out) (d:tangtun with the causative sak: bring a word, plan or promise to completion) (e:ka khapsa thu ka ~ hun/ka thugente ka ~ nadingin | so that I may fulfil my words/A lungsim sunga a tupna teng a ~ matengin | until he carries out all the purposes of his heart/na geelsa uh na ~ theih nadingun | so that you can carry out what you planned) (s:tangtungsak/cingsak) (b:tangtun) (r:24.33.14/24.23.20/24.1.12/47.8.11) (q:draft)
