tangun = (t:prep) (w:by/according to) (d:in a beh tangun, by their clans, clan by clan) (e:a beh ~ tul thum leh zanih/a beh ~ tulnih leh za sagih | by their clans, two thousand seven hundred) (r:4.4.44/4.4.36) (q:draft, low confidence)
