tanin = (t:v) (w:breaking off/severing) (d:after a verb of striking, so that the thing is broken through: deng tanin is striking and breaking) (e:milim khete deng ~ a kithehthang hi/gamlak oliv kung taktak panin hong sat ~ | cut off from a truly wild olive tree) (b:tan) (r:27.2.34/45.11.24) (q:draft, low confidence)
