Tankhiapa = (t:n) (w:Redeemer) (d:the one who redeems, tankhia with pa; capitalised as a title of God) (e:Ahih hangin amaute a ~ hat a/nangmah Honpa, nangmah ~, Jakob’ Vanglian Pa | your Savior, your Redeemer, the Mighty One of Jacob/nang hong ~, nang hong Honpa Topa | your Redeemer, your Savior, the Lord) (s:Tanpa/Honpa) (b:tankhiapa) (r:24.50.34/23.49.26/23.60.16) (q:draft)
