tanzauna = (t:n) (w:spaciousness/abundance/wideness) (d:tanzau, spacious, with the noun suffix na; a tanzauna mun is a spacious place, a place of abundance) (e:a ~ munah nong paipih hi) (b:tanzau) (r:19.66.12) (q:draft)
tanzumte = (t:n) (w:hips/hip joints) (d:a part of the body named with phei thigh, where the NIV has legs and the KJV joints of thy thighs; with the plural te) (e:Na phei leh na ~) (r:22.7.1) (q:draft, low confidence)
