teello = (t:v) (w:not choose) (d:teel, choose, written together with the negative lo: did not choose, has not chosen) (e:Topa in hih pa zong ~ hi/Efraim minamte ~ hi | he did not choose the tribe of Ephraim/Topa in hih mite ~ hi | the Lord has not chosen these/amaute’ lakah mi khat zong a ~ ding | not choosing even one from among them) (b:teel) (r:9.16.8/19.78.67/9.16.10/24.33.26) (q:draft)
teelna = (t:n) (w:choice/choosing/election) (d:teel, choose, with the noun suffix na: the act of choosing, and God’s election of his people; a teelna mun is the place he chooses) (e:note hong sapna leh hong ~ kipsak nadingin/Topa in a ~ munah | at the place the Lord chooses/Pasian’ ~ tawh kisai-in | as far as God’s election is concerned/Pasian’ ~ pen a teel mite’ nasepna hang hi loin | God’s choice is not because of the works of those he chose) (s:teelkhiatna) (b:teel) (r:61.1.10/5.15.20/45.11.28/45.9.11) (q:draft)
teelnasa = (t:adj) (w:chosen) (d:teel, choose, with na and sa, already done; ka teelnasa mun, the place I have chosen) (e:ka ~ munah amaute ka ciahpih ding) (b:teel) (r:16.1.9) (q:draft)
teelpa = (t:n) (w:chosen one) (d:the man whom someone has chosen; pa marks a man) (e:Ka ~ tawh thuciamna khat ka bawl zo a/ama mai-ah a ~ Moses ding hi kei leh | had not Moses his chosen one stood before him/nang in ka hong ~ na hi hi | you are the one I have chosen) (b:teel) (r:19.89.3/19.106.23/37.2.23) (q:draft)
teelpa = (t:n) (w:chooser) (d:the one who chooses, as in note hong teelpa, whoever chooses you) (e:note hong ~ in a etsathuai ahi hi) (b:teel) (r:23.41.24) (q:draft, low confidence)
teelsa = (t:adj) (w:chosen/elect) (d:already chosen; after a possessive also the chosen one of someone) (e:ka ~ Israel aw, tu-in za in/ama nasem Moses leh ama ~ Aaron sawl hi | he sent Moses his servant and Aaron his chosen one/a ~ mite lei kiu li pan | his chosen people from the four corners of the earth/Topa’ ~ Rufas leh a nu | Rufus, chosen of the Lord, and his mother) (s:kiteelsa) (b:teel) (r:23.44.1/19.105.26/41.13.27/45.16.13) (q:draft)
Teelsa = (t:adj) (w:chosen) (d:teelsa, chosen, capitalised as a title of the Son) (e:ka ~ ka Tapa ahi hi) (b:teelsa) (r:42.9.35) (q:draft)
