teelsate = (t:n) (w:chosen ones/elect) (d:the people who have been chosen, used of those God has chosen) (e:Pasian’ ~ kua in a mawhsak ding hiam/A ~ bek in a ngah uh hi | only the elect obtained it/a ~ adingin a tomsak ding hi | for the sake of the elect he will shorten them/a ~ nangawn a khem zawh leh | to deceive even the elect, if possible) (s:teeltuamte/teelte) (b:teelsa) (r:45.8.33/40.24.22/45.11.7/41.13.20/40.24.24) (q:draft)
