teelte = (t:n) (w:chosen ones/the choice/the best) (d:those who are chosen or picked out, as chosen disciples or choice rams) (e:Jesuh le a nungzui ~ paisuk uh a/tuutal ~ bangin hong kithatlum ding hi | you will be slaughtered like choice rams) (s:teelsate) (b:teel) (r:42.6.17/24.25.34) (q:draft)
