teeltuamte = (t:n) (w:chosen ones) (d:teel, choose, with tuam, apart, and the plural te: those specially chosen, said of the people God has chosen) (e:ama ~ aw/Jakob’ suante, ama ~ aw | children of Jacob, his chosen ones) (s:teelsate/teelte) (b:teeltuam) (r:13.16.13) (q:draft)
