teelzo = (t:v) (w:have chosen/choose) (d:teel, choose, with zo, showing the action is accomplished) (e:Topa na Pasian un note hong ~ hi) (b:teel) (r:5.7.6) (q:draft)
teem = (t:v) (w:waste away/shrink/wither) (d:of a part of the body, waste away or shrink; said of the thigh in the curse of Numbers 5, where the NIV has the womb miscarry and older English versions have rot or fall away) (e:a pheipi ~ ding a/na pumpi pawm sakin na pheipi ~ sak hen | may your belly swell and your thigh waste away/Topa in na pheipi ~ sakin | when the Lord makes your thigh waste away) (a:pawm) (r:4.5.27/4.5.21/4.5.22) (q:draft, low confidence)
