teemsak = (t:v) (w:make waste away/make miscarry) (d:teem, waste away, with the causative sak: make a part of the body waste away; said of the thigh or womb in the curse of Numbers 5) (e:na pheipi ~ hen) (b:teem) (r:4.5.22) (q:draft, low confidence)
