teengsate = (t:n) (w:inhabitants/those who were living) (d:teeng, dwell, with sa, already, and te, those who: those who had settled in the land) (e:a na ~ in lai-in gelh uh hi) (s:tengsate) (r:15.4.6) (q:draft, low confidence)
