tegel = (t:adv) (w:both/the two) (d:placed after a noun or pronoun: the two of them, both together) (e:amau ~ ama zi suak uh hi/amau ~ kithat ding hi | both of them must be put to death/a mo ~ tawh tua nu dingkhia a | she set out with her two daughters-in-law/Tua mi ~ kua pen khah leng | which of the two shall I release) (r:9.25.43/3.16.21/3.20.11/8.1.7/40.27.21)
