telmuh = (t:v) (w:see clearly/see through) (d:tel, clearly, with muh, the form of mu, see: see something plainly, as God sees the thoughts of people) (e:mihingte ngaihsutna ~ zawkan ding hilo) (s:muhtel/mutel) (r:20.15.11) (q:draft)
telna = (t:n) (w:understanding/discernment/insight) (d:tel, understand, with the noun suffix na: understanding or insight; thu telna is a good grasp of matters) (e:thu theihna leh thu ~ tawh a kidim/cih hong ~ leh hong theihna uhah | in understanding and knowing me) (s:theihtelna/thutelna/teltheihna) (a:mawlna) (b:tel) (r:14.2.12/24.9.24) (q:draft)
telna = (t:n) (w:choosing/choice) (d:a telna mun is the place he chooses; the word is teelna, from teel, choose, written here with one e) (e:Pasian un a ~ munah) (s:teelna) (r:5.16.11) (q:draft, low confidence)
telnasa = (t:adj) (w:chosen) (d:ka telnasa mun, the place I have chosen; apparently the word teelnasa, from teel, choose, written with one e) (e:ka ~ munah amaute ka ciahpih ding) (s:teelnasa/teelsa) (b:telna) (r:16.1.9) (q:draft, low confidence)
telnop = (t:adj) (w:easy to understand/plain/clear) (d:tel, understand, with nop, easy or pleasant: easy to understand) (e:Thungaihsun theite’ adingin ~ a) (a:telhak/theihhak) (r:20.8.9) (q:draft)
telsak = (t:v) (w:make understand/show clearly) (d:tel, understand, with the causative sak; theih telsak, make someone know clearly) (e:Ka khialhna hong theih ~ dih un) (s:theitelsak/laktel) (b:tel) (r:18.6.24) (q:draft)
