tengbek = (t:adv) (w:only that much/only this/all) (d:teng all of it with bek only; tua tengbek hi lo is that is not all) (e:Tua ~ hi nai lo lai hi/Tu-a ~ hi loin adang zong | not only this but more besides) (r:17.5.12/26.36.37) (q:draft)
tengin = (t:v) (w:dwell/dwelling) (d:teng, live, with the linking ending in: dwelling in a place, after which the next action follows) (e:Israel mite lakah keimah ~/Nangma inn sungah ~ | dwelling in your house/kote hong ~ mikhat i suak ding hi | we will settle and become one people) (s:teengin) (b:teng) (r:2.29.45/19.84.4/1.34.16)
