thopi = (t:n) (c:animal) (w:fly/large fly) (d:tho, a fly, with pi, big; in Ecclesiastes 10.20 it stands where English versions have a bird) (e:~ hon bangin hong pai nading) (r:23.7.18/21.10.20) (q:draft, low confidence)
