thopthopin = (t:adv) (d:thopthop with the suffix in: hih thopthopin is treating with contempt, making a laughingstock of) (e:gamdang khempeuh’ hih ~ nang kong koih hi) (b:thopthop) (r:26.22.4/47.11.20) (q:draft, low confidence)
