thosakin = (t:v) (w:raising/raising up) (d:thosak, raise or make rise, with the linking ending in, used when another action follows) (e:mi sisate nangawn ~ a nuntaksak mah bangin/amaute ~ note kihuh sak un la | let them rise up and help you/a sisa mite ~ a hingsak thei pa | the one who raises the dead and gives them life) (b:thosak) (r:43.5.21/5.32.38/43.11.25) (q:draft)
thosakkik = (t:v) (w:raise again/raise from the dead) (d:thosak, make rise, with kik, again: raise someone again from death) (e:sihna panin tua Jesuh a ~) (s:thokiksak/hingsakkik/thawhkiksak) (b:thosak) (r:48.1.1) (q:draft)
