thosakpa = (t:n) (w:the one who raised) (d:thosak make rise with pa marking a man: he who raised someone up) (e:sihna pan a ~ in Zeisu tawh) (b:thosak) (r:47.4.14) (q:draft)
thosaksa = (t:see) <sian'thosaksa>
