thozo = (t:v) (w:be able to rise/be able to get up) (d:tho rise, with zo, be able; thozo nawn lo is unable to rise again) (e:~ nawn lo uh hi/tuk unla, ~ nawn kei un | fall and rise no more/amah zong ~ pahin | she too was able to get up at once) (b:tho) (r:19.36.12/2.21.19/24.25.27/42.4.39) (q:draft)
thu = (t:prep) (w:about) (d:placed after a noun or name: about, concerning; with tawh kisai-in, in connection with) (e:Thawhkikna ~ panin Pasian in/Herod in Jesuh’ ~ a za hi | Herod heard about Jesus/Dan minamte' ~ genin | speaking about the tribe of Dan/Gamdangte’ ~ tawh kisai-in | concerning the nations) (s:tungtangah) (r:40.22.31/40.14.1/5.33.22/24.46.1)
thu = (t:n) (w:issue) (d:a matter or affair that is being dealt with or talked about) (e:Hih ~ tawh kisai-in siampite’ ngaihsutna dong | ask the priests for their view on this matter/hih ~ ah Pasian lungkim lo a | God was displeased with this matter/a patauh huai ~ khat | a shocking thing) (s:vai/tungtang) (r:37.2.11/13.21.7/24.5.30)
thu = (t:n) (w:theme/topic) (d:the thing that is spoken or thought about, a point or subject) (e:na phawk ding uh ~ khat om hi | there is one thing you should keep in mind/Hih ~ pen kuamah in hong nial thei lo | no one can deny this/a lamdang mahmah ~ thum om a | there are three things that are too wonderful) (s:thubul) (r:42.12.39/44.19.36/20.30.18)
thu = (t:v) (w:regarding) (e:ama Tapa’ ~ ahi hi | it is about his Son/Jeremiah’ ~ tawh kisai-in | regarding Jeremiah/Jesuh ~ tawh kisai-ah mihonte’ lungsim kituak lo | the crowd was divided regarding Jesus/Keima ~ tawh kisai-ah | concerning myself) (r:45.1.3/24.39.11/43.7.43/43.5.31)
