thu-umlote = (t:n) (w:unbelievers/unbeliever) (d:thu-um believe with lo not and the plural te: those who do not believe) (e:Thu-umte leh ~ in bangci ngah) (s:lawkite) (a:umte) (r:47.6.15) (q:draft)
thuah = (t:adv) (w:in addition/additionally/as well) (d:placed after a verb: do something in addition to what is already done, given or worn, as in ci thuah, say further, and silh thuah, wear an extra layer) (e:puanak na silh ~ kei un/mipilte in pilna mah ngah ~ hi | the wise gain knowledge as well/tua nate khempeuh zong hong kipia ~ ding hi | all these things will be given to you as well/ci ~ lai hi | she said further) (r:41.6.9/1.24.25/20.14.18/42.12.31) (q:draft)
