thudot = (t:v) (w:question/ask/inquire) (d:thu, matter, and dot, ask: put questions to someone) (e:kong ~ dingte hong dawng in) (s:dong/dot/thudong/thukan) (a:dawng) (r:18.38.3) (q:draft)
