thukna = (t:n) (w:depth/the deep/depths) (d:a deep place, of the sea or a pit, from thuk deep) (e:a ~ sungah amaute kiasuk uh hi/tuipi leh a ~ sung khempeuhah | in the seas and all their depths/leitung pen tui ~ tawh na tuam a | you covered the earth with the deep/Leinuai ~ mun dong kuang hi | it burns down to the depths of the realm of the dead) (s:thukpi/tuithuk) (a:sangna) (r:2.15.5/19.88.6/19.135.6/19.104.6/5.32.22) (q:draft)
