thuknate = (t:n) (w:depths/deeps/deep places) (d:thukna depth with the plural te; lei thuknate is the depths of the earth) (e:Lei ~ aw, awng un/nuai-a om a ~ tawh | with the deeps that lie below) (s:thukpite) (b:thukna) (r:23.44.23/5.33.13) (q:draft)
thuko = (t:v) (w:report/bring word/inform) (d:thuko mi is a person who comes with word from someone, a messenger) (e:nang’ kiang panin ~ mi hong tun) (r:10.15.28) (q:draft, low confidence)
thukpa = (t:n) (w:one who repays/avenger) (d:thuk repay, take revenge, with pa marking a man: he who pays back what was done) (e:nang tungah hong ~ in lungdamna ngah/khang thum, khang lina dongin a ~ | the one who repays to the third and fourth generation) (s:thukpahpa/phulapa) (b:thuk) (r:19.137.8/2.34.7) (q:draft)
thukpah = (t:v) (w:repay/pay back) (d:form of thuk, repay, used before pa: a thukpah pa is the one who repays) (e:suksiatna tawh a ~ pa ahihna) (r:5.7.10) (q:draft, low confidence)
thukpahpa = (t:n) (w:one who repays) (d:thukpah repay with pa marking a man: he who pays back) (e:suksiatna tawh a ~ ahihna thei un) (s:thukpa) (b:thukpah) (r:5.7.10) (q:draft)
thukpen = (t:adj) (w:deepest) (d:thuk deep with the superlative pen; in 2 Kings 19:23 of the innermost part of a forest) (e:guam ~ panin mual sangpen dawn dongin/a tulak ~ dongah ka lut hi | I have entered its deepest forest/khuamial ~ sung zongin | searching the deepest darkness) (a:sangpen) (r:19.95.4/12.19.23/18.28.3) (q:draft)
thukpenna = (t:n) (w:deepest part/depths) (d:thuk, deep, with pen, most, and na; usually a thukpenna mun, the deepest place) (e:Leinuai a ~ munah amaute’ han om hi/lei sung a ~ munah paisuk masa khinzo | he had first gone down to the lowest parts of the earth/tulak a ~ munah ka pai khin hi | I have gone into its deepest forest/dum ~ munah nangmah in amaute na lawnsuk ding | you will cast them down into the deepest pit) (s:thuktawng) (b:thukpen) (r:26.32.23/49.4.9/23.37.24/19.55.23) (q:draft)
thukpi = (t:adj) (w:deep/very deep) (d:thuk, deep, with the intensive pi: very deep, said of water, a pit, the earth or darkness; tui thukpi is the deep) (e:leihawm ~ taw panin/tui ~ panin kei hong kaikhia hi | he drew me out of deep waters/Tui ~ zong a ling hi | the deep also trembled/khuamial ~ ka nawk hangin ka lau kei hi | though I pass through deep darkness I am not afraid) (s:nakthuk) (b:thuk) (r:25.3.55/23.44.27/10.22.17/19.77.16/19.23.4) (q:draft)
thukpi = (t:n) (w:depths/the deep) (d:a deep place, the depths, in a thukpi, used without a noun before it) (e:a ~ sung panin nang tungah/lei sung a ~ dong hahkatin zong uh a | they search hard down to the depths of the earth) (s:thukna/tuithuk) (b:thuk) (r:19.130.1/18.28.3) (q:draft)
thukpi = (t:adj) (w:mysterious/hidden/secret) (d:of a matter, deep and hidden; thu thukpi is a mystery) (e:tua thu ~ mangmuhna tawh/upna thu ~ a zang ding uh hi | they must hold the deep truths of the faith) (s:simtham) (b:thuk) (r:27.2.19/54.3.9) (q:draft)
thukpipi = (t:adj) (w:very deep/lofty) (d:thukpi deep with a second pi for emphasis; kam thukpipi is deep or lofty words, eloquence) (e:mipilte’ zat kam ~ le pilna kamte) (b:thukpi) (r:46.2.1) (q:draft)
thukpite = (t:n) (w:deeps/depths/deep things) (d:thukpi with plural te; tui thukpite the deep waters, thu thukpite deep matters) (e:Topa in tui ~ uk a/tui ~ tuibem-ah koih hi | he puts the deep waters in storehouses/thu ~ leh thu simte a lakkhia hi | he reveals deep and hidden things/thu ~ gentel theihna a nei hi | he has the ability to explain deep matters) (s:thuknate/thuthukte) (b:thukpi) (r:19.29.10/27.2.22/19.33.7/27.5.12) (q:draft)
thuksak = (t:v) (w:avenge/repay/reward) (d:pay back on behalf of someone; of God, avenge a person on his enemies or repay each one according to his deeds) (e:a gamtatna ciat uh bangin a ~ ding hi/Ammon mite tungah nang ading hong ~ khin hi | he has avenged you on the Ammonites/ka to kumpipa adingin hong ~ hi | he has avenged my lord the king/A galte a ~ ding hun khat nei hi | he has a time to repay his enemies/note a dingin ka hong ~ ding hi | I will avenge you) (s:phulak/phula) (b:thuk) (r:40.16.27/7.11.36/10.4.8/23.34.8/24.51.36) (q:draft)
thuksakin = (t:v) (w:avenging/upholding the cause of) (d:thuksak avenge with the linking suffix in) (e:hong ~, keima nuai-ah mite a koihsuk Pasian/Nabal khut tung panin ka ngah zahkohna hong ~ | avenging the insult I received from Nabal) (b:thuksak) (r:10.22.48/9.25.39) (q:draft)
thuktawng = (t:n) (w:deepest part/utmost depth) (d:thuk deep with tawng, the inmost part or bottom; khuamial thuktawng is the deepest darkness) (e:khuamial ~ sung pan suang) (s:thukpenna) (r:18.28.3) (q:draft, low confidence)
