thungetsakin = (t:v) (w:praying for) (d:thungetsak, pray for someone, with the linking ending in) (e:nang ading ~ ka om hi) (b:thungetsak) (r:57.1.4) (q:draft)
thungetsakna = (t:n) (w:prayer for someone/intercession) (d:thungetsak, pray for someone, with the noun suffix na) (e:Note hong ~ le Jesuh Khrih) (s:ngetsakna) (b:thungetsak) (r:50.1.19) (q:draft)
thungette = (t:n) (w:prayers) (d:thunget praying with the plural te: the things prayed; the NIV has what you are saying) (e:Nangma ~ a theihtheih nading uh) (b:thunget) (r:46.14.16) (q:draft, low confidence)
