tuaksak = (t:v) (w:inflict/make suffer/bring upon) (d:tuak, meet with, and sak, cause: make someone meet with or undergo something, usually trouble or punishment) (e:Gimna lianpipite hong ~ nangmah in/amau’ mawhna amaute a ~ hi | he made them meet the penalty of their sin/Kisaktheihna in siatna hong ~ a | pride brings destruction/siatna hong ~ lo ding hi | he will not let harm come upon you/ze-etna hong ~ lo ding hi | he will not let temptation come upon you) (s:thuaksak) (b:tuak) (r:19.71.20/15.9.13/18.8.4/20.16.18/20.3.26/46.10.13) (q:draft)
tuaksuk = (t:v) (w:come down/go down/descend/jump down) (d:move downward from a higher place, also step, climb or jump down, the opposite of kahto, go up) (e:vantung pan a hong ~ ka mu hi/Na kumpi tokhomte tung panin hong ~ un | come down from your thrones/hih lai panin ~ in | throw yourself down from here/keen luvum panin ~ gawpin | rushing down the steep bank/tuikhuk sungah amaute ~ uh hi | they climbed down into the well) (s:paisuk/kumsuk/tuahsuk) (a:kahto/paito) (r:27.4.13/24.13.18/42.4.9/40.8.32/10.17.18) (q:draft)
tuaksukin = (t:v) (w:come down/alight) (d:tuaksuk go down, with the connective ending in) (e:Dawi zong hong ~ ama omna ding) (b:tuaksuk) (r:23.34.14) (q:draft, low confidence)
tuaksuksuak = (t:v) (w:go straight down/descend) (d:tuaksuk go down, with suak right through) (e:Hankhuk sungah amaute ~ ding uh a) (r:19.49.14) (q:draft, low confidence)
tuaktuak = (t:adv) (w:each/both alike) (d:reduplicated tuak, each; said of two who are equally so) (e:Thu a gen siam ~ mi nih) (r:20.18.18) (q:draft, low confidence)
tuakun = (t:adv) (w:both/each) (d:tuak, each, with the plural ending un, after a number: a nih tuakun is both of them) (e:A nih ~ Pasian’ muhna-ah a manin/a nih ~ Topa’ bawlsa ahi uh hi | both are made by the Lord/A nih ~ taikhawm uh a | the two of them ran together/a nih ~ kithat ding hi | both of them shall be put to death/a nih ~ hawkguamah kiakhawm ding uh hi | both will fall into a pit) (s:tegel) (b:tuak) (r:42.1.6/20.22.2/43.20.4/5.22.22/42.6.39) (q:draft)
tuakzaw = (t:v) (w:meet with more/encounter more) (d:tuak meet with, with zaw more) (e:sih dektakna tamvei ka ~ hi) (b:tuak) (r:47.11.23) (q:draft)
tual = (t:n) (w:court/courtyard/open space) (d:open enclosed space around or in front of a building: buk tual is the courtyard of the tabernacle, biakinn tual the court of the temple) (e:nisuahna lam buk ~ a vai in/Biakbuk ~ na bawl ding hi | you shall make the courtyard of the tabernacle/~ sungnung kongpi | the gate of the inner court/~ kongpi ading puankhai | the curtain for the gate of the courtyard) (s:huang/inntual) (r:2.27.13/26.40.47/2.27.9/26.46.1/2.35.17) (q:draft)
