tuleta = (t:n) (w:children and grandchildren/descendants) (d:tu, grandchild, le, and, ta, child, written as one word: children and grandchildren, the descendants a person has) (e:Note in ~ nei-in) (s:suanlekhak) (r:5.4.25) (q:draft)
