tumdang = (t:adj) (w:strange/unusual/extraordinary) (d:different from the ordinary; paired with lamdang, strange, wonderful) (e:a ~ ama nasep sem dingin/a ~ leh a lamdang ahi a lamdang nate | wonders that are strange and marvellous) (s:tuampian) (r:23.28.21/23.29.14) (q:draft)
