tummang = (t:v) (w:drown/engulf/sweep away/overwhelm) (d:of water, cover people so that they are lost; also be drowned, and of sorrow, overwhelm; tum with mang, out of sight) (e:Tui in amau’ langte ~ a/tui sungah a ~ uh hi | they were drowned in the water/tuihualte in hong ~ khin ding a | the torrents would have swept over us/tuipi husiate in hong ~ khin ding hi | the raging waters would have swept us away/a ~ loh nadingin | so that he will not be overwhelmed) (s:tuummang/tumcip) (r:19.106.11/58.11.29/19.124.4/19.124.5/47.2.7) (q:draft)
