tuzawh = (t:conj) (w:afterwards)
tuzawh = (t:conj) (w:next) (d:the time that comes next, counted from now: tuzawh ni sawmthum sungin is during the next thirty days) (e:~ ni sawmthum sungin kumpipa kiang longal/A kisehsa ~ kha kua ciangin | at the appointed time, nine months from now/~ kha kua khit ciangin kong paikik taktak ding | nine months from now I will surely return) (r:27.6.12/1.18.14/1.18.10)
