tuzumte = (t:n) (w:picks/iron picks) (d:tuzum, a pointed digging tool, with plural te) (e:sing-atnate leh ~ leh heite tawh) (b:tuzum) (r:13.20.3/10.12.31) (q:draft)
u = (t:n) (w:older brother/older sister/elder sibling) (d:an older sibling of either sex; a u a nau, older and younger siblings, stands for brothers and sisters in general) (e:A ~ a nau a it mi/Uz in a ~ pen hi | Uz was the eldest/A ~ in tapa khat nei-in | the older one had a son/A ~’ ma-in a nauzaw piak ding | to give the younger before the older) (a:nau/nauzaw) (r:62.2.10/1.29.26/1.22.21/1.19.37) (q:draft)
ua = (t:see) <sung-ua>
uang = (t:v) (w:be excessive/go to excess/be wild) (d:go beyond measure in something; of living, be wild and unrestrained; uang zat is use lavishly) (e:A paktatna ~ semsem a/noptatna lamsang ~ lua ahih ciangin | because he went to excess in wild living/leitung nopsakna-ah ~ lua hi ci-in | saying he goes to excess in worldly pleasure/Sumbawm panin khamte ~ zatin | lavishing gold from the purse/~ nekin na noptat mahmah uh hi | you have lived in luxury, eating to excess) (r:26.23.19/42.15.13/56.1.6/23.46.6/59.5.5) (q:draft)
