uangtatna = (t:n) (w:revelry/orgy/wild living) (d:uang be wild or excessive, with tat behave and the noun suffix na) (e:hukna lanna, zunekna, ~, zukham luatna) (s:noptatna) (r:60.4.3) (q:draft)
uap = (t:v) (w:accompany/attend/escort) (d:go with or go out to someone as a companion, as the friends who attend a bridegroom) (e:amah a ~ dingin tangval sawmthum/zinei thak pa a ~ dingin | to attend the bridegroom) (r:7.14.11/40.25.1) (q:draft)
uatsaknate = (t:see) <ki-uatsaknate>
uel = (t:see) <De-uel>
