veipi = (t:adv) (w:a long time/for long) (d:vei, time, with the intensive pi: after sau or sawt, long, it means for a very long time) (e:sau ~ sung peemta-in om hi/Kumpipa aw, sau ~ nungta in | O king, live long/Izipt ah sau ~ ka teeng uh hi | we lived in Egypt a long time/sawt ~ a taam hi | he stayed a long time/amah sau ~ a om khit ciangin | when he had been there a long time) (s:sawtpi) (a:tawlkhat) (b:vei) (r:1.21.34/27.6.21/4.20.15/44.9.43/1.26.8) (q:draft)
veipi = (t:adv) (w:many times/often) (d:vei, time, with the intensive pi: after tam, many, it means many times, again and again) (e:tam ~ hong kikham zo hi/Amah in amaute tam ~ honkhia hi | many times he delivered them/tam ~ a puk ngei zo hi | he has often fallen/amaute tungah tam ~ kilang a | he appeared to them many times/tam ~ samin, a hopih hi | he sent for him often and talked with him) (s:tamveipi/tamvei) (a:khatvei) (b:vei) (r:45.15.22/19.106.43/40.17.15/44.1.3/44.24.26) (q:draft)
veisak = (t:v) (w:afflict with/make suffer) (d:vei, suffer from a sickness, with the causative sak: make someone suffer from a disease, as Satan afflicted Job with sores; not from vei time) (e:a kihhuai meima ~ hi) (r:18.2.7) (q:draft)
veite = (t:n) (w:the sick/those who suffer) (d:vei, suffer from a sickness, with the plural te: those who have a disease) (e:cinatna pawl khempeuh a ~ ama kiangah) (s:cinate/micinate) (r:40.4.24) (q:draft)
veivei = (t:adv) (w:sometimes/at times) (d:used after khat: khat veivei, sometimes, now and then; said twice for sometimes this, sometimes that) (e:Khat ~ nitak-a kipan zingsang dong/khat ~ hoih kisa, khat ~ sia kisa uh | sometimes feeling right, sometimes feeling wrong/Khat ~ lamdung a tu khaici bang a | sometimes it is like seed fallen along the path/Khat ~ midikte in migilote’ gimthuak dingteng thuak | sometimes the righteous suffer what the wicked deserve) (s:khatveivei) (r:4.9.21/45.2.15/41.4.15/21.8.14) (q:draft)
veizaw = (t:adv) (w:more times/more often) (d:vei time with zaw, more; nihvei sangin a tam veizaw is more than twice) (e:nihvei sangin a tam ~ kihonkhia hi) (b:vei) (r:12.6.10) (q:draft)
vek = (t:see) <vek-a>
vek-a = (t:adv) (w:all/altogether) (d:a vek-a is all of it, the whole together) (e:A ~ a po kim ding ahi a) (s:vekin/vek-in) (r:21.11.6) (q:draft, low confidence)
