vekun = (t:adv) (w:all/all of them/altogether) (d:used as a vekun, all of them together, with a plural subject) (e:a ~ sal suak khin uh hi/gal sungah a ~ a sisak ka hihna | that I made them all die in battle) (s:vekin/vekpiun) (r:24.13.19/26.39.23) (q:draft)
vel = (t:v) (w:examine/inspect/look over) (d:look at something closely to find out its condition, as a priest examines a disease or scouts look over a land) (e:Siampipa in a natna ~ ding a/Moses in nasep khempeuh ~ a | Moses inspected all the work/Kadesh-barnea panin gam ~ dingin ka sawl lai-in | when I sent them from Kadesh Barnea to look over the land/inn ~ dingin siampipa pai ding hi | the priest shall go to inspect the house) (s:entel/kantel) (r:3.13.50/4.32.8/2.39.43/3.14.36) (q:draft)
