veng = (t:v) (w:cease/stop/pass away/depart) (d:of a plague, trouble or season, to come to an end and be gone) (e:Phalbi ~ ta a, guahzu nawn lo hi/Israel tung panin gimna ~ hi | the plague on Israel stopped/Na lungkhamnate ~ ding a | your troubles will pass/namsau tawh kidona ~ ngei lo ding hi | fighting with the sword will never cease/Moses hangin kahna leh thuumna ~ hi | the weeping and mourning for Moses ended) (r:22.2.11/4.16.48/10.24.25/18.11.16/10.12.10/5.34.8) (q:draft)
