vialte = (t:n) (w:those who keep saying) (d:vial after ci say, of mocking speech, with the plural te: those who say it tauntingly; exact force of vial not confirmed) (e:hong ci ~ zahhuaina tawh maikhingsak in) (b:vial) (r:19.40.15) (q:draft, low confidence)
