vomsak = (t:v) (w:make black/blacken) (d:vom black with the causative sak) (e:a kangsa ~ thei loin) (a:paaksak) (b:vom) (r:40.5.36) (q:draft)
vomte = (t:n) (c:animal) (w:bears) (d:vom bear with the plural suffix -te) (e:humpinelkai leh ~ that khin ngei) (b:vom) (r:9.17.36) (q:draft)
vomte = (t:adj) (w:black/dark-colored) (d:the black ones, the colour word vom black with plural -te, placed after the noun it describes) (e:Sakol ~ in a kaih leeng/Laban’ tuuhon sunga a ~ khempeuh’ | all the dark ones in the flock of Laban) (a:kangte) (b:vom) (r:38.6.6/1.30.40) (q:draft)
vot = (t:adj) (w:cold/cool) (d:cold or cool; a vot is the cold, the opposite of a sa, the heat) (e:zan-in a ~ in hong tawp a/a ~ leh a sa | cold and heat/an lak hun-a tuikhal ~ tawh kibang a | he is like cold snow at harvest time/~ lah ~ lo, sa lah sa lo | neither cold nor hot) (s:khuavot) (a:sa/lum) (r:1.31.40/1.8.22/20.25.13/66.3.15) (q:draft)
votna = (t:n) (w:cold/coldness/coolness) (d:vot, cold, with the noun suffix na: cold or coolness; inndei a votna is the cool room) (e:tua a ~ kua in thuak zo ding/inndei a ~ sungah amah guak tu-in | sitting alone in the cool room) (s:khuadam) (a:lumna) (b:vot) (r:19.147.17/7.3.20) (q:draft)
votsak = (t:v) (w:cool/make cool) (d:vot, cold, with the causative sak: make something cool, as water cools the tongue or shade lessens heat) (e:ka lei hong ~ nadingin/meii liim in nisa a ~ bangin | as the shadow of a cloud cools the heat) (a:luumsak) (b:vot) (r:42.16.24/23.25.5) (q:draft)
vu = (t:n) (w:ashes/ash) (d:ashes left after burning; bawngla vu is the ashes of the heifer; the usual spelling is vut) (e:bawngla ~ khawmin) (s:vut) (r:4.19.9) (q:draft, low confidence)
