vuh = (t:v) (w:cover/cover over) (d:of dust or earth, cover something poured on the ground) (e:leivui in a ~ theih nading) (s:vuk/khuh) (r:26.24.7) (q:draft)
vuhlet = (t:v) (w:break through/dig through/make an opening in) (d:open up a roof by breaking through its covering) (e:innkhum a ~ khit uh ciangin/ama omna tungsan innkhum a ~ khit uh ciangin | after they broke through the roof above where he was) (s:sulet) (r:42.5.19/41.2.4) (q:draft)
vuhsak = (t:v) (w:pierce/bore through) (d:pierce or bore through; said of a master who pierces the ear of his servant with an awl, phimpi) (e:phimpi khat tawh ama bil ~ ding) (s:vut) (r:2.21.6) (q:draft)
