vuih = (t:v) (w:form heads/come into ear) (d:of grain, put out ears or heads) (e:mangbuhhamte a ~ laitak hi a/Taang po a, hong ~ khit ciangin | when the wheat had sprouted and formed heads) (r:2.9.31/40.13.26) (q:draft)
vuikhawm = (t:v) (w:bury together/bury with) (d:vui, bury, with khawm, together: bury someone with others in the same tomb) (e:Judah kumpite tawh ~ lo uh hi/han sungah ka pate tawh hong ~ un | bury me with my fathers in the tomb) (b:vui) (r:14.28.27/1.49.29) (q:draft)
