vuina = (t:n) (w:burial/burying) (d:vui, bury, with the noun suffix na: the act of burying, a burial; vuina mun is the place of burial) (e:a luang ~ mun a mu uh hi/note’ lakah ~ ding mun leitang hong pia un | give me land among you for a burial place/lim tak-a ~ a ngah kei leh | if he does not receive a proper burial/mi khempeuh in misi ~-ah huh ding uh a | all the people will help in burying the dead) (s:kivuina) (b:vui) (r:41.15.47/1.23.4/21.6.3/26.39.13) (q:draft)
