vundawn = (t:n) (w:foreskin) (d:vun, skin, with dawn, tip) (e:Filistia-te’ ~ za khatin ka leisa/Filistiate’ ~ zakhat cih simloh | nothing but a hundred Philistine foreskins) (s:zangteep) (r:10.3.14/9.18.25) (q:draft)
