vutvang = (t:v) (w:bore a hole in/pierce) (d:vut, pierce, with vang, hole: make a hole through something, here the lid of a chest) (e:khat la-in a siin ~ a) (r:12.12.9) (q:draft)
vuuk = (t:n) (w:snow) (d:snow; a spelling with a long vowel of vuk) (e:guahtui leh ~ hong pai-in/a puan zong ~ bangin a paak hi | his clothes were white as snow/~ bangin hong ngo ding hi | they shall be white as snow) (s:vuk) (r:23.55.10/40.28.3/23.1.18) (q:draft)
