za = (t:n) (w:title/rank/office) (d:the title, rank or office held by a person; a za lian is of high rank) (e:Nasepna ~ atuam atuam a om/gam sungah a ~ lian thumna-in ka koih ding | I will make him the third highest in rank in the kingdom/a ~ liansak a | he raised him to high rank) (r:46.12.5/27.5.7/27.2.48) of position, job
