zaam = (t:v) (w:spread/climb/creep) (d:of a vine or its branches, grow out along or over something) (e:a hiangte kulh tungah ~ hi/A hiangte pen muvanlai lamah ~ a | its branches spread toward the eagle/a ~ zeizai a hiangte heuhkhia ding hi | he will cut away the spreading branches/Jazer khua dongah na ~ suak hi | you spread as far as Jazer) (r:1.49.22/26.17.6/23.18.5/24.48.32) (q:draft)
zaamsak = (t:v) (w:make grow over/make spread over) (d:zaam, of a vine, spread or climb, with the causative sak: make a plant grow up over something) (e:umgui khat a tungah a ~ hi) (b:zaam) (r:32.4.6) (q:draft)
