zagui = (t:n) (w:hamstring/leg tendon) (d:the tendon at the back of an animal’s leg; zagui sattat and zagui atsat mean cut the hamstring of a horse or an ox so that it cannot run) (e:a sakolte uh a ~ na sattat ding a/amau’ sakolte uh a ~ sattat sakin | he had their horses hamstrung/amaute in bawngtalte ~ sattat uh hi | they hamstrung oxen/leengkai sakol khempeuh a ~ atsat a | he hamstrung all the chariot horses) (r:6.11.6/10.8.4/6.11.9/1.49.6) (q:draft)
