zawlmitin = (t:v) (w:eyeing with desire/lusting after) (d:zawlmit, look at someone with desire, with the linking ending in: looking with desire at another man's wife) (e:Ka vengte’ zi ~/Ka vengte’ zi ~, a kong gei-ah ngakin | eyeing my neighbour's wife and waiting at his door) (r:18.31.9) (q:draft, low confidence)
zawlmitna = (t:n) (w:alluring glance/captivating look) (d:zawlmit, look at someone with desire, with the noun suffix na: an enticing look of the eyes) (e:amau’ hong ~ khenglah kei in) (r:20.6.25) (q:draft, low confidence)
zawlpeek = (t:n) (w:rim/frame/border) (d:zawl, rim, with peek, flat piece: the flat rim or frame round the top of the table) (e:a ~ gei-ah a kualte om ding hi/khut peek cia a zai ~ khat | a rim a handbreadth wide) (s:zawl) (r:2.25.27/2.25.25) (q:draft)
zawlta = (t:adj) (w:fatherless/illegitimate) (d:born outside marriage, of a woman who is not the wife of the father) (e:amah pen ~ ahi hi | he was an illegitimate son/nang pen numei dang tawh ~ na hi lel hi | you are only the son of another woman) (r:7.11.1/7.11.2)
zawlta = (t:n) (w:illegitimate/illegitimate child) (d:a child born outside marriage, not a true son or daughter) (e:Kote in ~ ka hi kei uh hi/midangte tawh ~ nei uh hi | they have had illegitimate children by others/~ na hi ding uh hi | you are illegitimate children) (r:43.8.41/58.12.8/28.5.7)
zawltai = (t:v) (w:run away together/elope) (d:said by a woman to her lover in zawltai ni, let us run off together; from zawl, lover, and tai, run) (e:Hong kai inla ~ ni) (r:22.1.4) (q:draft, low confidence)
zawlte = (t:n) (w:poles/bars/rods) (d:zawl, pole or bar, with the plural te: the carrying poles of the ark, the table and the altar, and the bars of a city gate) (e:Amah in singkha sing ~ bawl a/tecipan’na singkuang a ~ leh hehpihna tokhom tawh | the ark of the covenant law with its poles and the atonement cover/na kulh kongpi ~ tosak a | he strengthens the bars of your gates/sabuai a ~ leh a nazatte khempeuh tawh | the table with its poles and all its articles) (s:singzawlte) (r:2.37.4/2.39.35/19.147.13/2.35.13) (q:draft)
