zawngpi = (t:n) (c:animal) (w:baboon/ape) (d:large kind of monkey, brought by the ships of Tarshish together with zawngmaw) (e:zawngmaw, leh ~ hong puak zel hi) (r:14.9.21) (q:draft, low confidence)
