zawngsakin = (t:v) (w:making poor/impoverishing) (d:zawngsak, make poor, with the linking suffix in: making poor, and then another action follows) (e:Topa in ~ hausak a) (a:hausakin) (b:zawngsak) (r:9.2.7) (q:draft)
zawngte = (t:n) (w:the poor/poor people) (d:zawng, poor, with the plural te: poor people, usually as mi zawngte or a zawngte) (e:gamsung mi ~ a susia gawp mite aw/mi ~ a thupha a hawm zo hi | he has given his gifts to the poor/A ~ a simmawhpa in | whoever mocks the poor/a ~ in tawmzaw pia lo ding hi | the poor shall not give less) (s:mizawngte/cimawhte) (a:haute/mihaute) (b:zawng) (r:30.8.4/47.9.9/20.17.5/2.30.15) (q:draft)
