zawnna = (t:n) (w:poverty/destitution) (d:zawn, be poor, with the noun suffix na: the state of being poor) (e:i tungah ~ hong tung a/Thadahna in ~ hi a | laziness brings poverty/~ in mizawngte siasak hi | poverty ruins the poor/na neih khempeuh in ~ na ngah ding uh hi | all that you have will come to poverty) (s:khiukheuna/zawngkhalna) (a:hauhna) (b:zawn) (r:20.24.34/66.2.9/20.10.4/20.10.15/1.45.11) (q:draft)
