zawte = (t:part) (d:zaw, more, with the plural te, placed after a descriptive word or verb: those who are more so, as a vanglian zawte, the stronger ones, and a it zawte, those who love more) (e:a vanglian ~’ gamah hong paipihin/a thahat ~ Jakob’ aa ahi hi | the stronger ones were Jacob's/a tapa a tanu a it ~ in | those who love a son or daughter more/kei sanga khangno ~ in kei hong ciamnuih bawl | those younger than I make fun of me) (b:zaw) (r:5.4.38/40.10.37/1.30.42/18.30.1) (q:draft)
