zaza = (t:num) (w:hundreds/by hundreds) (d:za, hundred, said twice: by hundreds, in groups of a hundred each; often with tultul, by thousands) (e:a ~ a tultulin a pai laitakin/a tultul a ukte leh a ~ a ukte-in | as commanders of thousands and commanders of hundreds/a tultul leh a ~-a a ukte tung | to the commanders of thousands and of hundreds) (r:9.29.2/10.18.1/14.1.2) (q:draft)
