Zeeb = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Zeeb) (d:Midianite leader killed at the winepress of Zeeb in the time of Gideon, together with Oreb) (r:7.7.25/19.83.11)
zeekna = (t:n) (w:management/administration/handling) (d:the managing of property or money for another) (e:ka neihsate na ~ sazian a kimtakin/hih sum ka ~ uh tawh kisai-in | concerning the way we handle this money) (r:42.16.2/47.8.20) (q:draft)
zeekte = (t:see) <zeekte-in>
