zeel = (t:v) (w:spread through/fill/pervade) (d:of news or a scent, reach every part of a place; written with a long vowel, the same word as zel) (e:paknamtui in inn sung teng a ~ hi/A thu khempeuh in Siria gam teng ~ a | all the news about him spread through the whole of Syria) (s:kizeel/zel) (r:43.12.3/40.4.24) (q:draft)
zeel = (t:adv) (w:often/repeatedly/regularly) (d:placed after a verb for an action done time after time; written with a long vowel, the same word as zel) (e:an nek ka tang ~ uh hi) (s:zelzel/zel) (r:40.9.14) (q:draft)
zeelin = (t:adv) (w:often/repeatedly) (d:zeel often, with the linking suffix in) (e:an nek tang ~) (s:zelzel) (b:zeel) (r:42.5.33) (q:draft)
