zepnate = (t:n) (w:ornaments/decorations/overlays) (d:zepna, ornament, with the plural te; khuamlu zepnate are the decorated tops of the posts, overlaid with silver) (e:a khuamlu ~ leh a gaknate/a khuamlu ~ a kizutna zong ngun hi a | the overlay of their tops was also silver/a khuamlu ~ zut-in | overlaying the tops of the posts) (s:kizepnate) (b:zepna) (r:2.38.19/2.38.28/2.38.17) (q:draft)
