zeza = (t:adv) (w:quite/very) (d:expressive word placed after a descriptive word to strengthen it; mam zeza is quite straight, san zeza is bright red) (e:A khete uh mam ~ a/a san ~-in a kizut | painted bright red) (r:26.1.7/26.23.14) (q:draft, low confidence)
