zia = (t:n) (w:way/manner/conduct) (d:the way something is done, placed after a verb or verbal noun as in hih zia, way of doing) (e:amau’ nuntakna ~ va en in/na gamtat nading ~ kong gen zo hi | I have told you the way you should act/mi khempeuh’ nuntak ~ leh gamtatna tawh kizui-a | according to every person’s way of life and deeds/keima’ hihna ~ man lo ahi zenzen hiam | is my way really not right) (s:omdan/paizia/lampi) (r:20.6.6/26.18.29/20.4.11/24.17.10) (q:draft)
