ziahziah = (t:adv) (w:freely/generously/liberally) (d:placed after a verb of giving or spending: without holding back) (e:Mi pawlkhat in sum zang ~ napi-in/Topa’ tungah pia ~ uh a | they gave freely to the Lord) (s:zuahzuah) (r:20.11.24/13.29.9) (q:draft)
