ziat = (t:n) (w:right/right side/right hand) (d:the right as opposed to vei, the left; ziat lam is the right-hand side) (e:Pasian’ ~ lamah a ding ka mu hi/na ~ na vei vat gawp in | slash to your right and to your left/Pasian’ vangliatna ~ lamah a tu ding hi | he will sit at the right hand of the power of God/dikna galhiam ~ lam leh vei lamah | weapons of righteousness in the right hand and the left) (s:taklam/ziatlam) (a:veilam) (r:44.7.56/26.21.16/42.22.69/47.6.7) (q:draft)
