ziazuate = (t:n) (d:ziazua, expressive word for a rattling noise, with the plural te: sakol leeng ging ziazuate, the rattling chariots) (e:sakol leeng ging ~) (b:ziazua) (r:29.2.5) (q:draft, low confidence)
