ziing = (t:n) (w:deep darkness/gloom) (d:paired with khuamial, darkness: khuamial sung leh a ziing sung is darkness and the deepest gloom; written with a long vowel, the same word as zing) (e:khuamial sung leh a ~ sungah tu uh a/khuamial sung leh a ~ sung panin amaute lakhia a | he brought them out of darkness and deepest gloom) (s:khuazing/khuamialpi) (a:khuavak) (r:19.107.10/19.107.14) (q:draft)
